<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Lucha | Control y autorregulación de la fuerza</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f3f6fb;--surface:#ffffff;--surface2:#edf2f8;--line:#d8e1ec;--text:#203047;--muted:#60738a;--blue:#3478c5;--green:#16845c;--yellow:#9a6813;--red:#c33e58}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.52 Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:#0c1728;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:15px max(18px,calc((100% - 1220px)/2));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px}h1{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:0}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 12px}h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}main{max-width:1220px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 18px}.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:18px;margin:0 0 16px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:13px}.two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.four{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.between{justify-content:space-between}.stat{font-size:28px;font-weight:750}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:9px 0 4px}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#0a1729;color:var(--text);font:inherit}textarea{min-height:75px;resize:vertical}button{border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--blue);color:#081525;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line)}button.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid var(--line)}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.nav{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:15px 0}.nav button{background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}.nav button.active{background:var(--blue);color:#071525}.badge{display:inline-block;border-radius:30px;padding:3px 9px;background:#223953;color:#d8eaff;font-size:11px}.good{color:var(--green)}.caution{color:var(--yellow)}.bad{color:var(--red)}.notice{padding:12px;border-radius:9px;background:#172b45;color:#d5e9ff;margin:10px 0}.notice.warn{background:#382d18;color:#ffe9b0}.notice.error{background:#3b1d2a;color:#ffd8e1}.section{margin-top:14px}.table-scroll{overflow:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}th,td{text-align:left;padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:650;white-space:nowrap}.empty{color:var(--muted);padding:16px 4px}.hidden{display:none!important}.phase{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--line)}.phase strong{display:block;font-size:13px}.phase span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.bar{height:9px;background:#263750;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;min-width:100px}.bar>span{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--blue)}.form-actions{margin-top:12px}.pill{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.right{text-align:right}.footer{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);padding:10px 0 30px}.check{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.check input{width:auto}.loader{opacity:.65}
.actions-cell{white-space:nowrap;display:flex;gap:6px}.action-btn{padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px}.action-btn.edit{background:#203a57;color:#d9ecff;border:1px solid #3b5d80}.action-btn.delete{background:#49202d;color:#ffd9e1;border:1px solid #743448}
dialog.record-dialog{width:min(980px,calc(100% - 28px));max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:0;box-shadow:0 20px 80px #0009}dialog.record-dialog::backdrop{background:#020817cc;backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}.dialog-head{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--surface);padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}.dialog-body{padding:16px 18px}.dialog-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}.field-hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;grid-column:1 / -1}

.editor-preview{border:1px solid #d7e4f2;background:#f5f9fe;border-radius:11px;padding:12px;margin:0 0 14px}
.editor-preview-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:9px}
.editor-preview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px 12px}
.editor-preview-item{min-width:0;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid #e1eaf4;border-radius:8px;background:#fff}
.editor-preview-item span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#71849a;margin-bottom:2px}
.editor-preview-item strong{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#263b54}
.clear-existing{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:5px 0 0;color:#9a394b;font-size:11px}
.clear-existing input{width:auto;margin:0}
.editor-instructions{margin:0 0 12px}
.session-edit-group{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;margin:12px 0;background:var(--surface2)}
.session-edit-group h3{margin:0 0 7px}
.session-edit-preview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px;margin:9px 0 12px}
.session-edit-preview .editor-preview-item{background:var(--surface)}
.session-edit-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px 12px}
.session-edit-fields input,.session-edit-fields select,.session-edit-fields textarea{background:#fff;color:var(--text)}
.session-edit-fields textarea{min-height:65px}
.session-delete-choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--red);font-size:12px;margin-top:9px}
.session-delete-choice input{width:auto}
.age-preview{padding:8px 10px;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface2);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
@media(max-width:600px){.session-edit-preview,.session-edit-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

@media(max-width:560px){.editor-preview-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.full-span{grid-column:1/-1}.exercise-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.exercise-option{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;background:var(--surface2)}.exercise-option label{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--text);font-size:13px;margin:0}.exercise-option input{width:auto;margin-top:4px}.exercise-option p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:7px 0 0}.exercise-detail{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;margin:10px 0;background:#0e1a2b}.exercise-detail h3{margin-bottom:3px}.exercise-meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:3px 0 8px}.exercise-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}.exercise-fields input{padding:8px}.exercise-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;background:var(--surface)}.exercise-card h3{margin:0 0 5px}.exercise-card p{margin:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.exercise-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}.exercise-tag{font-size:11px;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:#20364f;color:#d5e9ff}.exercise-history{margin-top:12px}.ce-value{font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:700}.no-exercises{color:var(--muted);padding:12px;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:9px}
@media(max-width:760px){.exercise-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.exercise-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:800px){.grid,.two,.four{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}header{padding:13px 16px}}@media(max-width:560px){.grid,.two,.four{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding:0 12px;margin:15px auto}.card{padding:14px}h1{font-size:16px}}

.chart-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 0 16px}
.donut-card{margin:0;min-width:0}
.donut-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(145px,190px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;align-items:center}
.donut-svg{width:100%;max-width:190px;height:auto;display:block;margin:auto;overflow:visible}
.donut-total{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;fill:var(--text);text-anchor:middle}
.donut-caption{font-size:10px;fill:var(--muted);text-anchor:middle}
.donut-legend{display:grid;gap:9px;min-width:0}
.donut-legend-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:11px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:8px;align-items:start;font-size:12px}
.donut-swatch{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;margin-top:4px}
.donut-label{color:var(--muted);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.donut-value{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.donut-empty{border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:760px){.chart-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.donut-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,160px) minmax(0,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:420px){.donut-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.donut-svg{max-width:170px}}

/* Gráficos de barras para carga semanal y distribución por tipo de sesión */
.bar-chart-card{margin:0;min-width:0}
.horizontal-bars{display:grid;gap:11px;margin-top:14px}
.horizontal-bar-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,1.05fr) minmax(90px,2fr) minmax(78px,auto);gap:10px;align-items:center}
.horizontal-bar-label{font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--text);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.horizontal-bar-track{height:13px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8eef5;overflow:hidden;min-width:0}
.horizontal-bar-fill{height:100%;min-width:0;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#83b9eb,#3478c5)}
.horizontal-bar-fill.load{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#63c6a2,#16845c)}
.horizontal-bar-track.no-data{background:#f2f5f8;border:1px dashed #c8d3df}
.horizontal-bar-value{font-size:11px;font-weight:750;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.horizontal-bar-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:2px}
@media(max-width:560px){.horizontal-bar-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:5px 9px}.horizontal-bar-label{grid-column:1/-1}.horizontal-bar-track{grid-column:1;grid-row:2}.horizontal-bar-value{grid-column:2;grid-row:2}}


.compatibility-line{margin:7px 0 4px}.compat-badge{display:inline-block;border-radius:20px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:11px}.compat-badge.ok{background:#123629;color:#9ce9ca}.compat-badge.caution{background:#463817;color:#ffe3a1}.compat-badge.blocked{background:#4b202d;color:#ffd4de}.exercise-warning{border-color:#8a6230;background:#211f1b}.exercise-option input:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.field-hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;grid-column:1/-1}

.planner-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.planner-metric{background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px}
.planner-metric strong{font-size:22px;display:block}
.plan-exercise{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:12px;background:var(--surface2);margin:8px 0}
.plan-exercise label{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--text);font-size:13px;margin:0}
.plan-exercise input[type=checkbox]{width:auto;margin-top:4px}
.plan-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
.plan-fields input{padding:8px}
.plan-reason{border-left:3px solid var(--blue);padding:9px 12px;background:#12243a;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin:10px 0}
@media(max-width:760px){.planner-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.plan-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}

/* ACTUALIZACIÓN 7: tema claro y recursos demostrativos */
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}
header{background:#ffffff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(31,55,85,.06)}
input,select,textarea{background:#ffffff;color:var(--text);border-color:var(--line)}
input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:#8a9aab}
button.secondary{background:#eaf0f7;color:#263b54;border:1px solid #d5dfeb}
button.ghost{background:#ffffff;color:#2868ad;border:1px solid #d5dfeb}
.nav button{background:#eaf0f7;border-color:#d7e0eb;color:#52677f}
.nav button.active{background:#dbeafe;color:#174b84;border-color:#b9d3f3}
.badge{background:#e5effb;color:#285783}
.notice{background:#eaf3ff;color:#294b70;border:1px solid #d5e6fa}
.notice.warn{background:#fff6df;color:#77520d;border:1px solid #f1dfae}
.notice.error{background:#fff0f2;color:#8d2f44;border:1px solid #f0cbd2}
.phase{background:#f8fafd;border-color:#dce5ef}
.bar{background:#e5ebf2}
.pill{border-color:#d8e1ec;color:#60738a}
.exercise-detail{background:#f7f9fc;border-color:#dce5ef}
.exercise-card{background:#ffffff;border-color:#dce5ef}
.exercise-option{background:#f7f9fc;border-color:#dce5ef}
.exercise-tag{background:#e7f0fb;color:#315d88}
.exercise-tags .exercise-tag{border:1px solid #d7e5f5}
.exercise-warning{border-color:#e6c98a;background:#fffbf1}
.compat-badge.ok{background:#e3f6ed;color:#176545}
.compat-badge.caution{background:#fff3d5;color:#83580b}
.compat-badge.blocked{background:#fde9ed;color:#96364b}
.plan-exercise,.planner-metric{background:#f7f9fc;border-color:#dce5ef}
.plan-reason{background:#eaf3ff;color:#294b70}
.donut-empty{border-color:#d5dfeb}
.donut-caption{fill:#60738a}
.donut-total{fill:#203047}
dialog.record-dialog{background:#ffffff;color:var(--text);border-color:#d8e1ec;box-shadow:0 20px 70px rgba(25,45,70,.18)}
.dialog-head{background:#ffffff;border-bottom-color:#e2e8f0}
dialog.record-dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(28,43,62,.36);backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}
.action-btn.edit{background:#e6f0fc;color:#245889;border-color:#c8dcf4}
.action-btn.delete{background:#fde9ed;color:#96364b;border-color:#f3ccd5}
.demo-panel{margin-top:11px;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid #dbe5ef;border-radius:10px;background:#f8fafd}
.demo-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:7px}
.demo-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #cdddf0;border-radius:8px;background:#edf5ff;color:#245a91;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:650}
.demo-link:hover{background:#e1efff}
.demo-preview{display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:220px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px;margin-top:9px;background:#e7edf5}
.demo-config{margin-top:9px;border-top:1px dashed #d5dfeb;padding-top:8px}
.demo-config summary{cursor:pointer;color:#315d88;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.demo-config-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
.demo-config input,.demo-config select{font-size:12px;padding:8px}
.demo-config button{font-size:12px;padding:8px 11px}
@media(max-width:520px){.demo-config-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}


/* ACTUALIZACION 8: calendario, workout stats e informe imprimible */
.dashboard-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(320px,.85fr);gap:15px;margin:0 0 16px}
.dashboard-stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.dashboard-stat{background:#f7f9fc;border:1px solid #dce5ef;border-radius:12px;padding:13px;min-width:0}
.dashboard-stat .kpi{font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;color:#244767;margin:5px 0}
.dashboard-stat .label{font-size:11px;color:#6b7d91}
.dashboard-stat .detail{font-size:11px;color:#7c8da1}
.calendar-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:10px 0 13px}
.calendar-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;text-transform:capitalize}
.calendar-nav{display:flex;gap:6px}
.calendar-nav button{padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px}
.calendar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}
.calendar-weekday{text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#71839a;font-weight:700;padding:4px 0}
.calendar-day{min-height:68px;border:1px solid #dfe7f0;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:#31455e;padding:6px 4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:4px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;min-width:0}
.calendar-day:hover{border-color:#7ba9d8;background:#f5f9ff}
.calendar-day.is-today{outline:2px solid #8bb9ed;outline-offset:-2px}
.calendar-day.is-selected{background:#e7f1ff;border-color:#5c96d1}
.calendar-day.is-outside{background:#f6f8fb;color:#aab5c2;border-style:dashed}
.calendar-day .day-num{font-size:12px}
.calendar-day .event-count{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#71839a;line-height:1.2}
.calendar-dots{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:auto}
.calendar-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}
.calendar-dot.done{background:#3478c5}.calendar-dot.plan{background:#e5a52e}
.calendar-legend{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0;font-size:11px;color:#6b7d91}
.calendar-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.calendar-day-detail{border-top:1px solid #e2e9f1;margin-top:12px;padding-top:11px}
.calendar-event{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf1f6;font-size:12px}
.calendar-event:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.calendar-status{font-size:10px;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap}
.calendar-status.done{background:#e6f1ff;color:#275f98}.calendar-status.plan{background:#fff4d9;color:#8a5a09}
.weekly-bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;height:130px;padding:12px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5ef}
.weekly-bars.horizontal-bars{display:grid;align-items:stretch;height:auto;gap:11px;padding:12px 0 0;border-bottom:0}
.weekly-bar-col{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%;gap:5px}
.weekly-bar-value{font-size:9px;color:#73859a;white-space:nowrap}
.weekly-bar{width:min(26px,80%);border-radius:6px 6px 2px 2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#76aee5,#3478c5);min-height:3px}
.weekly-bar.empty{background:#e9eef4;border:1px dashed #b9c7d6}
.weekly-bar-label{font-size:10px;color:#6b7d91}
.dashboard-note{font-size:11px;color:#7a8da2;line-height:1.45;margin-top:10px}
.report-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 14px}
.report-button{background:#285f98;color:#fff}
@media(max-width:850px){.dashboard-split{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.calendar-day{min-height:54px;padding:5px 3px}.calendar-day .event-count{font-size:8px}.dashboard-stat-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.weekly-bars{gap:4px}.weekly-bars.horizontal-bars{gap:11px}}

</style>

<style id="performance-redesign">
:root{--bg:#f2f5fa;--surface:#fff;--surface2:#f4f7fb;--line:#e1e7ef;--text:#1b2d43;--muted:#718197;--blue:#2869a8;--green:#16845c;--yellow:#a56d16;--red:#bb4057;--nav:#142b45;--nav2:#1b3859;--shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(27,48,74,.055)}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.002em}header.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;min-height:76px;padding:12px clamp(16px,3vw,42px);background:#fff;color:var(--text);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(20,43,69,.035)}.topbar-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.brand-mark{width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#163452,#3178b9);color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;box-shadow:0 7px 16px rgba(40,105,168,.2)}.topbar-brand h1{color:#172d46;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.09em}.topbar-brand h1 span{color:#3178b9}.topbar-brand .sub{color:#77879b;margin-top:1px}.topbar-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.top-user{font-weight:650;color:#596b80}.theme-toggle{width:38px;height:38px;padding:0;border-radius:11px;font-size:18px;line-height:1}.topbar #logout{padding:9px 13px}
main{max-width:none;margin:0;padding:0 0 18px}#connection,#auth{width:min(1060px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:34px auto;padding:26px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}#application{width:100%;max-width:1640px;margin:0 auto}.app-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:248px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:calc(100vh - 76px);align-items:stretch}.sidebar{position:sticky;top:76px;height:calc(100vh - 76px);min-height:600px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:22px 14px 16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#142b45 0%,#10243a 100%);color:#e6eef8;overflow-y:auto}.sidebar-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:4px 10px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}.side-mark{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#3f8bc9,#2869a8);box-shadow:none}.sidebar-brand strong,.sidebar-brand span{display:block}.sidebar-brand strong{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em}.sidebar-brand span{font-size:10px;color:#9db2c8;letter-spacing:.13em;margin-top:2px}.sidebar-caption{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#8099b2;letter-spacing:.13em;padding:21px 10px 8px}.nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:16px;margin:0;min-width:0}.nav-group{display:grid;gap:4px}.nav-group-label{padding:2px 10px 6px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;color:#8099b2}.nav-item{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-align:left;padding:10px 11px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:#bdcbd9;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;transition:background .18s ease,color .18s ease,transform .18s ease;position:relative}.nav-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.075);color:#fff;transform:translateX(2px)}.nav-item.active{background:#21496f;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(123,178,226,.15);box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 #6eb2e5}.nav-glyph{display:grid;place-items:center;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);color:#a9c9e6;font-size:16px;line-height:1;flex:0 0 22px}.nav-item.active .nav-glyph{background:#326c9f;color:#fff}.nav-active-mark{display:none}.sidebar-bottom{margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:16px 9px 5px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#dce8f4}.sidebar-bottom strong,.sidebar-bottom span:not(.status-dot){display:block}.sidebar-bottom strong{font-size:11px}.sidebar-bottom span:not(.status-dot){font-size:10px;color:#8fa6bd;margin-top:2px}.status-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#49c49a;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(73,196,154,.12);flex:0 0 auto}
.workspace{min-width:0;padding:26px clamp(16px,2.5vw,38px) 30px}.workspace-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 2px 17px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e9f0}.workspace-heading h2{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:3px 0 1px;color:#1a304a}.workspace-heading .muted{font-size:12px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:850;color:#6e8299}.workspace-controls{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.athlete-picker{min-width:230px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent}.athlete-picker label{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:750;color:#718197}.athlete-picker select{min-width:220px;padding:9px 34px 9px 11px;background:#fff;border-color:#dbe4ed}.cycle-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #dae5ef;border-radius:10px;background:#f8fbfe;color:#54718e;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em}.phase-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:17px 0 20px}.phase{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:70px;padding:12px 14px 11px 16px;border:1px solid #e2e9f1;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(27,48,74,.025)}.phase:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:#8bb2d6}.phase:nth-child(2):before{background:#4e8fc5}.phase:nth-child(3):before{background:#2772a9}.phase:nth-child(4):before{background:#2c9b79}.phase strong{font-size:12px;color:#263f59}.phase span{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:10px;color:#8291a3}.content-view{min-height:360px}.content-view>.card,.content-view>.chart-grid,.content-view>.dashboard-split{animation:rise-in .24s ease both}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid #e2e9f1;border-radius:17px;padding:21px;margin:0 0 17px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:box-shadow .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}.card:hover{border-color:#d6e2ed;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(27,48,74,.07)}.card h2{font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#203852;margin:0 0 11px}.card h3{color:#263e58}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin-bottom:17px}.section-heading h2{margin:3px 0 2px}.section-heading p{margin:4px 0 0}.soft-badge{background:#edf4fa;color:#52718f;border:1px solid #dfe9f2}.badge{background:#eaf2f9;color:#315f87;font-weight:750}.notice{background:#edf5fc;color:#385a79;border:1px solid #dbe9f5;border-left:3px solid #4d8fc4;border-radius:9px}.notice.warn{background:#fff7e8;color:#805817;border-color:#f0dfbd;border-left-color:#d39a36}.notice.error{background:#fff0f2;color:#94384c;border-color:#f1d4dc;border-left-color:#c14d66}.small,.muted{color:#78899d}.stat{color:#1c4166;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}label{font-weight:650;color:#657991}input,select,textarea{background:#fff;color:#21364e;border:1px solid #d8e2ec;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 12px;transition:border-color .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease}input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:#4a8bc2;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(56,126,185,.13)}textarea{min-height:88px}button{border-radius:9px;background:#2869a8;color:#fff;transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,background .15s ease}button:hover{box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(40,105,168,.16);transform:translateY(-1px)}button:active{transform:translateY(0)}button.secondary{background:#f2f6fa;color:#36546f;border:1px solid #dce5ee}button.ghost{background:transparent;color:#2869a8;border:1px solid #dce5ee}.form-card{border-top:3px solid #4c8fc4}.form-card .form-grid{gap:13px 17px}.form-card .form-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #edf1f5;margin-top:18px}.field-hint{padding:11px 13px;border-radius:9px;background:#f2f7fb;border:1px solid #e3edf5;color:#647c95;line-height:1.5}.form-step{font-size:10px;font-weight:750;color:#65829c;background:#f1f6fa;border:1px solid #e0eaf2;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 10px;white-space:nowrap}.form-card form>div>div>label{font-size:11px}.form-card .exercise-detail{background:#f6f9fc;color:#233951;border-color:#dce6ef}.form-card .exercise-detail h3{color:#274a6b}.form-card .exercise-tag{background:#e8f1f8;color:#315f87}.form-card .exercise-meta{color:#778ba0}
.overview-kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:15px 0}.overview-kpi{position:relative;min-width:0;padding:16px 16px 14px;border:1px solid #e4ebf2;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdff)}.overview-kpi:before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:15px;right:15px;height:2px;border-radius:2px;background:#6d9ec8}.overview-kpi .kpi-label{font-size:10px;color:#75869a;font-weight:700}.overview-kpi .kpi-value{font-size:27px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.05em;color:#1e4367;margin:5px 0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.overview-kpi .kpi-detail{font-size:10px;color:#8492a3;line-height:1.4}.athlete-hero{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:22px 24px;margin:0 0 16px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#132b46 0%,#1b4268 60%,#2a6595 100%);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(22,54,85,.14);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.athlete-hero:after{content:"LF";position:absolute;right:22px;top:-18px;font-size:110px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.1em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.055);pointer-events:none}.athlete-identity{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;position:relative;z-index:1}.athlete-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;width:58px;height:58px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:17px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.13);color:#fff;font-size:19px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.03em}.athlete-identity h2{margin:2px 0 1px;color:#fff;font-size:22px}.athlete-hero .eyebrow{color:#a9c9e4}.hero-subtitle{color:#d2e1ef;font-size:12px}.hero-tags{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;z-index:1}.hero-tags span{font-size:10px;color:#e1edf7;background:rgba(255,255,255,.11);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:20px;padding:7px 10px}.dashboard-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(350px,.92fr);gap:16px;align-items:stretch}.dashboard-split>.card,.dashboard-split>div>.card{height:100%}.dashboard-stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px;margin:14px 0}.dashboard-stat{padding:12px;border:1px solid #e5ecf3;border-radius:11px;background:#fbfdff}.dashboard-stat .label{font-size:10px;color:#77889c}.dashboard-stat .kpi{font-size:22px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#214a70;margin:3px 0}.dashboard-stat .detail{font-size:10px;color:#8a98a8}.dashboard-note{padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #edf1f5}.attention-card{border-left:3px solid #8eaecb}.attention-list{display:grid;gap:9px}.attention-item{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:9px;background:#f6f9fc;color:#566f89;font-size:11px}.attention-mark{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#d19a39;margin-top:5px;flex:0 0 auto}.athlete-details-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:15px 0}.detail-tile{padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid #e4ebf2;border-radius:11px;background:#fbfdff}.detail-tile span,.athlete-card-metrics span{display:block;color:#8291a2;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:4px}.detail-tile strong{font-size:13px;color:#29435e}.athlete-card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.athlete-list-card{padding:15px;border:1px solid #e1e9f1;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;transition:box-shadow .18s ease,transform .18s ease}.athlete-list-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 9px 22px rgba(27,48,74,.07)}.athlete-list-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.small-avatar{width:39px;height:39px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#244d72,#4c87b7);font-size:12px;flex:0 0 auto}.athlete-list-name{min-width:0;flex:1}.athlete-list-name strong,.athlete-list-name span{display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.athlete-list-name strong{font-size:13px;color:#203a55}.athlete-list-name span{font-size:10px;color:#8493a4}.account-state{font-size:9px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap}.account-state.linked{background:#e9f6f0;color:#227653}.account-state.unlinked{background:#f4f0e7;color:#8c6a29}.athlete-card-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px;margin:13px 0}.athlete-card-metrics strong{font-size:11px;color:#304a65}.athlete-card-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #edf1f5}.profile-hero{margin-top:2px}.session-history-grid{display:grid;gap:12px}.session-history-card{padding:17px;border:1px solid #e1e9f1;border-radius:15px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(27,48,74,.03);transition:border-color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease}.session-history-card:hover{border-color:#cbdceb;box-shadow:0 9px 22px rgba(27,48,74,.06)}.session-card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.session-date-line{font-size:10px;color:#8191a3;font-weight:700}.session-date-line span{font-weight:500}.session-card-head h3{font-size:15px;margin:4px 0 0;color:#213c58}.session-status{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap}.session-status.completed{background:#e9f6f0;color:#207752}.session-status.pending{background:#fff5e2;color:#93651c}.session-card-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin:14px 0}.session-card-metrics>div{padding:10px 11px;background:#f7f9fc;border-radius:9px}.session-card-metrics span,.session-exercise-side span{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#8795a5}.session-card-metrics strong{display:block;font-size:14px;color:#294967;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-top:2px}.session-exercises{border-top:1px solid #edf1f5;padding-top:10px}.session-exercises summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:750;color:#3b6e9b;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.session-exercises summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.session-exercises summary:before{content:"+";display:grid;place-items:center;width:19px;height:19px;border-radius:6px;background:#eaf2f9;color:#3975a6;font-size:14px}.session-exercises[open] summary:before{content:"−"}.session-exercise-list{display:grid;gap:5px;margin-top:10px}.session-exercise-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px;border-radius:9px;background:#f7f9fc}.exercise-index{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;background:#e7eff7;color:#3d6e98;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;flex:0 0 auto}.session-exercise-main{min-width:0;flex:1}.session-exercise-main strong,.session-exercise-main span,.session-exercise-side strong{display:block}.session-exercise-main strong{font-size:11px;color:#2b4560}.session-exercise-main span{font-size:10px;color:#8090a2}.session-exercise-side{text-align:right}.session-exercise-side strong{font-size:11px;color:#20815b}.exercise-note{padding:0 10px 5px 44px;margin:0;color:#7e8ea0;font-size:10px}.session-general-note{margin-top:10px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:9px;background:#f6f9fc}.session-general-note span{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:800;color:#8091a3}.session-general-note p{font-size:11px;color:#5f748b;margin:4px 0 0}.session-card-actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:13px;padding-top:11px;border-top:1px solid #edf1f5}.session-card-actions .actions-cell{margin-left:auto}
.chart-grid{gap:14px}.bar-chart-card,.donut-card{height:100%}.horizontal-bars{gap:13px}.horizontal-bar-track{height:11px;background:#edf2f7}.horizontal-bar-fill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#75a9d5,#2869a8)}.horizontal-bar-fill.load{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#79c5aa,#198660)}.horizontal-bar-value{color:#657b91}.donut-layout{gap:10px}.donut-svg circle{transition:stroke-dasharray .3s ease}.table-scroll{border:1px solid #e7edf3;border-radius:11px;background:#fff}table{font-size:12px}th{background:#f4f7fa;color:#6e8094;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.045em}th,td{padding:11px 12px}tbody tr:hover{background:#f8fbfd}.actions-cell{gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}.action-btn{font-size:10px;border-radius:7px}.action-btn.edit{background:#edf4fa;color:#2c6595;border:1px solid #d8e6f2}.action-btn.delete{background:#fff1f3;color:#ad4054;border:1px solid #efd5dc}.footer{max-width:1400px;margin:18px auto;padding:14px 20px 24px;text-align:center;color:#94a1b0}
.calendar-top button{border-radius:8px}.calendar-day{border-radius:8px;background:#fafcfe}.calendar-day.is-selected{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #4e8fc5;background:#edf5fc}.calendar-day.is-today .day-num{color:#2869a8;font-weight:900}.calendar-day .day-num{font-weight:700}.calendar-event{border-bottom-color:#edf1f5}.calendar-day-detail{border-top-color:#edf1f5}
.report-actions{margin-bottom:15px}.report-button{border-radius:10px;padding:11px 16px;background:#214f7b}
.record-dialog{box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(10,25,43,.25)!important}.dialog-head{border-bottom-color:#e8edf3}.editor-preview{background:#f5f9fd;border-color:#e0eaf3}.session-edit-group{background:#f7f9fc;border-color:#e2eaf2}.session-edit-fields input,.session-edit-fields select,.session-edit-fields textarea{background:#fff}
@keyframes rise-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(5px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@media(max-width:1180px){.app-shell{grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr)}.workspace{padding:22px 20px}.dashboard-split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.athlete-details-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media(max-width:900px){.app-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{position:relative;top:auto;height:auto;min-height:0;padding:12px 14px 10px}.sidebar-brand{padding:2px 6px 11px}.sidebar-caption,.sidebar-bottom{display:none}.nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px;margin-top:10px}.nav-group{display:contents}.nav-group-label{grid-column:1/-1;padding:7px 6px 2px}.nav-item{font-size:11px;padding:8px}.workspace{padding:19px 16px}.workspace-head{align-items:flex-start}}
@media(max-width:680px){header.topbar{min-height:66px;padding:9px 13px}.topbar-brand .sub{display:none}.topbar-brand h1{font-size:13px}.brand-mark{width:36px;height:36px}.top-user{display:none}.app-shell{min-height:calc(100vh - 66px)}.phase-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.phase{min-height:62px;padding:9px 10px 8px 13px}.phase strong{font-size:11px}.phase span{font-size:9px}.workspace{padding:15px 11px}.workspace-heading h2{font-size:21px}.workspace-controls{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.athlete-picker{flex:1;min-width:180px}.athlete-picker select{min-width:0}.cycle-badge{font-size:8px;padding:0 8px}.overview-kpi-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}.overview-kpi{padding:12px}.overview-kpi .kpi-value{font-size:23px}.athlete-card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.athlete-details-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.session-card-metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.session-exercise-row{align-items:flex-start}.session-exercise-side{min-width:54px}.card{padding:15px;border-radius:14px}.chart-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.horizontal-bar-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(100px,1fr) minmax(65px,1.5fr) minmax(65px,auto);gap:7px}.horizontal-bar-value{font-size:9px}.donut-layout{grid-template-columns:120px minmax(0,1fr)}.donut-legend-row{font-size:10px}#connection,#auth{padding:18px;margin:18px auto}}
@media(max-width:430px){.nav{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.nav-item{font-size:10px;gap:7px}.nav-glyph{width:19px;height:19px;flex-basis:19px}.workspace-head{gap:12px}.cycle-badge{display:none}.athlete-details-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.athlete-card-metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.athlete-card-metrics strong{font-size:10px}.session-card-head{gap:7px}.session-card-head h3{font-size:13px}.donut-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.donut-svg{max-width:160px}.horizontal-bar-row{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.horizontal-bar-track{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2}.horizontal-bar-value{grid-column:2;grid-row:1}}
body.dark-theme{--bg:#101a28;--surface:#172538;--surface2:#1c2d42;--line:#2d4056;--text:#e2ebf4;--muted:#9aabbd;--shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.18);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}body.dark-theme header.topbar{background:#132238;color:#e7eef6;border-bottom-color:#2c4056}body.dark-theme .topbar-brand h1,body.dark-theme .workspace-heading h2,body.dark-theme .card h2,body.dark-theme .card h3{color:#e4edf7}body.dark-theme .topbar-brand .sub,body.dark-theme .top-user{color:#9aadc1}body.dark-theme .workspace-head{border-color:#2c4056}body.dark-theme .phase,body.dark-theme .card,body.dark-theme .overview-kpi,body.dark-theme .athlete-list-card,body.dark-theme .session-history-card{background:var(--surface);border-color:#2d4056;color:var(--text)}body.dark-theme .phase strong,body.dark-theme .detail-tile strong,body.dark-theme .athlete-list-name strong,body.dark-theme .athlete-card-metrics strong,body.dark-theme .session-card-head h3,body.dark-theme .session-card-metrics strong,body.dark-theme .session-exercise-main strong{color:#dce8f4}body.dark-theme .phase span,body.dark-theme .small,body.dark-theme .muted{color:#9aabbd}body.dark-theme input,body.dark-theme select,body.dark-theme textarea,body.dark-theme .athlete-picker select{background:#102033;color:#e4edf7;border-color:#354b63}body.dark-theme .overview-kpi,body.dark-theme .dashboard-stat,body.dark-theme .detail-tile,body.dark-theme .session-card-metrics>div,body.dark-theme .session-exercise-row,body.dark-theme .session-general-note,body.dark-theme .attention-item{background:#1c3048;border-color:#314860}body.dark-theme .overview-kpi .kpi-value,body.dark-theme .dashboard-stat .kpi,body.dark-theme .stat{color:#91c4ed}body.dark-theme .overview-kpi .kpi-detail,body.dark-theme .dashboard-stat .label,body.dark-theme .dashboard-stat .detail,body.dark-theme .detail-tile span,body.dark-theme .athlete-card-metrics span,body.dark-theme .session-card-metrics span{color:#9aabbd}body.dark-theme .cycle-badge,body.dark-theme .form-step,body.dark-theme .soft-badge{background:#203a55;color:#c0d7ed;border-color:#35506c}body.dark-theme .notice{background:#1d3851;color:#d1e4f5;border-color:#36536f}body.dark-theme .notice.warn{background:#42371f;color:#f3dfb5;border-color:#66552e}body.dark-theme .notice.error{background:#432835;color:#f3cbd4;border-color:#704252}body.dark-theme .table-scroll{background:#172538;border-color:#2d4056}body.dark-theme th{background:#20344c;color:#adc0d3}body.dark-theme td{color:#d5e0eb;border-color:#2b3e53}body.dark-theme tbody tr:hover{background:#1e324a}body.dark-theme .action-btn.edit{background:#203d5a;color:#c6e0f5;border-color:#385673}body.dark-theme .action-btn.delete{background:#432835;color:#ffdce4;border-color:#704252}body.dark-theme .editor-preview,body.dark-theme .session-edit-group{background:#1c3048;border-color:#344a62}body.dark-theme .editor-preview-item{background:#182b40;border-color:#354a61}body.dark-theme .editor-preview-item strong{color:#dce8f4}body.dark-theme .session-edit-fields input,body.dark-theme .session-edit-fields select,body.dark-theme .session-edit-fields textarea{background:#102033;color:#e4edf7}body.dark-theme .field-hint{background:#1c3048;border-color:#344a62;color:#b2c4d6}body.dark-theme .form-card .exercise-detail{background:#1b3047;color:#e4edf7}body.dark-theme .form-card .exercise-tag{background:#29445f;color:#d1e4f4}body.dark-theme .calendar-day{background:#192c42;color:#dce8f4}body.dark-theme .calendar-day.is-selected{background:#244a6c}body.dark-theme .calendar-day-detail,body.dark-theme .calendar-event,body.dark-theme .session-exercises{border-color:#2e435a}body.dark-theme .horizontal-bar-track{background:#263b52}body.dark-theme .horizontal-bar-track.no-data{background:#1c2d42;border-color:#53667b}body.dark-theme .donut-total{fill:#e1eaf4}body.dark-theme .donut-caption{fill:#a9bacb}body.dark-theme button.secondary{background:#243a52;color:#d5e3f0;border-color:#3b526b}body.dark-theme .footer{color:#8194a9}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}
</style>

</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
 <div class="topbar-brand"><div class="brand-mark">LF</div><div><h1>LUCHA <span>PERFORMANCE</span></h1><div class="sub">Control de fuerza y autorregulación</div></div></div>
 <div class="topbar-actions"><span id="topUser" class="top-user small"></span><button id="themeToggle" class="theme-toggle secondary" type="button" aria-label="Cambiar tema" title="Cambiar tema">◐</button><button id="logout" class="secondary hidden">Salir</button></div>
</header>
<main>
<section id="connection" class="card"><h2>Conectar con la base de datos</h2><p class="muted">Esta configuración se realiza una sola vez por dispositivo. Introduce la dirección del proyecto Supabase y su clave pública Publishable.</p><div class="grid two"><div><label>Project URL</label><input id="projectUrl" placeholder="https://xxxxxxxx.supabase.co"></div><div><label>Publishable key</label><input id="publishableKey" placeholder="sb_publishable_..."></div></div><div class="row section"><button id="connectBtn">Conectar</button><button id="forgetConfig" class="ghost">Borrar configuración guardada</button><span id="connectionMsg" class="small"></span></div></section>
<section id="auth" class="card hidden"><div class="row between"><span class="small">Conexión actual con Supabase</span><button id="changeConnection" type="button" class="ghost">Cambiar conexión</button></div><div class="grid two"><form id="loginForm"><h2>Iniciar sesión</h2><label>Correo</label><input name="email" type="email" required><label>Contraseña</label><input name="password" type="password" required><div class="form-actions"><button>Ingresar</button></div></form><form id="signupForm"><h2>Crear cuenta nueva</h2><p class="small">El entrenador y los diez luchadores crean su cuenta desde aquí. Después, el administrador se habilita como entrenador y vincula el correo de cada deportista con su ficha.</p><label>Nombre completo</label><input name="full_name" required><label>Correo</label><input name="email" type="email" required><label>Contraseña (mínimo 8 caracteres)</label><input name="password" type="password" minlength="8" required><div class="form-actions"><button class="secondary">Crear cuenta</button></div></form></div><div id="authMsg" class="notice hidden"></div></section>
<section id="application" class="hidden">
 <div class="app-shell">
  <aside class="sidebar">
   <div class="sidebar-brand"><div class="brand-mark side-mark">LF</div><div><strong>LUCHA</strong><span>PERFORMANCE</span></div></div>
   <div class="sidebar-caption">PLATAFORMA DE SEGUIMIENTO</div>
   <nav id="navigation" class="nav" aria-label="Navegación principal"></nav>
   <div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="status-dot"></span><div><strong>Panel de entrenamiento</strong><span>Macrociclo de 8 semanas</span></div></div>
  </aside>
  <div class="workspace">
   <div class="workspace-head">
    <div class="workspace-heading"><div class="eyebrow">CENTRO DE CONTROL · LUCHA</div><h2 id="hello">Panel de seguimiento</h2><div id="roleDescription" class="muted"></div></div>
    <div class="workspace-controls"><div id="athletePicker" class="athlete-picker hidden"><label for="selectedAthlete">Deportista supervisado</label><select id="selectedAthlete"></select></div><span class="cycle-badge">MACROCICLO · 8 SEMANAS</span></div>
   </div>
   <div id="phaseStrip" class="phase-strip grid four section"></div>
   <div id="content" class="content-view"></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
<dialog id="recordEditor" class="record-dialog">
  <div class="dialog-head"><div><h2 id="recordEditorTitle">Editar registro</h2><div class="small">Los cambios se guardarán en Supabase.</div></div><button type="button" id="closeRecordEditor" class="secondary">Cerrar</button></div>
  <div class="dialog-body"><form id="recordEditForm"><div id="recordEditPreview"></div><p class="small editor-instructions">Los campos se abren con la información que ya está guardada. Déjalos como están para conservarla, modifica lo que necesites y marca “Borrar este dato” únicamente cuando quieras eliminar un dato opcional.</p><div id="recordEditFields" class="grid two"></div><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" id="cancelRecordEdit" class="secondary">Cancelar</button><button type="submit">Guardar cambios</button></div><div id="recordEditMessage" class="small"></div></form></div>
</dialog>
<div class="footer">Prototipo académico de control del entrenamiento. Las alertas de compatibilidad y carga orientan la revisión del entrenador; no diagnostican lesiones, no autorizan el retorno deportivo ni sustituyen la valoración del personal de salud.</div>
</main>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
<script>
'use strict';
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);let db=null,authUser=null,profile=null,athleteProfile=null,athletes=[],selectedId=null,tab='overview';
const phases=[['1–2','Adaptación','Familiarización y técnica'],['3–4','Aumento','Progresión condicionada'],['5–6','Punto álgido','Mayor estímulo planificado'],['7–8','Tapering','Reducción de volumen']];
const sessionTypes=[
 'Fuerza del tren inferior y tracción',
 'Fuerza del tren superior y control',
 'Potencia y fuerza específica',
 'Fuerza isométrica y agarres',
 'Fuerza-resistencia ante esfuerzos repetidos',
 'Fuerza general / sesión complementaria',
 'Sesión mixta de fuerza y lucha',
 'Trabajo técnico-táctico de lucha',
 'Combate simulado / sparring',
 'Situaciones específicas de combate',
 'Acondicionamiento específico de lucha',
 'Recuperación activa y movilidad',
 'Otra / personalizada'
];
const sessionTypesWithoutExerciseBank=['Trabajo técnico-táctico de lucha','Combate simulado / sparring','Situaciones específicas de combate','Acondicionamiento específico de lucha'];
function sessionUsesExerciseBank(type){return !sessionTypesWithoutExerciseBank.includes(type)}
let exerciseCatalog=[],selectedSessionExercises=new Map(),exerciseHistory=[],athleteInjuryContext=[];
let plannerState=null;
const injuryBodyAreas=['Tobillo','Pie','Rodilla','Muslo','Cadera / ingle','Pelvis','Columna lumbar','Espalda torácica','Hombro','Brazo','Codo','Antebrazo','Muñeca / mano / dedos','Cuello','Otra / no especificada'];
const injuryTypes=['Esguince','Distensión muscular','Desgarro muscular','Tendinopatía','Lesión ligamentaria','Luxación','Fractura','Contusión','Lesión meniscal','Lesión condral / cartilaginosa','Lesión muscular','Dolor lumbar','Dolor articular','Otra / diagnóstico específico'];
const injuryGrades=['No especificado','Grado I','Grado II','Grado III','No aplica'];
const injuryLateralities=['No especificada','Derecha','Izquierda','Bilateral','No aplica'];
const professionalGuidanceOptions=['No registrada','Pendiente de valoración','Con restricciones o adaptaciones indicadas','Autorización profesional para ejercicio adaptado registrada','Autorización profesional sin restricciones registrada'];
const esc=v=>String(v??'—').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
function note(id,text,type=''){const e=$(id);e.textContent=text;e.className='notice'+(type?' '+type:'')}
function activeAthleteId(){return profile?.role==='coach'?selectedId:athleteProfile?.id||null}
function calculateAge(birthDate,referenceDate=new Date()){
 if(!birthDate)return null;const parts=String(birthDate).slice(0,10).split('-').map(Number);if(parts.length!==3||parts.some(x=>!Number.isFinite(x))||!parts[0]||parts[1]<1||parts[1]>12||parts[2]<1||parts[2]>31)return null;
 const [year,month,day]=parts;const parsed=new Date(year,month-1,day);if(parsed.getFullYear()!==year||parsed.getMonth()+1!==month||parsed.getDate()!==day)return null;let age=referenceDate.getFullYear()-year;if(referenceDate.getMonth()+1<month||(referenceDate.getMonth()+1===month&&referenceDate.getDate()<day))age--;return age>=0?age:null;
}
function athleteAgeText(athlete,referenceDate=new Date()){const age=calculateAge(athlete?.birth_date,referenceDate);return age==null?'No registrada':`${age} años`}
function phaseName(w){return w<=2?'Adaptación':w<=4?'Aumento':w<=6?'Punto álgido':'Tapering'}
function renderPhases(){$('phaseStrip').innerHTML=phases.map(p=>`<div class="phase"><strong>Semanas ${p[0]} · ${p[1]}</strong><span>${p[2]}</span></div>`).join('')}
function normalizeProjectUrl(raw){
 const parsed=new URL(raw.trim());
 if(!['https:','http:'].includes(parsed.protocol))throw new Error('La Project URL debe comenzar por https://.');
 if(parsed.username||parsed.password||parsed.search||parsed.hash)throw new Error('La Project URL no debe contener usuario, contraseña, parámetros ni fragmentos.');
 if(parsed.pathname && parsed.pathname!=='/')throw new Error('Has copiado una URL con una ruta adicional. Debes usar solamente la Project URL raíz, por ejemplo https://tu-proyecto.supabase.co. No agregues /rest/v1, /auth/v1 ni rutas del Dashboard.');
 return parsed.origin;
}
function connect(url,key){if(!window.supabase){note('connectionMsg','No se pudo cargar Supabase JS. Revisa la conexión a internet.','error');return}try{url=normalizeProjectUrl(url)}catch(err){$('connection').classList.remove('hidden');$('auth').classList.add('hidden');note('connectionMsg',err.message,'error');return}db=window.supabase.createClient(url,key);$('connection').classList.add('hidden');$('auth').classList.remove('hidden');db.auth.getSession().then(({data,error})=>{if(error){note('authMsg',error.message,'error');return}if(data.session){authUser=data.session.user;loadApp()}})}
$('connectBtn').onclick=()=>{const k=$('publishableKey').value.trim();let u;try{u=normalizeProjectUrl($('projectUrl').value)}catch(err){note('connectionMsg',err.message,'error');return}if(!k){note('connectionMsg','Falta la clave pública Publishable.','error');return}localStorage.setItem('lucha_project_url',u);localStorage.setItem('lucha_publishable_key',k);connect(u,k)};
$('forgetConfig').onclick=()=>{localStorage.removeItem('lucha_project_url');localStorage.removeItem('lucha_publishable_key');$('projectUrl').value='';$('publishableKey').value='';note('connectionMsg','Configuración local borrada.')};
$('changeConnection').onclick=()=>{const u=localStorage.getItem('lucha_project_url')||'';const k=localStorage.getItem('lucha_publishable_key')||'';$('projectUrl').value=u;$('publishableKey').value=k;$('auth').classList.add('hidden');$('connection').classList.remove('hidden');note('connectionMsg','Revisa que la URL sea la Project URL raíz, sin /rest/v1 ni otras rutas.');};
function restoreConfig(){const u=localStorage.getItem('lucha_project_url'),k=localStorage.getItem('lucha_publishable_key');if(u&&k){$('projectUrl').value=u;$('publishableKey').value=k;try{normalizeProjectUrl(u);connect(u,k)}catch(err){$('connection').classList.remove('hidden');$('auth').classList.add('hidden');note('connectionMsg',err.message,'error')}}}
$('loginForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);const {data,error}=await db.auth.signInWithPassword({email:f.get('email'),password:f.get('password')});if(error){note('authMsg',error.message,'error');return}authUser=data.user;await loadApp()};
$('signupForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);const {data,error}=await db.auth.signUp({email:f.get('email'),password:f.get('password'),options:{data:{full_name:f.get('full_name')},emailRedirectTo:window.location.href}});if(error){note('authMsg',error.message,'error');return}if(data.session){authUser=data.user;await loadApp()}else{note('authMsg','Cuenta creada. Revisa el correo para confirmar la cuenta. Luego inicia sesión.')}};
$('logout').onclick=async()=>{await db.auth.signOut();location.reload()};
function setTheme(mode){document.body.classList.toggle('dark-theme',mode==='dark');localStorage.setItem('lucha_visual_theme',mode);const b=$('themeToggle');if(b){b.textContent=mode==='dark'?'☀':'◐';b.title=mode==='dark'?'Cambiar a tema claro':'Cambiar a tema oscuro';b.setAttribute('aria-label',b.title)}}
$('themeToggle').onclick=()=>setTheme(document.body.classList.contains('dark-theme')?'light':'dark');
setTheme(localStorage.getItem('lucha_visual_theme')||'light');

$('selectedAthlete').onchange=()=>{selectedId=$('selectedAthlete').value||null;render()};
async function loadApp(){const {data:p,error}=await db.from('profiles').select('id,full_name,role').eq('id',authUser.id).single();if(error){note('authMsg','No se pudo leer tu perfil. Confirma que ejecutaste el archivo SQL de instalación. '+error.message,'error');return}profile=p;
if(profile.role==='coach'){const {data:a,error:ae}=await db.from('athletes').select('*').order('full_name');if(ae){note('authMsg','Error al cargar deportistas: '+ae.message,'error');return}athletes=a||[];selectedId=athletes[0]?.id||null;$('athletePicker').classList.remove('hidden');$('selectedAthlete').innerHTML=athletes.map(a=>`<option value="${a.id}">${esc(a.full_name)} — ${esc(a.weight_category||'Sin categoría')} · ${esc(athleteAgeText(a))}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Todavía no hay perfiles vinculados</option>'}
else{const {data:a,error:ae}=await db.from('athletes').select('*').eq('user_id',authUser.id).maybeSingle();if(ae){note('authMsg',ae.message,'error');return}athleteProfile=a}
$('auth').classList.add('hidden');$('application').classList.remove('hidden');$('logout').classList.remove('hidden');$('topUser').textContent=profile.full_name||authUser.email;$('hello').textContent='Hola, '+(profile.full_name||'deportista');$('roleDescription').textContent=profile.role==='coach'?'Entrenador · Administración y seguimiento de deportistas':'Deportista · Registro y consulta de evolución';renderPhases();buildNav();render()}
function navGlyph(key){const icons={overview:'▦',athletes:'♙',profile:'◉',injuries:'✚',wellness:'⌁',sessions:'▤',exerciseBank:'◆',planner:'▣',tests:'◈',decisions:'✓',evaluation:'▥'};return `<span class="nav-glyph" aria-hidden="true">${icons[key]||'·'}</span>`}
function buildNav(){
 const groups=profile.role==='coach'?
  [['GENERAL',[['overview','Resumen'],['athletes','Deportistas']]],['SEGUIMIENTO',[['wellness','Bienestar'],['injuries','Lesiones']]],['ENTRENAMIENTO',[['sessions','Sesiones'],['exerciseBank','Banco de ejercicios'],['planner','Planificador diario']]],['EVALUACIÓN',[['tests','Pruebas físicas'],['decisions','Decisiones'],['evaluation','Evaluación']]]]:
  [['GENERAL',[['overview','Mi resumen'],['profile','Mi perfil']]],['SEGUIMIENTO',[['wellness','Bienestar'],['injuries','Mis lesiones']]],['ENTRENAMIENTO',[['sessions','Sesiones'],['exerciseBank','Banco de ejercicios']]],['EVALUACIÓN',[['tests','Pruebas físicas'],['decisions','Ajustes del entrenador'],['evaluation','Mi evolución']]]];
 $('navigation').innerHTML=groups.map(([label,items])=>`<div class="nav-group"><div class="nav-group-label">${label}</div>${items.map(([k,v])=>`<button type="button" data-tab="${k}" class="nav-item ${tab===k?'active':''}">${navGlyph(k)}<span>${v}</span>${tab===k?'<i class="nav-active-mark"></i>':''}</button>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');
 $('navigation').querySelectorAll('button[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{tab=b.dataset.tab;buildNav();render();if(window.innerWidth<900)$('content').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})});
}
function panel(title,body){return `<section class="card"><h2>${title}</h2>${body}</section>`}
function table(title,headers,items,project){return panel(title,`<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>${headers.map(h=>`<th>${h}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${items.length?items.map(r=>`<tr>${project(r).map(x=>`<td>${esc(x)}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="${headers.length}" class="empty">Aún no hay registros.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></div>`)}
const editableSchemas={
 athletes:{title:'ficha del deportista',fields:[
  {name:'full_name',label:'Nombre completo',type:'text',required:true},
  {name:'weight_category',label:'Categoría de peso',type:'text'},
  {name:'sex',label:'Sexo',type:'select',options:['Masculino','Femenino','No especificado']},
  {name:'birth_date',label:'Fecha de nacimiento (se utiliza para calcular la edad)',type:'date'},
  {name:'sport_experience_years',label:'Años de experiencia deportiva',type:'number',min:0,step:'0.5'},
  {name:'strength_experience',label:'Experiencia en fuerza',type:'select',options:['Inicial','Intermedia','Avanzada']},
  {name:'strength_days',label:'Días de fuerza por semana',type:'number',min:1,max:7},
  {name:'notes',label:'Observaciones',type:'textarea'}]},
 injuries:{title:'lesión',fields:[
  {name:'body_area',label:'Zona anatómica',type:'select',options:injuryBodyAreas,required:true},
  {name:'injury_type',label:'Tipo de lesión',type:'select',options:injuryTypes,required:true},
  {name:'injury_grade',label:'Grado / clasificación',type:'select',options:injuryGrades},
  {name:'laterality',label:'Lateralidad',type:'select',options:injuryLateralities},
  {name:'injury_detail',label:'Detalle anatómico / diagnóstico específico',type:'text'},
  {name:'onset_date',label:'Fecha de aparición',type:'date'},
  {name:'status',label:'Estado actual',type:'select',options:['Recuperada','En recuperación','Activa'],required:true},
  {name:'recovery_days',label:'Tiempo de recuperación (días)',type:'number',min:0},
  {name:'current_pain',label:'Dolor actual asociado (0–10)',type:'number',min:0,max:10},
  {name:'professional_guidance',label:'Orientación profesional registrada',type:'select',options:professionalGuidanceOptions},
  {name:'restrictions',label:'Restricciones indicadas por profesional',type:'textarea'},
  {name:'notes',label:'Tratamiento / observaciones',type:'textarea'}]},
 wellness_logs:{title:'registro de bienestar',fields:[
  {name:'log_date',label:'Fecha',type:'date',required:true},
  {name:'week',label:'Semana (1–8)',type:'number',min:1,max:8},
  {name:'fatigue',label:'Fatiga (1–10)',type:'number',min:1,max:10},
  {name:'sleep_quality',label:'Calidad del sueño (1–10)',type:'number',min:1,max:10},
  {name:'muscle_soreness',label:'Dolor muscular (1–10)',type:'number',min:1,max:10},
  {name:'pain_level',label:'Dolor o molestia (1–10)',type:'number',min:1,max:10},
  {name:'stress',label:'Estrés (1–10)',type:'number',min:1,max:10},
  {name:'motivation',label:'Motivación (1–10)',type:'number',min:1,max:10},
  {name:'notes',label:'Observaciones',type:'textarea'}]},
 training_session_exercises:{title:'registro de ejercicio',fields:[
  {name:'sets',label:'Series',type:'number',min:1,required:true},
  {name:'reps',label:'Repeticiones / segundos / metros por serie',type:'number',min:1,required:true},
  {name:'external_load_kg',label:'Carga externa (kg)',type:'number',min:0,step:'0.5'},
  {name:'reps_possible',label:'Repeticiones posibles',type:'number',min:1},
  {name:'exercise_rpe',label:'RPE del ejercicio (0–10)',type:'number',min:0,max:10,step:'0.5'},
  {name:'notes',label:'Observaciones',type:'textarea'}]},
 training_sessions:{title:'sesión de entrenamiento',fields:[
  {name:'session_status',label:'Estado de la sesión',type:'select',options:['Planificada','Realizada'],required:true},
  {name:'exercise_name',label:'Ejercicio principal (solo registros anteriores)',type:'text'},
  {name:'effort_character',label:'Carácter del esfuerzo del estímulo principal (solo registros anteriores)',type:'text'},
  {name:'session_date',label:'Fecha',type:'date',required:true},
  {name:'week',label:'Semana (1–8)',type:'number',min:1,max:8},
  {name:'session_type',label:'Tipo de sesión',type:'select',options:sessionTypes,required:true},
  {name:'duration_minutes',label:'Duración (min)',type:'number',min:1},
  {name:'session_rpe',label:'RPE global de sesión (0–10)',type:'number',min:0,max:10},
  {name:'sets',label:'Series del estímulo principal',type:'number',min:1},
  {name:'reps',label:'Repeticiones por serie del estímulo principal',type:'number',min:1},
  {name:'external_load_kg',label:'Carga externa del estímulo principal (kg)',type:'number',min:0,step:0.5},
  {name:'reps_possible',label:'Repeticiones posibles estimadas con esa carga',type:'number',min:1},
  {name:'notes',label:'Observaciones técnicas',type:'textarea'}]},
 physical_tests:{title:'prueba física',fields:[
  {name:'test_date',label:'Fecha',type:'date',required:true},
  {name:'week',label:'Semana (1–8)',type:'number',min:1,max:8},
  {name:'test_name',label:'Prueba',type:'select',options:['CMJ','SJ','DJ','Press banca','Sentadilla','Cargada','Sentadilla de arranque','Remo','Subida de lazo'],required:true},
  {name:'result_value',label:'Resultado',type:'number',step:'any',required:true},
  {name:'unit',label:'Unidad',type:'select',options:['cm','W','kg','repeticiones','segundos','metros']},
  {name:'notes',label:'Protocolo y observaciones',type:'textarea'}]},
 load_decisions:{title:'decisión del entrenador',fields:[
  {name:'decision_date',label:'Fecha',type:'date',required:true},
  {name:'week',label:'Semana (1–8)',type:'number',min:1,max:8},
  {name:'action',label:'Decisión',type:'select',options:['Mantener carga','Progresar repeticiones manteniendo CE','Aumentar carga externa conservando CE','Reducir volumen','Reducir intensidad / exigencia','Modificar o sustituir ejercicio','Sesión de recuperación','Suspender ejercicio y solicitar valoración'],required:true},
  {name:'rationale',label:'Justificación',type:'textarea',required:true}]}
};
function canManageRecord(tableName){if(tableName==='load_decisions')return profile?.role==='coach';if(tableName==='athletes')return profile?.role==='coach';return ['injuries','wellness_logs','training_sessions','training_session_exercises','physical_tests'].includes(tableName)}
function canDeleteRecord(tableName){return canManageRecord(tableName)&&tableName!=='athletes'}
function recordTable(title,headers,items,project,tableName){
 const manage=canManageRecord(tableName),deletable=canDeleteRecord(tableName);const allHeaders=manage?[...headers,'Acciones']:headers;
 const body=items.length?items.map(r=>`<tr>${project(r).map(x=>`<td>${esc(x)}</td>`).join('')}${manage?`<td><div class="actions-cell"><button type="button" class="action-btn edit" data-record-edit="${esc(tableName)}" data-record-id="${esc(r.id)}">${tableName==='athletes'?'Editar ficha':'Editar'}</button>${deletable?`<button type="button" class="action-btn delete" data-record-delete="${esc(tableName)}" data-record-id="${esc(r.id)}">Eliminar</button>`:''}</div></td>`:''}</tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="${allHeaders.length}" class="empty">Aún no hay registros.</td></tr>`;
 return panel(title,`<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>${allHeaders.map(h=>`<th>${h}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${body}</tbody></table></div>`)
}
function editorDisplayValue(value){return value==null||value===''?'Sin dato':String(value)}
function editorPreview(schema,data){const rows=schema.fields.map(f=>`<div class="editor-preview-item"><span>${esc(f.label)}</span><strong>${esc(editorDisplayValue(data[f.name]))}</strong></div>`);if(schema===editableSchemas.athletes)rows.splice(4,0,`<div class="editor-preview-item"><span>Edad actual calculada</span><strong>${esc(athleteAgeText(data))}</strong></div>`);return `<section class="editor-preview"><div class="editor-preview-head"><div><strong>Vista previa de la información guardada</strong><div class="small">Estos son los valores que existen antes de editar.</div></div><button type="button" id="restoreRecordEdit" class="secondary action-btn">Restaurar valores originales</button></div><div class="editor-preview-grid">${rows.join('')}</div></section>`}
function editorField(def,value){const v=value==null?'':String(value);const req=def.required?'required':'';let control='';if(def.type==='textarea')control=`<textarea name="${esc(def.name)}" ${req}>${esc(v)}</textarea>`;else if(def.type==='select'){const placeholder=def.required?`<option value="" ${v===''?'selected':''} disabled>Selecciona una opción</option>`:`<option value="" ${v===''?'selected':''}>Sin dato</option>`;const optionList=[...(def.options||[])];if(v&&!optionList.includes(v))optionList.unshift(v);const opts=optionList.map(o=>`<option value="${esc(o)}" ${String(o)===v?'selected':''}>${esc(o)}</option>`).join('');control=`<select name="${esc(def.name)}" ${req}>${placeholder}${opts}</select>`}else{const attrs=[def.min!=null?`min="${def.min}"`:'',def.max!=null?`max="${def.max}"`:'',def.step?`step="${def.step}"`:''].filter(Boolean).join(' ');control=`<input name="${esc(def.name)}" type="${def.type}" value="${esc(v)}" ${attrs} ${req}>`}const clearControl=!def.required&&v!==''?`<label class="clear-existing"><input type="checkbox" name="__clear_${esc(def.name)}"> Borrar este dato al guardar</label>`:'';return `<div><label>${esc(def.label)}</label>${control}${clearControl}</div>`}
function restoreEditorOriginal(){const form=$('recordEditForm');let original={};try{original=JSON.parse(form.dataset.original||'{}')}catch{}const schema=editableSchemas[form.dataset.table];if(!schema)return;for(const field of schema.fields){const control=Array.from(form.elements).find(el=>el.name===field.name);if(control)control.value=original[field.name]==null?'':String(original[field.name]);const clear=Array.from(form.elements).find(el=>el.name==='__clear_'+field.name);if(clear)clear.checked=false;}if(form.dataset.table==='training_sessions'){let children=[];try{children=JSON.parse(form.dataset.children||'[]')}catch{}for(const row of children){for(const key of ['dose_unit','sets','reps','external_load_kg','reps_possible','exercise_rpe','notes']){const name=`child__${row.id}__${key}`,control=Array.from(form.elements).find(el=>el.name===name);if(control)control.value=row[key]==null?'':String(row[key]);const clear=Array.from(form.elements).find(el=>el.name===`__clear_${name}`);if(clear)clear.checked=false;}const remove=Array.from(form.elements).find(el=>el.name===`__delete_child_${row.id}`);if(remove)remove.checked=false;}}}
async function openRecordEditor(tableName,id){if(!canManageRecord(tableName)){alert('No tienes permisos para editar este tipo de registro.');return}if(tableName==='training_sessions'){await openSessionEditor(id);return}const schema=editableSchemas[tableName];if(!schema)return;const {data,error}=await db.from(tableName).select('*').eq('id',id).single();if(error){alert('No se pudo consultar el registro: '+error.message);return}const dialog=$('recordEditor'),form=$('recordEditForm');$('recordEditorTitle').textContent=tableName==='athletes'?'Editar ficha del deportista':'Editar '+schema.title;$('recordEditMessage').textContent='';form.dataset.original=JSON.stringify(data);form.dataset.children='[]';form.dataset.customSessionEditor='';$('recordEditPreview').innerHTML=editorPreview(schema,data);$('recordEditFields').innerHTML=schema.fields.map(f=>editorField(f,data[f.name])).join('');form.dataset.table=tableName;form.dataset.id=id;$('restoreRecordEdit').onclick=restoreEditorOriginal;if(tableName==='athletes'){const birth=Array.from(form.elements).find(el=>el.name==='birth_date');if(birth){const updateAge=()=>{const age=calculateAge(birth.value);const host=$('recordEditAgePreview');if(host)host.textContent=age==null?'Edad calculada: ingresa una fecha de nacimiento válida.':`Edad calculada: ${age} años`;};const box=document.createElement('div');box.id='recordEditAgePreview';box.className='age-preview full-span';birth.parentElement.appendChild(box);birth.addEventListener('input',updateAge);birth.addEventListener('change',updateAge);updateAge();}}dialog.showModal()}
function sessionChildPreviewValue(row,key){const v=row[key];if(v==null||v==='')return 'Sin dato';if(key==='external_load_kg')return `${v} kg`;return String(v)}
function sessionChildEditorMarkup(row,index){
 const exerciseName=row.exercise_catalog?.name||row.exercise_name||`Ejercicio ${index+1}`;
 const unitOptions=['repeticiones','segundos','metros'];if(row.dose_unit&&!unitOptions.includes(row.dose_unit))unitOptions.unshift(row.dose_unit);
 const field=(key,label,type='number',optional=false,attrs='')=>{const name=`child__${row.id}__${key}`,v=row[key]==null?'':String(row[key]);let control='';if(key==='dose_unit'){control=`<select name="${name}" required>${unitOptions.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}" ${x===(row.dose_unit||'repeticiones')?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`}else if(type==='textarea'){control=`<textarea name="${name}">${esc(v)}</textarea>`}else{control=`<input type="${type}" name="${name}" value="${esc(v)}" ${attrs}>`}const clear=optional?`<label class="clear-existing"><input type="checkbox" name="__clear_${name}"> Borrar este dato al guardar</label>`:'';return `<div><label>${esc(label)}</label>${control}${clear}</div>`};
 const preview=[['Ejercicio',exerciseName],['Series',sessionChildPreviewValue(row,'sets')],['Repeticiones / dosis por serie',sessionChildPreviewValue(row,'reps')],['Unidad',sessionChildPreviewValue(row,'dose_unit')],['Carga externa',sessionChildPreviewValue(row,'external_load_kg')],['Repeticiones posibles',sessionChildPreviewValue(row,'reps_possible')],['Carácter del esfuerzo',row.effort_character||'No calculado'],['RPE del ejercicio',sessionChildPreviewValue(row,'exercise_rpe')],['Observaciones',row.notes||'Sin dato']];
 return `<section class="session-edit-group"><h3>${esc(exerciseName)}</h3><div class="small">Ejercicio guardado · Orden ${esc(row.exercise_order??index+1)}</div><div class="session-edit-preview">${preview.map(([k,v])=>`<div class="editor-preview-item"><span>${esc(k)}</span><strong>${esc(v)}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="session-edit-fields">${field('dose_unit','Unidad de dosificación','select',false)}${field('sets','Series','number',false,'min="1" step="1" required')}${field('reps','Repeticiones / segundos / metros por serie','number',false,'min="1" step="1" required')}${field('external_load_kg','Carga externa (kg)','number',true,'min="0" step="0.5"')}${field('reps_possible','Repeticiones posibles','number',true,'min="1" step="1"')}${field('exercise_rpe','RPE del ejercicio (0–10)','number',true,'min="0" max="10" step="0.5"')}${field('notes','Observaciones del ejercicio','textarea',true)}</div><label class="session-delete-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="__delete_child_${row.id}"> Eliminar este ejercicio y su dosificación de la sesión al guardar</label></section>`;
}
async function openSessionEditor(id){
 const schema=editableSchemas.training_sessions;if(!schema)return;const athleteId=activeAthleteId();let q=db.from('training_sessions').select('*').eq('id',id);if(athleteId)q=q.eq('athlete_id',athleteId);const {data:session,error}=await q.single();if(error){alert('No se pudo consultar la sesión: '+error.message);return}
 const {data:children,error:childError}=await db.from('training_session_exercises').select('*, exercise_catalog(name)').eq('session_id',id).order('exercise_order',{ascending:true});if(childError){alert('No se pudo consultar el detalle de ejercicios de esta sesión: '+childError.message);return}
 const rows=children||[],dialog=$('recordEditor'),form=$('recordEditForm');$('recordEditorTitle').textContent='Editar sesión completa';$('recordEditMessage').textContent='';form.dataset.original=JSON.stringify(session);form.dataset.children=JSON.stringify(rows);form.dataset.customSessionEditor='yes';form.dataset.table='training_sessions';form.dataset.id=id;
 $('recordEditPreview').innerHTML=editorPreview(schema,session)+`<section class="editor-preview"><strong>Vista previa del trabajo registrado</strong><div class="small">${rows.length} ejercicio(s) asociado(s) a esta sesión. Se muestran sus dosificaciones actuales antes de editar.</div>${rows.length?rows.map((r,i)=>`<div class="editor-preview-item" style="margin-top:7px"><strong>${esc(r.exercise_catalog?.name||r.exercise_name||`Ejercicio ${i+1}`)}</strong><div class="small">${esc(r.sets??'—')} series × ${esc(r.reps??'—')} ${esc(r.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · Carga: ${r.external_load_kg==null?'—':esc(r.external_load_kg)+' kg'} · CE: ${esc(r.effort_character||'—')} · RPE ejercicio: ${esc(r.exercise_rpe??'—')}</div><div class="small">${esc(r.notes||'Sin observaciones')}</div></div>`).join(''):'<p class="small">Esta sesión no tiene ejercicios asociados en el banco. Si es un registro anterior, revisa también los campos de estímulo principal que aparecen en la edición.</p>'}</section>`;
 $('recordEditFields').innerHTML=`<h3 class="full-span">Datos generales de la sesión</h3>${schema.fields.map(f=>editorField(f,session[f.name])).join('')}<h3 class="full-span">Ejercicios y dosificación</h3>${rows.length?rows.map(sessionChildEditorMarkup).join(''):'<div class="notice full-span">No hay ejercicios asociados a esta sesión. Los campos generales se pueden editar; los detalles de ejercicios solo aparecen cuando existen registros en training_session_exercises.</div>'}`;
 $('restoreRecordEdit').onclick=restoreEditorOriginal;dialog.showModal();
}
async function saveSessionEditor(form){
 const id=form.dataset.id,raw=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());let original={},children=[];try{original=JSON.parse(form.dataset.original||'{}');children=JSON.parse(form.dataset.children||'[]')}catch{}
 const schema=editableSchemas.training_sessions,parentPayload={};for(const f of schema.fields){let value=raw[f.name],clear=raw[`__clear_${f.name}`]==='on';if(clear)value=null;else if(value===''||value==null)value=original[f.name]??null;else if(f.type==='number')value=Number(value);parentPayload[f.name]=value}
 if(parentPayload.session_status==='Realizada'&&(parentPayload.duration_minutes==null||parentPayload.session_rpe==null)){$('recordEditMessage').textContent='Para marcar la sesión como realizada, completa duración y RPE global.';$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}
 const deletions=children.filter(row=>raw[`__delete_child_${row.id}`]==='on');if(deletions.length&&!confirm(`Vas a eliminar ${deletions.length} ejercicio(s) de esta sesión. Esta acción no se puede deshacer. ¿Continuar?`))return;
 const updates=[];for(const row of children){if(raw[`__delete_child_${row.id}`]==='on')continue;const payload={};for(const key of ['dose_unit','sets','reps','external_load_kg','reps_possible','exercise_rpe','notes']){const fieldName=`child__${row.id}__${key}`,v=raw[fieldName],clear=raw[`__clear_${fieldName}`]==='on';let value;if(clear)value=null;else if(v===''||v==null)value=row[key]??null;else if(['sets','reps','external_load_kg','reps_possible','exercise_rpe'].includes(key))value=Number(v);else value=v;payload[key]=value}
  if(!payload.dose_unit)payload.dose_unit=row.dose_unit||'repeticiones';if(!Number.isFinite(Number(payload.sets))||Number(payload.sets)<1||!Number.isFinite(Number(payload.reps))||Number(payload.reps)<1){$('recordEditMessage').textContent=`Completa series y dosis válidas para ${row.exercise_catalog?.name||'uno de los ejercicios'}.`;$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}if(payload.dose_unit==='repeticiones'&&payload.reps_possible!=null&&Number(payload.reps_possible)<Number(payload.reps)){$('recordEditMessage').textContent=`Las repeticiones posibles no pueden ser inferiores a las realizadas (${row.exercise_catalog?.name||'ejercicio'}).`;$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}payload.effort_character=payload.dose_unit==='repeticiones'&&payload.reps_possible!=null?`${payload.reps}(${payload.reps_possible})`:null;updates.push({row,payload});}
 // Child records are updated individually so an error can be reported against the precise exercise.
 for(const {row,payload} of updates){const {data,error}=await db.from('training_session_exercises').update(payload).eq('id',row.id).eq('session_id',id).select('id').maybeSingle();if(error||!data){$('recordEditMessage').textContent=`No se pudo guardar el ejercicio ${row.exercise_catalog?.name||row.id}: ${error?.message||'Supabase no devolvió el registro actualizado; revisa RLS.'} La sesión permanece abierta para revisar los cambios.`;$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}}
 for(const row of deletions){const {data,error}=await db.from('training_session_exercises').delete().eq('id',row.id).eq('session_id',id).select('id').maybeSingle();if(error||!data){$('recordEditMessage').textContent=`No se pudo eliminar el ejercicio ${row.exercise_catalog?.name||row.id}: ${error?.message||'revisa los permisos RLS.'} La sesión permanece abierta.`;$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}}
 if(parentPayload.session_status==='Planificada'&&parentPayload.session_rpe==null){/* mantener null para sesiones pendientes */}
 const {data,error}=await db.from('training_sessions').update(parentPayload).eq('id',id).select('id').maybeSingle();if(error||!data){$('recordEditMessage').textContent='Los ejercicios se procesaron, pero no se pudo guardar la información general de la sesión: '+(error?.message||'revisa las políticas RLS.');$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}
 $('recordEditor').close();await render();
}
async function deleteRecord(tableName,id){if(!canDeleteRecord(tableName)){alert('No tienes permisos para eliminar este tipo de registro.');return}const schema=editableSchemas[tableName];if(!confirm(`¿Estás seguro de que deseas eliminar este ${schema?.title||'registro'}? Esta acción no se puede deshacer.`))return;const {data,error}=await db.from(tableName).delete().eq('id',id).select('id').maybeSingle();if(error){alert('No se pudo eliminar el registro: '+error.message+'\nComprueba que hayas aplicado la actualización de permisos en Supabase.');return}if(!data){alert('No se eliminó ningún registro. Puede que ya no exista o que tu cuenta no tenga permisos.');return}await render()}
function setupRecordActions(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-record-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openRecordEditor(b.dataset.recordEdit,b.dataset.recordId));document.querySelectorAll('[data-record-delete]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>deleteRecord(b.dataset.recordDelete,b.dataset.recordId))}
$('closeRecordEditor').onclick=()=>$('recordEditor').close();$('cancelRecordEdit').onclick=()=>$('recordEditor').close();
$('recordEditForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const form=e.currentTarget,tableName=form.dataset.table,id=form.dataset.id,schema=editableSchemas[tableName];if(!schema)return;if(tableName==='training_sessions'&&form.dataset.customSessionEditor==='yes'){await saveSessionEditor(form);return}const raw=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());let original={};try{original=JSON.parse(form.dataset.original||'{}')}catch{}const payload={};for(const f of schema.fields){let value=raw[f.name];const clear=raw['__clear_'+f.name]==='on';if(clear)value=null;else if(value===''||value==null)value=original[f.name]??null;else if(f.type==='number')value=Number(value);payload[f.name]=value}if(tableName==='training_sessions'){if(payload.session_status==='Realizada'&&(payload.duration_minutes==null||payload.session_rpe==null)){$('recordEditMessage').textContent='Para marcar la sesión como realizada, completa la duración real y el RPE global.';$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}if(payload.session_status==='Planificada'&&payload.session_rpe==null)payload.session_rpe=null;if(payload.reps!=null&&payload.reps_possible!=null)payload.effort_character=`${payload.reps}(${payload.reps_possible})`}if(tableName==='training_session_exercises'){if(payload.reps_possible!=null&&payload.reps!=null&&payload.reps_possible<payload.reps){$('recordEditMessage').textContent='Las repeticiones posibles no pueden ser inferiores a las realizadas.';$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}payload.effort_character=payload.reps!=null&&payload.reps_possible!=null?`${payload.reps}(${payload.reps_possible})`:null}const {data,error}=await db.from(tableName).update(payload).eq('id',id).select('id').maybeSingle();if(error){$('recordEditMessage').textContent='No se pudieron guardar los cambios: '+error.message;$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}if(!data){$('recordEditMessage').textContent='No se modificó ningún registro. Comprueba tus permisos de actualización en Supabase (RLS).';$('recordEditMessage').className='small bad';return}if(tableName==='athletes'){await loadAthletesIntoSelector();if(profile.role!=='coach'&&athleteProfile?.id===id){const refreshed=await db.from('athletes').select('*').eq('id',id).single();if(!refreshed.error)athleteProfile=refreshed.data;}} $('recordEditor').close();await render()};


async function fetchRows(tableName,limit=200){let q=db.from(tableName).select('*').order(tableName==='wellness_logs'?'log_date':tableName==='physical_tests'?'test_date':tableName==='training_sessions'?'session_date':tableName==='injuries'?'onset_date':'decision_date',{ascending:false}).limit(limit);if(profile.role!=='coach'){if(!athleteProfile?.id)return {data:[],error:null};q=q.eq('athlete_id',athleteProfile.id)}else{if(!selectedId)return {data:[],error:null};q=q.eq('athlete_id',selectedId)}return await q}
function currentHeader(){return profile.role==='coach'?(athletes.find(a=>a.id===selectedId)?.full_name||'Selecciona o vincula un deportista'):(athleteProfile?.full_name||'Tu perfil aún no está vinculado')}
async function render(){const c=$('content');if(profile.role!=='coach'&&!athleteProfile){c.innerHTML=panel('Tu cuenta está creada',`<div class="notice">El entrenador todavía debe vincular tu correo a tu ficha deportiva. Comparte con él este correo: <strong>${esc(authUser.email)}</strong>. Cuando complete la vinculación, cierra sesión e ingresa nuevamente.</div>`);return}if(profile.role==='coach'&&!selectedId&&tab!=='athletes'&&tab!=='exerciseBank'){c.innerHTML=panel('Primero vincula un deportista',`<p>No hay un deportista seleccionado. Entra en <strong>Deportistas</strong> y vincula el correo con el que el atleta se registró.</p>`);return}
c.innerHTML='<section class="card muted">Consultando registros…</section>';try{
if(tab==='overview')await viewOverview(c);
else if(tab==='athletes')await viewAthletes(c);
else if(tab==='profile')c.innerHTML=viewAthleteProfile();
else if(tab==='injuries'){const r=await fetchRows('injuries');c.innerHTML=injuryForm()+recordTable('Historial de lesiones',['Fecha','Zona','Tipo de lesión','Grado','Lateralidad','Estado','Dolor actual','Orientación profesional','Restricciones'],r.data||[],x=>[x.onset_date,x.body_area,x.injury_type,x.injury_grade,x.laterality,x.status,x.current_pain==null?'—':x.current_pain+'/10',x.professional_guidance,x.restrictions],'injuries')}
else if(tab==='wellness'){const r=await fetchRows('wellness_logs');c.innerHTML=wellnessForm()+recordTable('Historial de bienestar',['Fecha','Semana','Fatiga','Sueño','Dolor muscular','Dolor/lesión','Estrés','Motivación'],r.data||[],x=>[x.log_date,x.week,x.fatigue,x.sleep_quality,x.muscle_soreness,x.pain_level,x.stress,x.motivation],'wellness_logs')}
else if(tab==='sessions')await viewSessions(c);
else if(tab==='exerciseBank')await viewExerciseBank(c);
else if(tab==='tests'){const r=await fetchRows('physical_tests');c.innerHTML=testForm()+recordTable('Pruebas físicas',['Fecha','Semana','Prueba','Resultado','Unidad','Protocolo'],r.data||[],x=>[x.test_date,x.week,x.test_name,x.result_value,x.unit,x.notes],'physical_tests')}
else if(tab==='decisions'){const d=await fetchRows('load_decisions');if(profile.role!=='coach'){c.innerHTML=table('Ajustes registrados por el entrenador',['Fecha','Semana','Decisión','Justificación'],d.data||[],x=>[x.decision_date,x.week,x.action,x.rationale]);return}const [w,s,i]=await Promise.all([fetchRows('wellness_logs'),fetchRows('training_sessions'),fetchRows('injuries')]);c.innerHTML=decisionView(d.data||[],w.data||[],s.data||[],i.data||[])}
else if(tab==='planner'&&profile.role==='coach')await viewPlanner(c);
else if(tab==='evaluation')await viewEvaluation(c);
}catch(err){c.innerHTML=panel('No se pudo cargar el apartado',`<div class="notice error">${esc(err.message||err)}</div>`)}}
function buildDonutChart(title,subtitle,items,centerCaption='registros'){
 const cleaned=(items||[]).map(x=>({label:String(x.label??'Sin clasificar'),value:Number(x.value)||0})).filter(x=>x.value>0);
 const total=cleaned.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.value,0);
 if(!total)return `<section class="card donut-card"><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p class="small">${esc(subtitle)}</p><div class="donut-empty">Todavía no hay datos suficientes para construir este gráfico.</div></section>`;
 const colors=['#72b7ff','#45d6a0','#ffd166','#ff7185','#b49cff','#63d5df','#f5a6d2','#a8c47a','#e5a85b'];
 const radius=59,circ=2*Math.PI*radius;let offset=0;
 const arcs=cleaned.map((item,index)=>{const length=(item.value/total)*circ;const arc=`<circle cx="90" cy="90" r="${radius}" fill="none" stroke="${colors[index%colors.length]}" stroke-width="20" stroke-dasharray="${length.toFixed(3)} ${(circ-length).toFixed(3)}" stroke-dashoffset="${(-offset).toFixed(3)}" transform="rotate(-90 90 90)"/>`;offset+=length;return arc}).join('');
 const legend=cleaned.map((item,index)=>{const pct=(item.value/total*100).toFixed(1).replace('.0','');return `<div class="donut-legend-row"><span class="donut-swatch" style="background:${colors[index%colors.length]}" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="donut-label">${esc(item.label)}</span><span class="donut-value">${item.value} · ${pct}%</span></div>`}).join('');
 const accessible=cleaned.map(x=>`${x.label}: ${x.value}`).join(', ');
 return `<section class="card donut-card"><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p class="small">${esc(subtitle)}</p><div class="donut-layout"><svg class="donut-svg" viewBox="0 0 180 180" role="img" aria-label="${esc(title)}. ${esc(accessible)}"><circle cx="90" cy="90" r="${radius}" fill="none" stroke="#263750" stroke-width="20"/>${arcs}<text x="90" y="87" class="donut-total">${total}</text><text x="90" y="105" class="donut-caption">${esc(centerCaption)}</text></svg><div class="donut-legend">${legend}</div></div></section>`;
}
function buildHorizontalBarChart(title,subtitle,items,unitLabel='registros'){
 const cleaned=(items||[]).map(x=>({label:String(x.label??'Sin clasificar'),value:Number(x.value)||0})).filter(x=>x.value>0).sort((a,b)=>b.value-a.value);
 const total=cleaned.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.value,0),max=Math.max(1,...cleaned.map(x=>x.value));
 if(!total)return `<section class="card bar-chart-card"><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p class="small">${esc(subtitle)}</p><div class="donut-empty">Todavía no hay datos suficientes para construir este gráfico.</div></section>`;
 const rows=cleaned.map(x=>{const pct=x.value/max*100,share=(x.value/total*100).toFixed(1).replace('.0','');return `<div class="horizontal-bar-row"><div class="horizontal-bar-label">${esc(x.label)}</div><div class="horizontal-bar-track" role="img" aria-label="${esc(x.label)}: ${x.value} ${esc(unitLabel)}"><div class="horizontal-bar-fill" style="width:${pct.toFixed(1)}%"></div></div><div class="horizontal-bar-value">${x.value} ${esc(unitLabel)} · ${share}%</div></div>`}).join('');
 return `<section class="card bar-chart-card"><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p class="small">${esc(subtitle)}</p><div class="horizontal-bars">${rows}</div><p class="small">Total: ${total} ${esc(unitLabel)}. Las barras comparan el número de registros, no su magnitud de carga.</p></section>`;
}
function countDistribution(rows,labeler){const counts=new Map();for(const row of rows||[]){const label=labeler(row);counts.set(label,(counts.get(label)||0)+1)}return Array.from(counts,([label,value])=>({label,value})).sort((a,b)=>b.value-a.value)}
function sessionTypeDistribution(sessions){return countDistribution(sessions,x=>x.session_type|| (x.exercise_name?`Registro anterior: ${x.exercise_name}`:'Sin tipo de sesión'))}
function phaseDistribution(sessions){return countDistribution(sessions,x=>{const w=Number(x.week);if(!w||w<1||w>8)return 'Semana sin asignar';return phaseName(w)})}
function injuryStatusDistribution(injuries){return countDistribution(injuries,x=>x.status||'Sin estado registrado')}

function sessionLoadAU(session){
 if(session?.session_status==='Planificada')return null;
 const duration=Number(session?.duration_minutes),rpe=Number(session?.session_rpe);
 if(session?.duration_minutes==null||session?.session_rpe==null||!Number.isFinite(duration)||!Number.isFinite(rpe))return null;
 return duration*rpe;
}
function formatLoadAU(session){if(session?.session_status==='Planificada')return 'Pendiente de ejecución';const value=sessionLoadAU(session);return value==null?'Sin datos':`${value.toFixed(1)} UA`}
function sumLoadAU(sessions){return (sessions||[]).reduce((sum,row)=>sum+(sessionLoadAU(row)??0),0)}
function recentSevenDayLoad(sessions){
 const valid=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>x.session_date&&sessionLoadAU(x)!=null).sort((a,b)=>String(b.session_date).localeCompare(String(a.session_date)));
 if(!valid.length)return {total:null,start:null,end:null,count:0};
 const end=valid[0].session_date;const endDate=new Date(end+'T12:00:00');endDate.setDate(endDate.getDate()-6);const start=endDate.toISOString().slice(0,10);
 const selected=valid.filter(x=>x.session_date>=start&&x.session_date<=end);
 return {total:sumLoadAU(selected),start,end,count:selected.length};
}
function weeklyLoadTable(sessions){
 let rows='';for(let wk=1;wk<=8;wk++){const list=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>Number(x.week)===wk),valid=list.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null);const load=valid.length?sumLoadAU(valid).toFixed(1):'—';const mins=valid.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.duration_minutes||0),0);const avgRpe=valid.length?(valid.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.session_rpe),0)/valid.length).toFixed(1):'—';rows+=`<tr><td>${wk}</td><td>${phaseName(wk)}</td><td>${valid.length}</td><td>${load}</td><td>${valid.length?mins:'—'}</td><td>${avgRpe}</td></tr>`}
 return `<section class="card"><h2>Carga interna semanal · sRPE</h2><p class="small">Carga de cada sesión = RPE global de sesión × duración en minutos. La suma semanal se expresa en unidades arbitrarias (UA). Solo se calculan sesiones con ambos datos completos.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Semana</th><th>Etapa</th><th>Sesiones con datos</th><th>Carga acumulada (UA)</th><th>Duración total (min)</th><th>RPE medio</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table></div><p class="small">La carga sRPE estima carga interna percibida de cada sesión registrada; no equivale a tonelaje, fuerza mecánica ni riesgo de lesión. Para estimar la carga semanal de lucha, registra todas las sesiones, también las de tatami y combate. Se debe interpretar junto con el bienestar, el rendimiento y el contexto de lucha.</p></section>`;
}
async function viewOverview(c){
 const [w,s,t,i]=await Promise.all([fetchRows('wellness_logs'),fetchRows('training_sessions'),fetchRows('physical_tests'),fetchRows('injuries')]);
 for(const result of [w,s,t,i])if(result.error)throw result.error;
 const wellness=w.data||[],sessions=s.data||[],tests=t.data||[],injuries=i.data||[];
 const activeInjuries=injuries.filter(x=>x.status==='Activa').length;
 const stats=`<div class="grid four"><div><div class="small">Registros de bienestar</div><div class="stat">${wellness.length}</div></div><div><div class="small">Sesiones registradas</div><div class="stat">${sessions.length}</div></div><div><div class="small">Pruebas físicas</div><div class="stat">${tests.length}</div></div><div><div class="small">Lesiones activas reportadas</div><div class="stat ${activeInjuries>0?'bad':''}">${activeInjuries}</div></div></div>`;
 const description=profile.role==='coach'?'Resumen del deportista seleccionado. Cambia de deportista desde el selector superior para consultar otro perfil.':'Resumen de tu proceso individual de entrenamiento.';
 const summary=panel('Resumen de '+esc(currentHeader()),`${stats}<p class="small">${description} Las etapas semanales son orientativas: la respuesta individual determina los ajustes. Los gráficos cuentan registros disponibles; no representan por sí solos la magnitud de la carga.</p><div class="notice">Registra el bienestar con regularidad y completa los datos de cada sesión. No se aumenta la carga solo por cambiar de semana.</div>`);
 const charts=`<div class="chart-grid">${buildHorizontalBarChart('Sesiones por tipo','Distribución de las sesiones registradas según su clasificación.',sessionTypeDistribution(sessions),'sesiones')}${buildDonutChart('Sesiones por etapa','Distribución de sesiones según la semana indicada en cada registro.',phaseDistribution(sessions),'sesiones')}${buildDonutChart('Estado de lesiones','Distribución de los antecedentes registrados en el perfil.',injuryStatusDistribution(injuries),'registros')}</div>`;
 const seven=recentSevenDayLoad(sessions),totalLoad=sumLoadAU(sessions),validLoads=sessions.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null).length;
 const loadPanel=panel('Monitoreo de carga interna',`<div class="grid three"><div><div class="small">Carga acumulada registrada</div><div class="stat">${validLoads?totalLoad.toFixed(1):'—'}</div><div class="small">UA · ${validLoads} sesión(es) con datos completos</div></div><div><div class="small">Última ventana de 7 días registrados</div><div class="stat">${seven.total==null?'—':seven.total.toFixed(1)}</div><div class="small">UA · ${seven.count} sesión(es), ${seven.start||'—'} a ${seven.end||'—'}</div></div><div><div class="small">Fórmula de carga</div><div class="stat">RPE × min</div><div class="small">Carga interna de sesión (sRPE)</div></div></div><p class="small">La ventana de siete días termina en la fecha de la sesión registrada más reciente. Registra también las sesiones técnico-tácticas, combates simulados y sesiones dobles, cada una por separado, para estimar la carga interna total. La cifra es descriptiva y no activa por sí sola aumentos o reducciones automáticas.</p>`);
 c.innerHTML=summary+loadPanel+charts;
}
function viewAthleteProfile(){const a=athleteProfile;if(!a)return panel('Mi ficha deportiva','<div class="empty">Tu ficha todavía no está vinculada.</div>');const initials=String(a.full_name||'D').trim().split(/\s+/).slice(0,2).map(x=>x[0]||'').join('').toUpperCase();return `<section class="athlete-hero profile-hero"><div class="athlete-identity"><div class="athlete-avatar">${esc(initials)}</div><div><div class="eyebrow">FICHA DEPORTIVA</div><h2>${esc(a.full_name)}</h2><div class="hero-subtitle">${esc(a.weight_category||'Categoría no registrada')} · ${esc(athleteAgeText(a))}</div></div></div><div class="hero-tags"><span>${esc(a.strength_experience||'Experiencia no registrada')} en fuerza</span><span>${esc(a.strength_days??'Variable')} días de fuerza/semana</span></div></section><section class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">CARACTERIZACIÓN</div><h2>Datos del deportista</h2></div><span class="badge soft-badge">Perfil individual</span></div><div class="athlete-details-grid">${[['Edad',athleteAgeText(a)],['Fecha de nacimiento',a.birth_date||'No registrada'],['Categoría de peso',a.weight_category||'No registrada'],['Sexo',a.sex||'No registrado'],['Experiencia deportiva',a.sport_experience_years==null?'No registrada':a.sport_experience_years+' años'],['Experiencia en fuerza',a.strength_experience||'No registrada'],['Frecuencia de fuerza',a.strength_days==null?'Variable / no registrada':a.strength_days+' días/semana']].map(([k,v])=>`<div class="detail-tile"><span>${esc(k)}</span><strong>${esc(v)}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><p class="small">Solicita al entrenador la corrección de los datos de tu ficha si alguno no es correcto.</p></section>`}
async function viewAthletes(c){const formHtml=`<section class="card"><h2>Vincular una cuenta de deportista</h2><p class="small">El luchador debe haberse registrado primero en la pantalla de inicio con su correo. Escribe exactamente ese correo para asociarlo con su ficha.</p><form id="linkForm"><div class="grid two"><div><label>Correo de la cuenta registrada</label><input name="email" type="email" required></div><div><label>Nombre completo</label><input name="full_name" required></div><div><label>Categoría de peso</label><input name="weight_category" placeholder="Ej. 65 kg"></div><div><label>Sexo (opcional)</label><select name="sex"><option value="">No especificado</option><option>Femenino</option><option>Masculino</option></select></div><div><label>Fecha de nacimiento (necesaria para calcular la edad)</label><input name="birth_date" type="date" id="newAthleteBirthDate"><div id="newAthleteAgePreview" class="age-preview">Edad calculada: ingresa la fecha de nacimiento.</div></div><div><label>Años de experiencia deportiva</label><input name="sport_experience_years" type="number" min="0" step="0.5"></div><div><label>Experiencia en fuerza</label><select name="strength_experience"><option>Inicial</option><option>Intermedia</option><option>Avanzada</option></select></div><div><label>Días de fuerza por semana (referencia)</label><input name="strength_days" type="number" min="1" max="7" placeholder="Variable"></div><div class="two"><label>Observaciones</label><textarea name="notes"></textarea></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button>Vincular cuenta y crear ficha</button><span id="linkMessage" class="small"></span></div></form></section>`;
const r=await db.from('athletes').select('*').order('full_name');if(r.error)throw r.error;athletes=r.data||[];$('selectedAthlete').innerHTML=athletes.map(a=>`<option value="${a.id}" ${a.id===selectedId?'selected':''}>${esc(a.full_name)} — ${esc(a.weight_category||'Sin categoría')} · ${esc(athleteAgeText(a))}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Sin deportistas vinculados</option>';
const athleteCards=`<section class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">EQUIPO</div><h2>Deportistas vinculados</h2><p class="small">Selecciona una ficha para corregir los datos registrados. La edad se calcula desde la fecha de nacimiento.</p></div><span class="badge soft-badge">${athletes.length} perfil(es)</span></div><div class="athlete-card-grid">${athletes.length?athletes.map(a=>{const initials=String(a.full_name||'D').trim().split(/\s+/).slice(0,2).map(x=>x[0]||'').join('').toUpperCase();return `<article class="athlete-list-card"><div class="athlete-list-top"><div class="athlete-avatar small-avatar">${esc(initials)}</div><div class="athlete-list-name"><strong>${esc(a.full_name)}</strong><span>${esc(a.weight_category||'Categoría no registrada')}</span></div><span class="account-state ${a.user_id?'linked':'unlinked'}">${a.user_id?'Vinculado':'Sin cuenta'}</span></div><div class="athlete-card-metrics"><div><span>Edad</span><strong>${esc(athleteAgeText(a))}</strong></div><div><span>Experiencia</span><strong>${a.sport_experience_years==null?'—':esc(a.sport_experience_years)+' años'}</strong></div><div><span>Fuerza</span><strong>${esc(a.strength_experience||'—')}</strong></div></div><div class="athlete-card-footer"><span class="small">Nacimiento: ${esc(a.birth_date||'No registrada')}</span><button type="button" class="action-btn edit" data-record-edit="athletes" data-record-id="${esc(a.id)}">Editar ficha</button></div></article>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty">Aún no hay deportistas vinculados.</div>'}</div></section>`;c.innerHTML=panel('Edad y caracterización','<p class="small">Registra la fecha de nacimiento para calcular la edad automáticamente. Puedes editar las fichas ya creadas sin volver a vincular sus cuentas.</p>')+formHtml+athleteCards;const newBirth=$('newAthleteBirthDate');if(newBirth)newBirth.addEventListener('input',()=>{const age=calculateAge(newBirth.value);$('newAthleteAgePreview').textContent=age==null?'Edad calculada: ingresa una fecha de nacimiento válida.':`Edad calculada: ${age} años`;});$('linkForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target),p={p_email:f.get('email'),p_full_name:f.get('full_name'),p_weight_category:f.get('weight_category')||null,p_sex:f.get('sex')||null,p_birth_date:f.get('birth_date')||null,p_sport_experience_years:f.get('sport_experience_years')?Number(f.get('sport_experience_years')):null,p_strength_experience:f.get('strength_experience'),p_strength_days:f.get('strength_days')?Number(f.get('strength_days')):null,p_notes:f.get('notes')||null};const {data,error}=await db.rpc('coach_link_athlete',p);if(error){$('linkMessage').textContent='Error: '+error.message;$('linkMessage').className='small bad';return}selectedId=data;$('linkMessage').textContent='Cuenta vinculada correctamente.';$('linkMessage').className='small good';await loadAthletesIntoSelector();e.target.reset();render()}}
async function loadAthletesIntoSelector(){const {data,error}=await db.from('athletes').select('*').order('full_name');if(error)throw error;athletes=data||[];selectedId=athletes.find(a=>a.id===selectedId)?.id||athletes[0]?.id||null;$('selectedAthlete').innerHTML=athletes.map(a=>`<option value="${a.id}" ${a.id===selectedId?'selected':''}>${esc(a.full_name)} — ${esc(a.weight_category||'Sin categoría')} · ${esc(athleteAgeText(a))}</option>`).join('')}
function input(label,name,type='text',attrs='',required=true){return `<div><label>${label}</label><input name="${name}" type="${type}" ${attrs} ${required?'required':''}></div>`}
function select(label,name,opts){return `<div><label>${label}</label><select name="${name}" required>${opts}</select></div>`}
function formCard(title,id,fields,button='Guardar registro'){return `<section class="card form-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">REGISTRO DE ENTRENAMIENTO</div><h2>${title}</h2><p class="small">Completa los campos correspondientes. Los registros anteriores permanecen disponibles en el historial.</p></div><span class="form-step">Nuevo registro</span></div><form id="${id}"><div class="grid two form-grid">${fields}</div><div class="form-actions"><button>${button}</button><span id="${id}Msg" class="small"></span></div></form></section>`}
function injuryForm(){return formCard('Registrar lesión o antecedente','injuryForm',select('Zona anatómica','body_area',`<option value="" disabled selected>Selecciona la zona anatómica</option>`+injuryBodyAreas.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join(''))+select('Tipo de lesión','injury_type',`<option value="" disabled selected>Selecciona el tipo de lesión</option>`+injuryTypes.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join(''))+select('Grado / clasificación','injury_grade',injuryGrades.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join(''))+select('Lateralidad','laterality',injuryLateralities.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join(''))+input('Detalle anatómico / diagnóstico específico','injury_detail','text','',false)+input('Fecha de aparición (si se conoce)','onset_date','date','',false)+select('Estado actual','status','<option value="" disabled selected>Selecciona el estado actual</option><option>Recuperada</option><option>En recuperación</option><option>Activa</option>')+input('Tiempo de recuperación (días, si se conoce)','recovery_days','number','min="0"',false)+input('Dolor actual asociado (0–10, si aplica)','current_pain','number','min="0" max="10"',false)+select('Orientación profesional registrada','professional_guidance',professionalGuidanceOptions.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join(''))+`<div class="full-span"><label>Restricciones indicadas por profesional</label><textarea name="restrictions" placeholder="Ejercicios o movimientos restringidos, si están indicados"></textarea></div><div class="full-span"><label>Tratamiento / observaciones</label><textarea name="notes"></textarea></div><p class="small full-span">Registra el diagnóstico como fue comunicado por el profesional de salud. El formulario no diagnostica ni determina por sí solo el retorno al deporte.</p>`)}
function wellnessForm(){return formCard('Registro de bienestar (escala 1–10)','wellnessForm',input('Fecha','log_date','date')+input('Semana (1–8)','week','number','min="1" max="8"')+input('Fatiga (1 baja – 10 alta)','fatigue','number','min="1" max="10"')+input('Calidad del sueño (1 baja – 10 alta)','sleep_quality','number','min="1" max="10"')+input('Dolor muscular (1 bajo – 10 alto)','muscle_soreness','number','min="1" max="10"')+input('Dolor o molestia (1 bajo – 10 alto)','pain_level','number','min="1" max="10"')+input('Estrés (1 bajo – 10 alto)','stress','number','min="1" max="10"')+input('Motivación (1 baja – 10 alta)','motivation','number','min="1" max="10"')+`<div><label>Observaciones</label><textarea name="notes"></textarea></div>`)}
function sessionForm(){return formCard('Registrar sesión de entrenamiento','sessionForm',input('Fecha','session_date','date')+input('Semana (1–8)','week','number','min="1" max="8"')+`<div><label>Tipo de sesión</label><select name="session_type" id="sessionTypeSelect" required><option value="">Selecciona el tipo de sesión</option>${sessionTypes.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`+input('Duración global de sesión (min)','duration_minutes','number','min="1"')+input('RPE global de sesión (0–10)','session_rpe','number','min="0" max="10"')+`<div class="field-hint full-span">Para estimar la carga sRPE, registra el RPE global de forma consistente después de la sesión (por ejemplo, dentro de los 30 minutos posteriores) y completa la duración total en minutos. Registra cada sesión por separado, incluidas las jornadas técnico-tácticas, los combates simulados y las sesiones dobles, para estimar la carga interna semanal completa.</div><div id="exercisePlanningSection" class="full-span section"><h3>Ejercicios recomendados para esta sesión</h3><p class="small">Selecciona uno o varios ejercicios del banco. Las recomendaciones dependen del tipo de sesión; puedes variar ejercicios entre semanas sin perder el historial individual.</p><div id="exerciseChoices" class="exercise-grid"><div class="no-exercises">Primero selecciona el tipo de sesión.</div></div><div id="selectedExerciseDetails"></div></div><div id="sessionNoExerciseNote" class="notice hidden full-span">Esta sesión se registra como trabajo de lucha o acondicionamiento sin asociar ejercicios del banco. Completa duración y RPE global para incluirla en la carga interna sRPE. Si la jornada incluye dos sesiones, registra cada una por separado.</div><div class="full-span"><label>Observaciones generales de la sesión</label><textarea name="notes" placeholder="Contenido técnico-táctico, situaciones, calidad, pausas, incidencias…"></textarea></div>`,'Guardar sesión')}
function usageFor(id){const rows=exerciseHistory.filter(x=>x.exercise_id===id&&x.training_sessions?.session_status!=='Planificada');return {count:rows.length,last:rows[0]?.training_sessions?.session_date||null}}
function ceFrom(reps,possible){return reps&&possible?`${reps}(${possible})`:'CE pendiente'}
function normalizeArea(value){
 const v=String(value||'').toLowerCase().normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'');
 if(v.includes('tobillo'))return 'Tobillo';
 if(v.includes('pie'))return 'Pie';
 if(v.includes('rodilla'))return 'Rodilla';
 if(v.includes('muslo'))return 'Muslo';
 if(v.includes('cadera')||v.includes('ingle')||v.includes('inguinal'))return 'Cadera / ingle';
 if(v.includes('pelvis'))return 'Pelvis';
 if(v.includes('lumbar')||v.includes('espalda baja'))return 'Columna lumbar';
 if(v.includes('torac')||v.includes('dorsal'))return 'Espalda torácica';
 if(v.includes('hombro'))return 'Hombro';
 if(v.includes('brazo'))return 'Brazo';
 if(v.includes('codo'))return 'Codo';
 if(v.includes('antebrazo'))return 'Antebrazo';
 if(v.includes('muneca')||v.includes('mano')||v.includes('dedo'))return 'Muñeca / mano / dedos';
 if(v.includes('cuello')||v.includes('cervical'))return 'Cuello';
 return null;
}
function hasProfessionalAuthorization(injury){return ['Autorización profesional para ejercicio adaptado registrada','Autorización profesional sin restricciones registradas','Autorización profesional sin restricciones registrada'].includes(injury.professional_guidance||'')}
function exerciseCompatibility(exercise){
 const watch=(exercise.injury_watch_areas||[]).map(normalizeArea).filter(Boolean);
 if(!watch.length && athleteInjuryContext.length)return {level:'unclassified',relevant:[],reason:'Este ejercicio no tiene clasificadas sus zonas de demanda/precaución. Requiere revisión manual antes de considerarlo compatible con los antecedentes del deportista.',canCoachOverride:false};
 const relevant=athleteInjuryContext.filter(injury=>{const area=normalizeArea(injury.body_area);return area&&watch.includes(area)});
 if(!relevant.length)return {level:'ok',relevant:[],reason:'No se identifica coincidencia directa con las zonas anatómicas registradas. Esto no equivale a una garantía clínica de seguridad.',canCoachOverride:false};
 const active=relevant.filter(x=>['Activa','En recuperación'].includes(x.status));
 const symptomatic=relevant.filter(x=>Number(x.current_pain||0)>0 || String(x.restrictions||'').trim().length>0);
 if(active.length){
  const authorized=active.every(hasProfessionalAuthorization);
  return {level:'restricted',relevant:active,reason:`Coincide con una lesión ${active.some(x=>x.status==='Activa')?'activa':'en recuperación'} en ${[...new Set(active.map(x=>normalizeArea(x.body_area)))].join(', ')}.`,canCoachOverride:authorized};
 }
 if(symptomatic.length){
  const authorized=symptomatic.every(hasProfessionalAuthorization);
  return {level:'review',relevant:symptomatic,reason:'Existe dolor actual o una restricción registrada en una zona implicada por este ejercicio.',canCoachOverride:authorized};
 }
 return {level:'monitor',relevant,reason:'Existe un antecedente recuperado en una zona implicada. No se bloquea automáticamente, pero conviene comprobar tolerancia y técnica.',canCoachOverride:false};
}
function impactRank(value){return ({'Bajo':1,'Moderado':2,'Alto':3})[value]||2}
function compatibleAlternatives(exercise,type){
 const relevantTypes=type&&type!=='Todos'&&type!=='Otra / personalizada'?[type]:(exercise.session_types||[]);
 return exerciseCatalog.filter(candidate=>candidate.id!==exercise.id&&relevantTypes.some(t=>(candidate.session_types||[]).includes(t)))
  .map(candidate=>({candidate,compat:exerciseCompatibility(candidate)}))
  .filter(x=>['ok','monitor'].includes(x.compat.level)&&impactRank(x.candidate.impact_level)<impactRank(exercise.impact_level))
  .sort((a,b)=>impactRank(a.candidate.impact_level)-impactRank(b.candidate.impact_level))
  .slice(0,3).map(x=>x.candidate.name);
}
function compatibilityBadge(comp){
 if(comp.level==='restricted')return '<span class="compat-badge blocked">Revisión necesaria · lesión activa/en recuperación</span>';
 if(comp.level==='review')return '<span class="compat-badge blocked">Revisar dolor/restricciones</span>';
 if(comp.level==='unclassified')return '<span class="compat-badge caution">Sin clasificar · revisión manual</span>';
 if(comp.level==='monitor')return '<span class="compat-badge caution">Antecedente: vigilar tolerancia</span>';
 return '<span class="compat-badge ok">Sin coincidencia directa detectada</span>';
}

function validHttpUrl(raw){
 try{const u=new URL(String(raw||'').trim());return ['http:','https:'].includes(u.protocol)&&!u.username&&!u.password?u.href:null}catch{return null}
}
function exerciseVideoSearchUrl(name){return 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query='+encodeURIComponent(`${name} demostración técnica ejercicio`)}
function exerciseImageSearchUrl(name){return 'https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q='+encodeURIComponent(`${name} ejercicio técnica`)}
function exerciseDemoMarkup(exercise,{editable=false,compact=false}={}){
 const url=validHttpUrl(exercise.demo_url);const type=exercise.demo_type||'video';
 let visual='';
 if(url&&(type==='imagen'||type==='gif')) visual=`<a href="${esc(url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="demo-preview" src="${esc(url)}" loading="lazy" alt="Demostración visual de ${esc(exercise.name)}"></a>`;
 const resource=url
  ? (type==='imagen'?'Abrir imagen':type==='gif'?'Abrir GIF':'Ver video demostrativo')
  : 'Buscar video demostrativo';
 const resourceUrl=url||exerciseVideoSearchUrl(exercise.name);
 const searchImg=`<a class="demo-link" href="${exerciseImageSearchUrl(exercise.name)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buscar imagen / GIF</a>`;
 const resourceLink=`<a class="demo-link" href="${esc(resourceUrl)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">${resource}</a>`;
 const caption=exercise.demo_caption?`<p class="small">${esc(exercise.demo_caption)}</p>`:'';
 const editor=editable?`<details class="demo-config"><summary>${url?'Editar recurso visual':'Añadir enlace de video, imagen o GIF'}</summary><form data-demo-form="${exercise.id}"><div class="demo-config-grid"><div><label>Tipo de recurso</label><select name="demo_type"><option value="video" ${type==='video'?'selected':''}>Video / enlace</option><option value="imagen" ${type==='imagen'?'selected':''}>Imagen</option><option value="gif" ${type==='gif'?'selected':''}>GIF animado</option></select></div><div><label>URL pública del recurso</label><input name="demo_url" type="url" value="${esc(exercise.demo_url||'')}" placeholder="https://…"></div></div><label>Nota técnica (opcional)</label><input name="demo_caption" type="text" value="${esc(exercise.demo_caption||'')}" placeholder="Ej. variante desde posición inicial; observar alineación del tronco"><div class="demo-actions"><button type="submit">Guardar recurso</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-demo-clear="${exercise.id}">Quitar recurso</button></div><p class="small">Usa enlaces públicos HTTPS. Para imágenes o GIF, pega la dirección directa del archivo. Para videos, pega el enlace de la plataforma donde está alojado.</p></form></details>`:'';
 return `<div class="demo-panel"><div class="small"><strong>Demostración:</strong> ${url?'Recurso añadido al ejercicio':'Todavía no hay un recurso específico guardado.'}</div><div class="demo-actions">${resourceLink}${url?searchImg:`<a class="demo-link" href="${exerciseImageSearchUrl(exercise.name)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buscar imagen / GIF</a>`}</div>${visual}${caption}${editor}</div>`;
}

function renderExerciseChoices(){
 const target=$('exerciseChoices');if(!target)return;const type=$('sessionTypeSelect')?.value||'';
 if(!type){target.innerHTML='<div class="no-exercises">Primero selecciona el tipo de sesión para ver recomendaciones.</div>';renderSelectedExerciseDetails();return}
 const list=exerciseCatalog.filter(x=>type==='Otra / personalizada'||(x.session_types||[]).includes(type));
 if(!list.length){target.innerHTML='<div class="no-exercises">No hay recomendaciones para este tipo. Revisa el banco de ejercicios.</div>';renderSelectedExerciseDetails();return}
 const unknownAreas=athleteInjuryContext.filter(x=>!normalizeArea(x.body_area));
 const warning=athleteInjuryContext.length?`<div class="notice warn full-span"><strong>Filtro individual por lesiones:</strong> el banco compara la zona anatómica registrada con las demandas de cada ejercicio. ${unknownAreas.length?'Hay antecedentes con zona no reconocida; revísalos manualmente. ':''}Una lesión recuperada no implica exclusión automática. Las lesiones activas, en recuperación, con dolor o restricciones requieren revisión profesional.</div>`:'';
 target.innerHTML=warning+list.map(x=>{
  const usage=usageFor(x.id),checked=selectedSessionExercises.has(x.id),comp=exerciseCompatibility(x);
  const requiresCoach=comp.level==='restricted'||comp.level==='review';
  const unclassified=comp.level==='unclassified';
  const availableForCoach=profile.role==='coach'&&comp.canCoachOverride;
  const disabled=unclassified || (requiresCoach&&(profile.role!=='coach'||!availableForCoach));
  const considerAlternatives=requiresCoach||unclassified||(comp.level==='monitor'&&impactRank(x.impact_level)>=2);
  const alternatives=considerAlternatives?compatibleAlternatives(x,type):[];
  const alternativeHtml=considerAlternatives?`<div class="notice warn"><strong>${alternatives.length?'Alternativas para conversar con el entrenador:':'No se identificó una alternativa clasificada para este tipo de sesión.'}</strong>${alternatives.length?`<p>${alternatives.map(esc).join(' · ')}</p>`:`<p>Se recomienda conversar con el entrenador para valorar el cambio de este ejercicio o la modificación de la sesión.</p>`}<span class="small">La selección final debe considerar la respuesta del deportista y, cuando corresponda, la orientación del profesional de salud.</span></div>`:'';
  const overrideText=unclassified?'<p class="small bad">No se puede seleccionar hasta que el entrenador revise y complete la clasificación de demandas del ejercicio en el catálogo.</p>':(requiresCoach?(availableForCoach?'<p class="small caution">Solo el entrenador puede seleccionarlo y debe confirmar la indicación profesional y documentar la adaptación.</p>':'<p class="small bad">No seleccionable hasta contar con orientación profesional documentada y revisar las restricciones.</p>'): '');
  return `<div class="exercise-option ${requiresCoach||unclassified?'exercise-warning':''}"><label><input type="checkbox" data-exercise-choice="${x.id}" ${checked?'checked':''} ${disabled?'disabled':''}><span><strong>${esc(x.name)}</strong><br><span class="small">${esc(x.primary_area||x.category)} · ${esc(x.level)} · ${esc(x.equipment||'Sin material especificado')}</span></span></label><div class="compatibility-line">${compatibilityBadge(comp)}</div><p>${esc(x.description||'')}</p>${exerciseDemoMarkup(x,{compact:true})}<p><strong>Demandas:</strong> ${esc((x.movement_demands||[]).join(', ')||'No clasificadas')} · <strong>Impacto:</strong> ${esc(x.impact_level||'No definido')}</p><p><strong>Zona(s) a vigilar:</strong> ${esc((x.injury_watch_areas||[]).join(', ')||'No clasificadas')}</p><p><strong>Sugerencia:</strong> ${x.suggested_sets||'—'} × ${x.suggested_reps||'—'} ${esc(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · CE orientativo ${esc(x.suggested_ce||'no aplica / por definir')}</p><p>${usage.count?`Usado ${usage.count} vez/veces · último registro: ${esc(usage.last||'—')}`:'Sin registros previos de este deportista'}</p><p class="small">${esc(comp.reason)}</p>${alternativeHtml}${overrideText}</div>`
 }).join('');renderSelectedExerciseDetails();
}
function renderSelectedExerciseDetails(){
 const target=$('selectedExerciseDetails');if(!target)return;
 if(!selectedSessionExercises.size){target.innerHTML='<div class="no-exercises section">Aún no has seleccionado ejercicios. Selecciona al menos uno para registrar la sesión.</div>';return}
 target.innerHTML='<div class="section"><h3>Dosificación individual de los ejercicios seleccionados</h3>'+Array.from(selectedSessionExercises.entries()).map(([id,v])=>{
  const x=exerciseCatalog.find(e=>e.id===id);if(!x)return '';
  const isReps=(v.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones';const comp=exerciseCompatibility(x);const needsOverride=comp.level==='restricted'||comp.level==='review';
  const overrideFields=needsOverride?`<div class="notice warn full-span"><strong>Confirmación del entrenador requerida.</strong><p>${esc(comp.reason)}</p><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-ex-field="professional_verified" data-ex-id="${id}" ${v.professional_verified?'checked':''}> Confirmo que revisé la orientación profesional y la adaptación específica antes de incluir este ejercicio.</label><label>Justificación / indicación documentada</label><textarea data-ex-field="override_note" data-ex-id="${id}" placeholder="Anota la indicación profesional, la adaptación y las condiciones de ejecución.">${esc(v.override_note||'')}</textarea></div>`:'';
  return `<div class="exercise-detail" data-exercise-detail="${id}"><div class="row between"><div><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><div class="exercise-meta">Sugerencia: ${x.suggested_sets||'—'} × ${x.suggested_reps||'—'} ${esc(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · CE ${esc(x.suggested_ce||'no aplica / por definir')}</div></div><button type="button" class="secondary action-btn" data-remove-exercise="${id}">Quitar</button></div><div class="exercise-fields"><div><label>Series</label><input type="number" min="1" step="1" required data-ex-field="sets" data-ex-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.sets)}"></div><div><label>${isReps?'Repeticiones/serie':`Cantidad (${esc(v.dose_unit)})/serie`}</label><input type="number" min="1" step="1" required data-ex-field="reps" data-ex-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.reps)}"></div><div><label>Carga (kg)</label><input type="number" min="0" step="0.5" data-ex-field="external_load_kg" data-ex-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.external_load_kg)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div>${isReps?`<div><label>Reps posibles</label><input type="number" min="1" step="1" data-ex-field="reps_possible" data-ex-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.reps_possible)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div>`:`<div><label>Carácter del esfuerzo</label><div class="small">No se calcula para dosis por tiempo o distancia. Registra el RPE del ejercicio.</div></div>`}<div><label>RPE ejercicio</label><input type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.5" data-ex-field="exercise_rpe" data-ex-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.exercise_rpe)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div>${isReps?`<div><label>Carácter del esfuerzo</label><div class="ce-value" data-ce-value="${id}">${esc(ceFrom(v.reps,v.reps_possible))}</div></div>`:''}</div>${overrideFields}<div><label>Observaciones del ejercicio</label><textarea data-ex-field="notes" data-ex-id="${id}" placeholder="Calidad técnica, velocidad, restricciones, pausas…">${esc(v.notes)}</textarea></div></div>`
 }).join('')+'</div>';
}
async function setupSessionForm(){
 const form=$('sessionForm');if(!form)return;selectedSessionExercises=new Map();
 const athleteId=activeAthleteId();
 const [{data:catalog,error},{data:history,error:historyError},{data:injuries,error:injuryError}]=await Promise.all([
  db.from('exercise_catalog').select('*').eq('is_active',true).order('name'),
  db.from('training_session_exercises').select('*, exercise_catalog(name), training_sessions(session_date,week,session_type)').eq('athlete_id',athleteId).order('created_at',{ascending:false}).limit(300),
  db.from('injuries').select('*').eq('athlete_id',athleteId).order('onset_date',{ascending:false})
 ]);
 if(error){$('exerciseChoices').innerHTML=`<div class="notice error">No se pudo cargar el banco de ejercicios: ${esc(error.message)}. Comprueba que ejecutaste la migración de esta actualización en Supabase.</div>`;return}
 if(historyError){$('exerciseChoices').innerHTML=`<div class="notice error">No se pudo cargar el historial de ejercicios: ${esc(historyError.message)}.</div>`;return}
 if(injuryError){$('exerciseChoices').innerHTML=`<div class="notice error">No se pudo consultar el historial de lesiones: ${esc(injuryError.message)}.</div>`;return}
 exerciseCatalog=catalog||[];exerciseHistory=history||[];athleteInjuryContext=injuries||[];
 const typeSelect=$('sessionTypeSelect');let previousType=typeSelect.value;
 const updateExerciseMode=()=>{const usesBank=sessionUsesExerciseBank(typeSelect.value);$('exercisePlanningSection').classList.toggle('hidden',!usesBank);$('sessionNoExerciseNote').classList.toggle('hidden',usesBank);if(usesBank)renderExerciseChoices();else $('exerciseChoices').innerHTML='<div class="no-exercises">Esta jornada se registra sin ejercicios del banco; la duración y el RPE global se utilizarán para calcular la carga interna.</div>'};
 typeSelect.addEventListener('change',()=>{if(selectedSessionExercises.size&&!confirm('Cambiar el tipo de sesión limpiará la selección actual de ejercicios. ¿Deseas continuar?')){typeSelect.value=previousType;return}selectedSessionExercises.clear();previousType=typeSelect.value;updateExerciseMode()});
 $('exerciseChoices').addEventListener('change',e=>{const cb=e.target.closest('[data-exercise-choice]');if(!cb)return;const id=cb.dataset.exerciseChoice,exercise=exerciseCatalog.find(x=>x.id===id);if(cb.checked&&exercise){const ceMatch=String(exercise.suggested_ce||'').match(/\((\d+)\)/);selectedSessionExercises.set(id,{sets:exercise.suggested_sets||3,reps:exercise.suggested_reps||5,dose_unit:exercise.dose_unit||'repeticiones',external_load_kg:'',reps_possible:(exercise.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones'&&ceMatch?Number(ceMatch[1]):'',exercise_rpe:'',notes:'',professional_verified:false,override_note:''})}else selectedSessionExercises.delete(id);renderExerciseChoices()});
 $('selectedExerciseDetails').addEventListener('input',e=>{const el=e.target,id=el.dataset.exId,field=el.dataset.exField;if(!id||!field||!selectedSessionExercises.has(id))return;const current=selectedSessionExercises.get(id);current[field]=el.type==='checkbox'?el.checked:el.value;if(field==='reps'||field==='reps_possible'){const ce=document.querySelector(`[data-ce-value="${id}"]`);if(ce)ce.textContent=ceFrom(current.reps,current.reps_possible)}});
 $('selectedExerciseDetails').addEventListener('click',e=>{const btn=e.target.closest('[data-remove-exercise]');if(!btn)return;selectedSessionExercises.delete(btn.dataset.removeExercise);renderExerciseChoices()});
 updateExerciseMode();
 form.onsubmit=async e=>{
  e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(form),sessionType=fd.get('session_type'),requiresExercises=sessionUsesExerciseBank(sessionType);if(requiresExercises&&!selectedSessionExercises.size){$('sessionFormMsg').textContent='Selecciona al menos un ejercicio recomendado para esta sesión.';$('sessionFormMsg').className='small bad';return}
  for(const [id,v] of selectedSessionExercises){const exercise=exerciseCatalog.find(x=>x.id===id),compat=exerciseCompatibility(exercise);if(!Number(v.sets)||!Number(v.reps)){alert('Completa series y repeticiones de todos los ejercicios seleccionados.');return}if(v.dose_unit==='repeticiones'&&v.reps_possible!==''&&Number(v.reps_possible)<Number(v.reps)){alert('Las repeticiones posibles deben ser iguales o superiores a las realizadas.');return}if(compat.level==='unclassified'){alert(`No puedes registrar ${exercise.name} porque aún no tiene clasificadas sus demandas mecánicas. Solicita al entrenador que revise el catálogo.`);return}if(['restricted','review'].includes(compat.level)){if(profile.role!=='coach'||!compat.canCoachOverride||!v.professional_verified||String(v.override_note||'').trim().length<8){alert(`No puedes registrar ${exercise.name} sin la confirmación y la indicación profesional documentada que exige el sistema.`);return}}}
  const duration=n(fd.get('duration_minutes')),sessionRpe=n(fd.get('session_rpe'));
  if(duration==null||sessionRpe==null){alert('Para calcular la carga interna de sesión debes completar duración y RPE global.');return}
  const payload={athlete_id:activeAthleteId(),session_date:fd.get('session_date'),week:n(fd.get('week')),session_type:fd.get('session_type'),duration_minutes:duration,session_rpe:sessionRpe,session_status:'Realizada',exercise_name:null,sets:null,reps:null,external_load_kg:null,reps_possible:null,effort_character:null,notes:fd.get('notes')||null};
  const {data:session,error:sessionError}=await db.from('training_sessions').insert(payload).select('id').single();if(sessionError){$('sessionFormMsg').textContent='No se pudo guardar la sesión: '+sessionError.message;$('sessionFormMsg').className='small bad';return}
  const details=Array.from(selectedSessionExercises.entries()).map(([exerciseId,v],index)=>{let notes=v.notes||'';if(v.professional_verified){notes=`VERIFICACIÓN DEL ENTRENADOR: se declara revisada la indicación profesional antes de incluir este ejercicio. ${String(v.override_note||'').trim()} ${notes}`.trim()}return {session_id:session.id,athlete_id:activeAthleteId(),exercise_id:exerciseId,exercise_order:index+1,dose_unit:v.dose_unit||'repeticiones',sets:Number(v.sets),reps:Number(v.reps),external_load_kg:n(v.external_load_kg),reps_possible:n(v.reps_possible),effort_character:v.dose_unit==='repeticiones'&&v.reps_possible!==''?`${v.reps}(${v.reps_possible})`:null,exercise_rpe:n(v.exercise_rpe),notes:notes||null}});
  if(details.length){const {error:detailError}=await db.from('training_session_exercises').insert(details);if(detailError){await db.from('training_sessions').delete().eq('id',session.id);$('sessionFormMsg').textContent='La sesión no pudo completarse porque falló el detalle de ejercicios: '+detailError.message;$('sessionFormMsg').className='small bad';return}}
  alert(`Sesión guardada${details.length?' junto con '+details.length+' ejercicio(s)':''}. Carga interna estimada: ${(duration*sessionRpe).toFixed(1)} UA (RPE × minutos).`);await render();
 };
}
async function viewSessions(c){
 const r=await fetchRows('training_sessions');if(r.error)throw r.error;const sessions=r.data||[];let children=[];
 if(sessions.length){const {data,error}=await db.from('training_session_exercises').select('session_id,exercise_catalog(name),sets,reps,dose_unit,external_load_kg,reps_possible,effort_character,exercise_rpe,notes').in('session_id',sessions.map(x=>x.id));if(error)throw error;children=data||[]}
 const grouped={};for(const x of children){(grouped[x.session_id]??=[]).push(x)}
 const sorted=sessions.slice().sort((a,b)=>String(b.session_date||'').localeCompare(String(a.session_date||'')));
 const cards=sorted.map(x=>{const rows=grouped[x.id]||[],done=x.session_status!=='Planificada',load=sessionLoadAU(x),status=done?'Realizada':'Planificada';const exerciseMarkup=rows.length?`<details class="session-exercises"><summary>${rows.length} ejercicio(s) registrado(s) · ver dosificación</summary><div class="session-exercise-list">${rows.map((e,i)=>`<div class="session-exercise-row"><div class="exercise-index">${i+1}</div><div class="session-exercise-main"><strong>${esc(e.exercise_catalog?.name||'Ejercicio')}</strong><span>${esc(e.sets??'—')} × ${esc(e.reps??'—')} ${esc(e.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · ${e.external_load_kg==null?'Sin carga externa':esc(e.external_load_kg)+' kg'}</span></div><div class="session-exercise-side"><strong>${esc(e.effort_character||'CE —')}</strong><span>RPE ${esc(e.exercise_rpe??'—')}</span></div></div>${e.notes?`<p class="exercise-note">${esc(e.notes)}</p>`:''}`).join('')}</div></details>`: `<div class="no-exercises">${sessionTypesWithoutExerciseBank.includes(x.session_type)?'Sesión sin ejercicios asociados al banco.':'No hay detalle de ejercicios registrado.'}</div>`;return `<article class="session-history-card"><div class="session-card-head"><div><div class="session-date-line">${esc(prettyDate(x.session_date,{day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric'}))} <span>· Semana ${esc(x.week??'—')}</span></div><h3>${esc(x.session_type||x.exercise_name||'Sesión sin clasificar')}</h3></div><span class="session-status ${done?'completed':'pending'}">${status}</span></div><div class="session-card-metrics"><div><span>Duración</span><strong>${x.duration_minutes==null?'—':esc(x.duration_minutes)+' min'}</strong></div><div><span>RPE global</span><strong>${x.session_rpe==null?'—':esc(x.session_rpe)+'/10'}</strong></div><div><span>Carga interna</span><strong>${load==null?(done?'Sin datos':'Pendiente'):load.toFixed(1)+' UA'}</strong></div><div><span>Ejercicios</span><strong>${rows.length}</strong></div></div>${exerciseMarkup}${x.notes?`<div class="session-general-note"><span>Observaciones de la sesión</span><p>${esc(x.notes)}</p></div>`:''}<div class="session-card-actions"><span class="small">${done?'Registro de sesión realizada':'Sesión pendiente de ejecución'}</span><div class="actions-cell"><button type="button" class="action-btn edit" data-record-edit="training_sessions" data-record-id="${esc(x.id)}">Editar sesión</button>${canDeleteRecord('training_sessions')?`<button type="button" class="action-btn delete" data-record-delete="training_sessions" data-record-id="${esc(x.id)}">Eliminar</button>`:''}</div></div></article>`}).join('');
 c.innerHTML=sessionForm()+`<section class="card session-history-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">HISTORIAL</div><h2>Sesiones registradas</h2><p class="small">Consulta cada jornada, revisa sus ejercicios y abre la edición completa sin perder los datos existentes.</p></div><span class="badge soft-badge">${sessions.length} sesión(es)</span></div><div class="session-history-grid">${cards||'<div class="empty">Aún no hay sesiones registradas.</div>'}</div></section>`;
}
async function viewExerciseBank(c){
 const athleteId=activeAthleteId();
 const historyRequest=athleteId?db.from('training_session_exercises').select('*, exercise_catalog(name), training_sessions(session_date,week,session_type)').eq('athlete_id',athleteId).order('created_at',{ascending:false}).limit(300):Promise.resolve({data:[],error:null});
 const injuryRequest=athleteId?db.from('injuries').select('*').eq('athlete_id',athleteId).order('onset_date',{ascending:false}):Promise.resolve({data:[],error:null});
 const [{data:catalog,error:catError},{data:history,error:histError},{data:injuries,error:injuryError}]=await Promise.all([
  db.from('exercise_catalog').select('*').eq('is_active',true).order('name'),historyRequest,injuryRequest
 ]);
 if(catError)throw catError;if(histError)throw histError;if(injuryError)throw injuryError;
 exerciseCatalog=catalog||[];exerciseHistory=history||[];athleteInjuryContext=injuries||[];
 const types=['Todos',...sessionTypes.filter(t=>!sessionTypesWithoutExerciseBank.includes(t))];
 const athleteNote=athleteId?`<div class="notice">Análisis individual para <strong>${esc(currentHeader())}</strong>. Los indicadores comparan las zonas anatómicas registradas con las demandas clasificadas de los ejercicios.</div>`:'<div class="notice warn">Vista general del catálogo. Selecciona primero un deportista para activar las alertas individualizadas por antecedentes de lesión.</div>';
 const injurySummary=athleteInjuryContext.length?`<p class="small">Antecedentes cargados: ${athleteInjuryContext.length}. Las lesiones recuperadas sin dolor ni restricciones se muestran como antecedentes a vigilar, no como exclusiones automáticas.</p>`:'<p class="small">No hay antecedentes de lesión registrados para este deportista. La ausencia de registros no equivale a una valoración médica.</p>';
 c.innerHTML=`<section class="card"><div class="row between"><div><h2>Banco de ejercicios</h2><p class="muted">Consulta los ejercicios recomendados por tipo de sesión y su compatibilidad orientativa con los antecedentes registrados.</p></div><span class="badge">${exerciseCatalog.length} ejercicios</span></div>${athleteNote}${injurySummary}<div class="notice warn"><strong>Importante:</strong> las etiquetas describen demandas generales, no diagnostican ni determinan por sí solas una contraindicación o autorización para entrenar. Las decisiones ante lesión activa, dolor o restricciones deben seguir la orientación del profesional de salud.</div><label>Filtrar por tipo de sesión</label><select id="bankTypeFilter">${types.map(t=>`<option value="${esc(t)}">${esc(t)}</option>`).join('')}</select><div id="bankExerciseGrid" class="exercise-grid section"></div></section><section class="card exercise-history"><h2>Historial y progresión por ejercicio</h2><p class="small">Selecciona un ejercicio para ver su utilización durante el proceso: series, repeticiones, carga externa y carácter del esfuerzo.</p><label>Ejercicio</label><select id="historyExerciseSelect"><option value="">Selecciona un ejercicio</option>${exerciseCatalog.map(x=>`<option value="${x.id}">${esc(x.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select><div id="exerciseHistoryResult" class="section"><div class="no-exercises">Todavía no has seleccionado un ejercicio.</div></div></section>`;
 const draw=()=>{
  const filter=$('bankTypeFilter').value;
  const list=(filter==='Todos'||filter==='Otra / personalizada')?exerciseCatalog:exerciseCatalog.filter(x=>(x.session_types||[]).includes(filter));
  $('bankExerciseGrid').innerHTML=list.map(x=>{
   const usage=usageFor(x.id),comp=exerciseCompatibility(x);
   const flagged=['restricted','review','unclassified'].includes(comp.level)||(comp.level==='monitor'&&impactRank(x.impact_level)>=2);
   const alternatives=flagged?compatibleAlternatives(x,filter):[];
   const alt=flagged?`<div class="notice warn"><strong>${alternatives.length?'Alternativas para conversar con el entrenador:':'No se identificó una alternativa clasificada para este tipo de sesión.'}</strong>${alternatives.length?`<ul>${alternatives.map(a=>`<li>${esc(a)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:`<p>Se recomienda conversar con el entrenador para valorar el cambio de este ejercicio o la modificación de la sesión.</p>`}<span class="small">Las opciones son orientativas; no constituyen sustituciones automáticas ni prescripciones terapéuticas.</span></div>`:'';
   return `<article class="exercise-card ${flagged?'exercise-warning':''}"><div class="row between"><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3>${compatibilityBadge(comp)}</div><p>${esc(x.description||'')}</p><p><strong>Zona principal:</strong> ${esc(x.primary_area||'No especificada')} · <strong>Nivel:</strong> ${esc(x.level)}</p><p><strong>Material:</strong> ${esc(x.equipment||'No especificado')}</p><p><strong>Demandas:</strong> ${esc((x.movement_demands||[]).join(', ')||'No clasificadas')} · <strong>Impacto catalogado:</strong> ${esc(x.impact_level||'No definido')}</p><p><strong>Zonas a vigilar:</strong> ${esc((x.injury_watch_areas||[]).join(', ')||'Sin clasificación')}</p><p><strong>Dosificación orientativa:</strong> ${x.suggested_sets||'—'} × ${x.suggested_reps||'—'} ${esc(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · CE ${esc(x.suggested_ce||'no aplica / por definir')}</p><p><strong>Clave técnica:</strong> ${esc(x.coaching_cues||'Aplicar supervisión técnica.')}</p>${exerciseDemoMarkup(x,{editable:profile.role==='coach'})}<div class="exercise-tags">${(x.session_types||[]).map(t=>`<span class="exercise-tag">${esc(t)}</span>`).join('')}</div><p class="small">${esc(comp.reason)}</p>${alt}<p class="section">${usage.count?`Historial de ${usage.count} registro(s) · última vez: ${esc(usage.last||'—')}`:'Sin registros para este deportista'}</p></article>`;
  }).join('')||'<div class="no-exercises">No hay ejercicios para ese filtro.</div>';
 };
 $('bankTypeFilter').onchange=draw;draw();
 $('bankExerciseGrid').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{
  const form=e.target.closest('[data-demo-form]');if(!form)return;e.preventDefault();
  if(profile.role!=='coach'){alert('Solo el entrenador puede modificar los recursos demostrativos del catálogo.');return}
  const id=form.dataset.demoForm,fd=new FormData(form),raw=String(fd.get('demo_url')||'').trim(),type=String(fd.get('demo_type')||'video');
  const url=raw?validHttpUrl(raw):null;if(raw&&!url){alert('La URL debe ser una dirección pública http:// o https:// válida.');return}
  if(url&&!['video','imagen','gif'].includes(type)){alert('Selecciona un tipo de recurso válido.');return}
  const payload={demo_url:url,demo_type:type,demo_caption:String(fd.get('demo_caption')||'').trim()||null};
  const {data,error}=await db.from('exercise_catalog').update(payload).eq('id',id).select('*').maybeSingle();
  if(error){alert('No se pudo guardar el recurso: '+error.message+' . Comprueba que ejecutaste la migración de esta actualización.');return}
  if(!data){alert('No se modificó el ejercicio. Comprueba que has iniciado sesión como entrenador.');return}
  const idx=exerciseCatalog.findIndex(x=>x.id===id);if(idx>=0)exerciseCatalog[idx]={...exerciseCatalog[idx],...data};
  alert('Recurso demostrativo guardado.');draw();
 });
 $('bankExerciseGrid').addEventListener('click',async e=>{
  const btn=e.target.closest('[data-demo-clear]');if(!btn)return;
  if(profile.role!=='coach')return;
  const id=btn.dataset.demoClear;if(!confirm('¿Quitar el recurso demostrativo guardado para este ejercicio?'))return;
  const {data,error}=await db.from('exercise_catalog').update({demo_url:null,demo_caption:null}).eq('id',id).select('*').maybeSingle();
  if(error){alert('No se pudo quitar el recurso: '+error.message);return}
  if(data){const idx=exerciseCatalog.findIndex(x=>x.id===id);if(idx>=0)exerciseCatalog[idx]={...exerciseCatalog[idx],...data};draw()}
 });
 $('historyExerciseSelect').onchange=()=>renderExerciseHistory($('historyExerciseSelect').value);
}
function renderExerciseHistory(id){const target=$('exerciseHistoryResult');if(!id){target.innerHTML='<div class="no-exercises">Selecciona un ejercicio para consultar su historial.</div>';return}const rows=exerciseHistory.filter(x=>x.exercise_id===id);if(!rows.length){target.innerHTML='<div class="no-exercises">Este deportista todavía no tiene registros de este ejercicio. Puedes incorporarlo en una sesión para iniciar su seguimiento.</div>';return}const name=rows[0].exercise_catalog?.name||'Ejercicio';target.innerHTML=recordTable('Progresión de '+esc(name),['Fecha','Semana','Tipo de sesión','Series × reps','Carga (kg)','CE','RPE'],rows,x=>[x.training_sessions?.session_date||'—',x.training_sessions?.week||'—',x.training_sessions?.session_type||'—',`${x.sets} × ${x.reps} ${x.dose_unit||'repeticiones'}`,x.external_load_kg==null?'Peso corporal / no consignada':x.external_load_kg,x.effort_character||'No calculado',x.exercise_rpe??'—'],'training_session_exercises')}
function testForm(){return formCard('Registrar prueba física','testForm',input('Fecha','test_date','date')+input('Semana (1–8)','week','number','min="1" max="8"')+select('Prueba','test_name',['CMJ','SJ','DJ','Press banca','Sentadilla','Cargada','Sentadilla de arranque','Remo','Subida de lazo'].map(x=>`<option>${x}</option>`).join(''))+input('Resultado','result_value','number','step="any"')+select('Unidad','unit','<option>cm</option><option>W</option><option>kg</option><option>repeticiones</option><option>segundos</option><option>metros</option>')+`<div><label>Protocolo y observaciones (mismo protocolo para comparar)</label><textarea name="notes"></textarea></div>`)}
function decisionView(decisions,wellness,sessions,injuries){const rec=makeRecommendation(wellness,sessions,injuries);const seven=recentSevenDayLoad(sessions);const loadCard=panel('Contexto de carga interna reciente',`<div class="grid three"><div><div class="small">Carga sRPE en ventana de 7 días</div><div class="stat">${seven.total==null?'—':seven.total.toFixed(1)+' UA'}</div></div><div><div class="small">Sesiones consideradas</div><div class="stat">${seven.count}</div></div><div><div class="small">Ventana analizada</div><div class="small">${seven.start||'Sin datos'} → ${seven.end||'Sin datos'}</div></div></div><p class="small">Carga sRPE = duración (min) × RPE global. Es un indicador de carga interna y debe interpretarse con bienestar, rendimiento, calendario técnico-táctico y lesiones; no tiene un umbral universal para decidir por sí solo.</p>`);return loadCard+`<section class="card"><h2>Recomendación orientativa para ${esc(currentHeader())}</h2><div class="notice ${rec.level}"><strong>${esc(rec.title)}</strong><p>${esc(rec.text)}</p><p><strong>Qué revisar:</strong> ${esc(rec.action)}</p></div><p class="small">La regla es heurística y transparente, no un modelo clínico validado. El entrenador confirma o descarta la sugerencia antes de modificar el entrenamiento.</p></section>${formCard('Registrar decisión del entrenador','decisionForm',input('Fecha','decision_date','date')+input('Semana (1–8)','week','number','min="1" max="8"')+select('Decisión','action','<option>Mantener carga</option><option>Progresar repeticiones manteniendo CE</option><option>Aumentar carga externa conservando CE</option><option>Reducir volumen</option><option>Reducir intensidad / exigencia</option><option>Modificar o sustituir ejercicio</option><option>Sesión de recuperación</option><option>Suspender ejercicio y solicitar valoración</option>')+`<div><label>Justificación con indicadores observados</label><textarea name="rationale" required placeholder="Ej. fatiga media 7/10, sueño 4/10, dolor 2/10; por ello…"></textarea></div>`)}${recordTable('Historial de decisiones',['Fecha','Semana','Decisión','Justificación'],decisions,x=>[x.decision_date,x.week,x.action,x.rationale],'load_decisions')}`}
function makeRecommendation(w,s,i){if(!w.length)return {level:'warn',title:'Datos insuficientes',text:'Aún no hay registros de bienestar. No se recomienda progresar automáticamente.',action:'Registrar bienestar durante varios días y revisar la carga programada.'};const recent=w.slice(0,3),avg=k=>recent.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x[k]||0),0)/recent.length;const fatigue=avg('fatigue'),sleep=avg('sleep_quality'),soreness=avg('muscle_soreness'),pain=avg('pain_level'),stress=avg('stress');const active=i.some(x=>x.status==='Activa'||x.status==='En recuperación');if(pain>=7){return {level:'error',title:'Alerta por dolor elevado',text:`Dolor medio reciente de ${pain.toFixed(1)}/10. El dato requiere revisión antes de continuar con ejercicios que provoquen molestias.`,action:'No aumentar carga; comunicarlo al entrenador y solicitar valoración profesional según el contexto.'}}if(active){return {level:'warn',title:'Antecedente con estado no recuperado',text:'Existe una lesión registrada como activa o en recuperación.',action:'Revisar restricciones documentadas y validación profesional antes de elegir ejercicios o modificar la carga.'}}if(recent.length<3){return {level:'warn',title:'Seguimiento todavía corto',text:'Hay menos de tres registros recientes de bienestar.',action:'Mantener el criterio conservador y recopilar más datos antes de progresar.'}}const flags=[fatigue>=7,sleep<=4,soreness>=7,stress>=8].filter(Boolean).length;if(flags>=2){return {level:'warn',title:'Señales acumuladas de recuperación insuficiente',text:`En los últimos ${recent.length} registros: fatiga ${fatigue.toFixed(1)}/10, sueño ${sleep.toFixed(1)}/10, dolor muscular ${soreness.toFixed(1)}/10 y estrés ${stress.toFixed(1)}/10.`,action:'Considerar una reducción provisional del volumen y evitar progresar; verificar rendimiento, técnica y evolución en la siguiente sesión.'}}if(fatigue<=4.5&&sleep>=6&&soreness<=4.5&&pain<=3){return {level:'good',title:'Respuesta de bienestar favorable',text:`Fatiga ${fatigue.toFixed(1)}/10, sueño ${sleep.toFixed(1)}/10 y dolor muscular ${soreness.toFixed(1)}/10.`,action:'Si el rendimiento y la técnica también están estables o mejoran, valorar una progresión pequeña manteniendo el carácter del esfuerzo previsto.'}}return {level:'',title:'Respuesta mixta: mantener y reevaluar',text:`Fatiga ${fatigue.toFixed(1)}/10, sueño ${sleep.toFixed(1)}/10, dolor muscular ${soreness.toFixed(1)}/10, dolor ${pain.toFixed(1)}/10.`,action:'Mantener la carga planificada sin aumentos automáticos; contrastar con RPE, rendimiento, CE y observación técnica.'}}
function localISODate(date=new Date()){
 const y=date.getFullYear(),m=String(date.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0'),d=String(date.getDate()).padStart(2,'0');
 return `${y}-${m}-${d}`;
}
function tomorrowISODate(){const d=new Date();d.setDate(d.getDate()+1);return localISODate(d)}
function plannerWellnessSummary(wellness){
 const recent=(wellness||[]).filter(x=>x.log_date<=localISODate()).sort((a,b)=>String(b.log_date).localeCompare(String(a.log_date))).slice(0,3);
 if(!recent.length)return {count:0,recent,averages:null,flags:0,highPain:false};
 const avg=k=>recent.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+(x[k]==null?0:Number(x[k])),0)/recent.length;
 const averages={fatigue:avg('fatigue'),sleep:avg('sleep_quality'),soreness:avg('muscle_soreness'),pain:avg('pain_level'),stress:avg('stress'),motivation:avg('motivation')};
 const latest=recent[0];
 const flags=[averages.fatigue>=7,averages.sleep<=4,averages.soreness>=7,averages.stress>=8].filter(Boolean).length;
 return {count:recent.length,recent,averages,flags,highPain:Number(latest.pain_level||0)>=7,latest};
}
function planLoadWindow(sessions,anchorDate=localISODate()){
 const end=new Date(anchorDate+'T12:00:00');const startDate=new Date(end);startDate.setDate(startDate.getDate()-6);const start=localISODate(startDate);
 const previousEndDate=new Date(startDate);previousEndDate.setDate(previousEndDate.getDate()-1);const previousEnd=localISODate(previousEndDate);
 const previousStartDate=new Date(previousEndDate);previousStartDate.setDate(previousStartDate.getDate()-6);const previousStart=localISODate(previousStartDate);
 const selected=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>x.session_date>=start&&x.session_date<=anchorDate&&sessionLoadAU(x)!=null);
 const previous=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>x.session_date>=previousStart&&x.session_date<=previousEnd&&sessionLoadAU(x)!=null);
 const total=selected.length?sumLoadAU(selected):null,previousTotal=previous.length?sumLoadAU(previous):null;
 const changePct=total!=null&&previousTotal!=null&&previousTotal>0?((total-previousTotal)/previousTotal)*100:null;
 return {start,end:anchorDate,total,count:selected.length,minutes:selected.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.duration_minutes||0),0),previousStart,previousEnd,previousTotal,previousCount:previous.length,changePct};
}
const plannerStrengthCycle=['Fuerza del tren inferior y tracción','Fuerza del tren superior y control','Potencia y fuerza específica'];
function nextStrengthType(sessions){
 const latest=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'&&x.session_date<=localISODate()&&plannerStrengthCycle.includes(x.session_type)).sort((a,b)=>String(b.session_date).localeCompare(String(a.session_date)))[0];
 if(!latest)return plannerStrengthCycle[0];const index=plannerStrengthCycle.indexOf(latest.session_type);return plannerStrengthCycle[(index+1)%plannerStrengthCycle.length];
}
function plannerPhaseAdvice(week){
 const w=Number(week)||1;
 if(w<=2)return {phase:'Adaptación',setsFactor:1,note:'Priorizar familiarización, técnica y tolerancia inicial; no progresar solo por calendario.'};
 if(w<=4)return {phase:'Aumento',setsFactor:1,note:'Valorar progresión únicamente si el rendimiento, la técnica y la recuperación lo permiten.'};
 if(w<=6)return {phase:'Punto álgido',setsFactor:1,note:'Etapa de mayor estímulo planificado; controlar con especial atención la fatiga y la calidad.'};
 return {phase:'Tapering',setsFactor:.65,note:'Propuesta con menor número de series para reducir volumen y conservar la calidad; ajustar según respuesta.'};
}
function planCandidateExercises(type,week,history){
 if(!type||!sessionUsesExerciseBank(type))return [];
 const matching=exerciseCatalog.filter(x=>(x.session_types||[]).includes(type));
 const eligible=matching.map(exercise=>({exercise,compat:exerciseCompatibility(exercise)})).filter(x=>['ok','monitor'].includes(x.compat.level));
 const usageMap=new Map();
 for(const row of history||[]){const date=row.training_sessions?.session_date||'';const current=usageMap.get(row.exercise_id)||{count:0,last:'',recent:false};current.count++;if(date>current.last)current.last=date;if(date&&date>=localISODate(new Date(Date.now()-14*86400000)))current.recent=true;usageMap.set(row.exercise_id,current)}
 const phase=plannerPhaseAdvice(week);
 return eligible.sort((a,b)=>{
  const ua=usageMap.get(a.exercise.id)||{count:0,last:'',recent:false};const ub=usageMap.get(b.exercise.id)||{count:0,last:'',recent:false};
  return Number(ua.recent)-Number(ub.recent)||ua.count-ub.count||String(ua.last).localeCompare(String(ub.last))||String(a.exercise.name).localeCompare(String(b.exercise.name));
 }).slice(0,5).map(x=>({...x.exercise,compatibility:x.compat,usage:usageMap.get(x.exercise.id)||{count:0,last:'',recent:false},recommendedSets:Math.max(1,Math.round(Number(x.exercise.suggested_sets||3)*phase.setsFactor))}));
}
function buildTomorrowRecommendation(sessions,wellness,injuries){
 const completed=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'&&x.session_date<=localISODate()).sort((a,b)=>String(b.session_date).localeCompare(String(a.session_date)));
 const latest=completed[0]||null;const latestStrength=completed.find(x=>plannerStrengthCycle.includes(x.session_type))||null;
 const wellnessInfo=plannerWellnessSummary(wellness);const activeInjuries=(injuries||[]).filter(x=>['Activa','En recuperación'].includes(x.status));
 const currentPain=wellnessInfo.highPain||(injuries||[]).some(x=>Number(x.current_pain||0)>=7);
 const load=planLoadWindow(sessions,localISODate());
 let type=nextStrengthType(completed),level='good',title='Secuencia de fuerza sugerida',message='',action='El entrenador debe contrastar la propuesta con el horario técnico-táctico, el rendimiento observado y la disponibilidad del deportista.',noExercise=false,duration=55;
 if(currentPain){type='Recuperación activa y movilidad';level='error';title='Revisión prioritaria antes de programar ejercicios';message='Se registró dolor elevado (7/10 o superior). No se propondrán ejercicios automáticamente. El entrenador debe aclarar el origen, revisar la situación y solicitar valoración profesional cuando corresponda.';action='No utilizar esta sugerencia como autorización para entrenar. Acordar con el deportista y el profesional de salud si procede descanso, modificación o actividad adaptada.';noExercise=true;duration=30}
 else if(wellnessInfo.flags>=2){type='Recuperación activa y movilidad';level='warn';title='Señales de recuperación insuficiente';message=`Los últimos ${wellnessInfo.count} registros muestran varias señales a vigilar (fatiga ${wellnessInfo.averages.fatigue.toFixed(1)}/10, sueño ${wellnessInfo.averages.sleep.toFixed(1)}/10, dolor muscular ${wellnessInfo.averages.soreness.toFixed(1)}/10). Se propone una jornada de recuperación en lugar de aumentar el estímulo.`;action='Revisar el bienestar al día siguiente y acordar el contenido con el entrenador. Evitar progresar la carga hasta reevaluar.';duration=35}
 else if(wellnessInfo.count<3){level='warn';title='Propuesta conservadora: seguimiento corto';message=`Solo hay ${wellnessInfo.count} registro(s) reciente(s) de bienestar. La rotación sugiere ${type.toLowerCase()}, pero la información todavía es limitada.`;action='Mantener una dosificación conservadora, comprobar la técnica y completar el seguimiento de bienestar antes de progresar.';duration=50}
 else if(activeInjuries.length){level='warn';title='Propuesta condicionada por lesión activa o en recuperación';message=`Hay ${activeInjuries.length} lesión/lesiones con estado activo o en recuperación. La selección de ejercicios excluirá las coincidencias de zona identificadas por el banco, pero esto no reemplaza las restricciones profesionales.`;action='Revisar cada ejercicio y las indicaciones de salud registradas. Si no existe una alternativa clasificada, conversar con el entrenador y el profesional responsable antes de programar.';duration=45}
 else if(latest){message=`La sesión realizada más recientemente fue “${latest.session_type||'tipo no especificado'}” el ${latest.session_date}. La rotación de fuerza propone ahora “${type}” para alternar los estímulos. La secuencia es una sugerencia y debe contrastarse con la planificación real.`;duration=55}
 else{level='warn';title='Primera propuesta: falta historial de sesiones';message='No hay sesiones realizadas registradas. Se propone comenzar con fuerza del tren inferior y tracción como ejemplo de organización, pero debe validarse con la planificación y experiencia del deportista.';action='Verificar experiencia específica en fuerza, pruebas iniciales, técnica, historial de lesiones y calendario antes de confirmar.';duration=50}
 if(activeInjuries.length&&!currentPain&&!message.includes('lesión activa'))message+=` Además, hay ${activeInjuries.length} antecedente(s) activo(s) o en recuperación que deben revisarse.`;
 return {type,level,title,message,action,duration,latest,latestStrength,wellnessInfo,activeInjuries,load,noExercise};
}
function renderPlannerExercisePicker(){
 const target=$('plannerExerciseCandidates'),details=$('plannerExerciseDetails');if(!target||!details||!plannerState)return;
 const type=$('plannerSessionType').value;
 if(!sessionUsesExerciseBank(type)){target.innerHTML='<div class="notice">Este tipo de sesión se puede registrar sin ejercicios del banco. Completa la duración prevista; el RPE real se incorporará después de realizar la sesión.</div>';details.innerHTML='';return}
 if(plannerState.noExercise){target.innerHTML='<div class="notice error">Por los indicadores de dolor registrados, el sistema no propondrá ejercicios automáticamente. Se recomienda revisar la situación con el entrenador y el profesional de salud antes de decidir el contenido.</div>';details.innerHTML='';return}
 const candidates=planCandidateExercises(type,$('plannerWeek').value,plannerState.history);
 if(!candidates.length){target.innerHTML='<div class="notice warn">No se identificó una alternativa clasificada para este tipo de sesión. Se recomienda conversar con el entrenador para valorar el cambio del ejercicio o la modificación de la sesión.</div>';details.innerHTML='';return}
 target.innerHTML=candidates.map((x,index)=>{const checked=plannerState.selected.has(x.id);const comp=x.compatibility;return `<div class="plan-exercise"><label><input type="checkbox" data-plan-exercise="${x.id}" ${checked?'checked':''}><span><strong>${esc(x.name)}</strong><br><span class="small">${esc(x.primary_area||'Zona no especificada')} · ${esc(x.level)} · ${esc(x.equipment||'Material no especificado')}</span></span></label><div class="compatibility-line">${compatibilityBadge(comp)}</div><p class="small">${esc(x.description||'')} · Impacto: ${esc(x.impact_level||'No definido')}</p>${exerciseDemoMarkup(x,{compact:true})}<p class="small">Sugerencia del banco: ${x.recommendedSets} × ${esc(x.suggested_reps||'—')} ${esc(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · CE ${esc(x.suggested_ce||'por definir')}. ${x.usage.count?`Historial: ${x.usage.count} uso(s), último ${esc(x.usage.last||'—')}.`:'Sin historial de uso.'}</p>${index<3?'<span class="badge">Recomendación inicial</span>':''}</div>`}).join('');
 details.innerHTML=Array.from(plannerState.selected.entries()).map(([id,v])=>{const x=exerciseCatalog.find(e=>e.id===id);if(!x)return '';const isReps=(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones';return `<div class="exercise-detail"><div class="row between"><div><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><div class="exercise-meta">Dosificación propuesta · ${esc(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')}</div></div><button type="button" class="secondary action-btn" data-plan-remove="${id}">Quitar</button></div><div class="plan-fields"><div><label>Series</label><input type="number" min="1" data-plan-field="sets" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.sets)}"></div><div><label>${isReps?'Repeticiones':'Cantidad por serie'}</label><input type="number" min="1" data-plan-field="reps" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.reps)}"></div><div><label>Carga kg</label><input type="number" min="0" step="0.5" data-plan-field="external_load_kg" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.external_load_kg)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div><div><label>Reps posibles</label><input type="number" min="1" data-plan-field="reps_possible" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.reps_possible)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div></div><div class="plan-fields"><div><label>RPE del ejercicio</label><input type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.5" data-plan-field="exercise_rpe" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.exercise_rpe)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div><div class="full-span"><label>Notas / adaptación</label><input type="text" data-plan-field="notes" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.notes)}" placeholder="Indicaciones técnicas o ajuste individual"></div></div><p class="small">CE orientativo propuesto: <strong>${esc(v.reps&&v.reps_possible?`${v.reps}(${v.reps_possible})`:'Pendiente de definir')}</strong>. La carga en kg debe seleccionarse durante la supervisión del entrenador, no inferirse de la categoría de peso.</p></div>`}).join('');
}
async function savePlannedSession(form){
 const fd=new FormData(form),type=fd.get('session_type'),date=fd.get('session_date'),week=n(fd.get('week')),duration=n(fd.get('duration_minutes'));
 if(!date||!week||week<1||week>8||duration==null||duration<=0){note('plannerMessage','Completa una fecha, semana entre 1 y 8 y duración prevista válida.','error');return}
 if(!plannerState.noExercise&&sessionUsesExerciseBank(type)&&plannerState.selected.size===0){note('plannerMessage','Selecciona al menos un ejercicio o cambia el tipo de sesión.','error');return}
 if(date<localISODate()){note('plannerMessage','La fecha de una sesión planificada no puede estar en el pasado.','error');return}
 const duplicate=(plannerState.sessions||[]).some(x=>x.session_date===date&&x.session_status==='Planificada');if(duplicate&&!confirm('Ya existe una sesión planificada para esa fecha. ¿Deseas guardar otra sesión para el mismo día?'))return;
 for(const [id,v] of plannerState.selected){if(!Number(v.sets)||!Number(v.reps)){note('plannerMessage','Completa series y repeticiones de cada ejercicio seleccionado.','error');return}if(v.reps_possible!==''&&Number(v.reps_possible)<Number(v.reps)){note('plannerMessage','Las repeticiones posibles no pueden ser inferiores a las realizadas.','error');return}const ex=exerciseCatalog.find(x=>x.id===id),comp=ex?exerciseCompatibility(ex):null;if(!ex||!comp||!['ok','monitor'].includes(comp.level)){note('plannerMessage','Un ejercicio seleccionado dejó de ser compatible con la clasificación actual. Actualiza la selección y revisa el historial de lesiones.','error');return}}
 const recommendation=plannerState.recommendation;
 const notes=[fd.get('notes')||'',`Planificación orientativa generada por el asistente para ${date}. Etapa: ${plannerPhaseAdvice(week).phase}.`,recommendation.message,recommendation.action].filter(Boolean).join('\n\n');
 const payload={athlete_id:activeAthleteId(),session_date:date,week,session_type:type,duration_minutes:duration,session_rpe:null,session_status:'Planificada',exercise_name:null,sets:null,reps:null,external_load_kg:null,reps_possible:null,effort_character:null,notes};
 const {data:session,error}=await db.from('training_sessions').insert(payload).select('id').single();if(error){note('plannerMessage','No se pudo guardar la planificación: '+error.message,'error');return}
 const details=Array.from(plannerState.selected.entries()).map(([id,v],index)=>{const ex=exerciseCatalog.find(x=>x.id===id);return {session_id:session.id,athlete_id:activeAthleteId(),exercise_id:id,exercise_order:index+1,dose_unit:ex?.dose_unit||'repeticiones',sets:Number(v.sets),reps:Number(v.reps),external_load_kg:n(v.external_load_kg),reps_possible:n(v.reps_possible),effort_character:(ex?.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones'&&v.reps_possible!==''?`${v.reps}(${v.reps_possible})`:null,exercise_rpe:n(v.exercise_rpe),notes:v.notes||null}});
 if(details.length){const {error:detailError}=await db.from('training_session_exercises').insert(details);if(detailError){await db.from('training_sessions').delete().eq('id',session.id);note('plannerMessage','No se guardaron los ejercicios. La planificación incompleta fue revertida: '+detailError.message,'error');return}}
 alert('Planificación guardada. No se ha calculado carga sRPE porque la sesión está pendiente. Cuando se realice, edítala en Sesiones, cambia el estado a “Realizada” e introduce la duración real y el RPE global.');await render();
}
async function viewPlanner(c){
 if(profile.role!=='coach'){c.innerHTML=panel('Acceso restringido','Este apartado está disponible para el entrenador.');return}
 const athleteId=activeAthleteId();if(!athleteId){c.innerHTML=panel('Selecciona un deportista','Elige primero un luchador desde el selector superior.');return}
 c.innerHTML=panel('Planificador diario','Consultando sesiones, bienestar, lesiones y banco de ejercicios…');
 const [sr,wr,ir,cr,hr]=await Promise.all([
  fetchRows('training_sessions',300),fetchRows('wellness_logs',60),fetchRows('injuries',100),
  db.from('exercise_catalog').select('*').eq('is_active',true).order('name'),
  db.from('training_session_exercises').select('exercise_id,created_at,training_sessions(session_date,week,session_status)').eq('athlete_id',athleteId).order('created_at',{ascending:false}).limit(300)
 ]);
 for(const result of [sr,wr,ir,cr,hr])if(result.error)throw result.error;
 const sessions=sr.data||[],wellness=wr.data||[],injuries=ir.data||[];exerciseCatalog=cr.data||[];athleteInjuryContext=injuries;exerciseHistory=hr.data||[];
 const recommendation=buildTomorrowRecommendation(sessions,wellness,injuries);const latestWeek=(sessions.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'&&x.week!=null).sort((a,b)=>String(b.session_date).localeCompare(String(a.session_date)))[0]?.week)||1;
 plannerState={sessions,wellness,injuries,history:exerciseHistory,recommendation,noExercise:recommendation.noExercise,selected:new Map()};
 const phase=plannerPhaseAdvice(latestWeek),load=recommendation.load,wi=recommendation.wellnessInfo;
 const latest= recommendation.latest;
 const summary=`<div class="planner-grid"><div class="planner-metric"><span class="small">Carga sRPE últimos 7 días</span><strong>${load.total==null?'—':load.total.toFixed(1)+' UA'}</strong><span class="small">${load.count} sesión(es) realizadas · ${load.start} a ${load.end}</span><span class="small">${load.previousTotal==null?'Sin periodo previo comparable':`Periodo previo: ${load.previousTotal.toFixed(1)} UA (${load.previousCount} sesiones) · variación descriptiva ${load.changePct==null?'—':(load.changePct>0?'+':'')+load.changePct.toFixed(1)+'%'}`}</span></div><div class="planner-metric"><span class="small">Última sesión realizada</span><strong style="font-size:16px">${esc(latest?.session_type||'Sin historial')}</strong><span class="small">${latest?`${latest.session_date} · ${formatLoadAU(latest)}`:'Aún no hay sesiones'}</span></div><div class="planner-metric"><span class="small">Bienestar reciente</span><strong style="font-size:16px">${wi.averages?`Fatiga ${wi.averages.fatigue.toFixed(1)}/10`:'Sin datos'}</strong><span class="small">${wi.count} registro(s) · sueño ${wi.averages?wi.averages.sleep.toFixed(1)+'/10':'—'} · dolor ${wi.averages?wi.averages.pain.toFixed(1)+'/10':'—'}</span></div><div class="planner-metric"><span class="small">Etapa de referencia</span><strong style="font-size:16px">${phase.phase}</strong><span class="small">Semana de referencia ${latestWeek}/8</span></div></div>`;
 const warning=panel('Lectura de los indicadores',`<div class="notice ${recommendation.level==='error'?'error':recommendation.level==='warn'?'warn':''}"><strong>${esc(recommendation.title)}</strong><p>${esc(recommendation.message)}</p><p><strong>Acción sugerida:</strong> ${esc(recommendation.action)}</p></div><p class="small">Carga sRPE = duración × RPE global. Se presenta la comparación con los siete días anteriores cuando hay registros suficientes; el porcentaje es descriptivo y no activa una decisión automática ni utiliza un umbral universal. La recomendación también debe contrastarse con la programación de lucha, el calendario competitivo, la técnica y la disponibilidad del deportista.</p>${recommendation.activeInjuries.length?`<div class="notice warn">Lesiones activas/en recuperación registradas: ${recommendation.activeInjuries.map(x=>esc(`${x.body_area}: ${x.injury_type}`)).join(' · ')}. Revisa las restricciones antes de aprobar ejercicios.</div>`:''}`);
 c.innerHTML=panel('Asistente de planificación para mañana',`<p class="muted">Propuesta individual para ${esc(currentHeader())}. El entrenador revisa y decide qué sesión se programa.</p>${summary}`)+warning+`<section class="card"><h2>Preparar sesión</h2><form id="plannerForm"><div class="grid two"><div><label>Fecha prevista</label><input id="plannerDate" name="session_date" type="date" value="${tomorrowISODate()}" min="${localISODate()}" required></div><div><label>Semana del proceso (1–8)</label><select id="plannerWeek" name="week" required>${Array.from({length:8},(_,i)=>`<option value="${i+1}" ${i+1===Number(latestWeek)?'selected':''}>Semana ${i+1} · ${phaseName(i+1)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="full-span"><label>Tipo de sesión sugerido (editable por el entrenador)</label><select id="plannerSessionType" name="session_type" required>${sessionTypes.map(t=>`<option value="${esc(t)}" ${t===recommendation.type?'selected':''}>${esc(t)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div><label>Duración prevista (minutos)</label><input name="duration_minutes" type="number" min="1" value="${recommendation.duration}" required></div><div class="full-span"><label>Justificación / indicaciones para la sesión</label><textarea name="notes" placeholder="Ajustes que el entrenador desea dejar registrados">${esc(recommendation.message+' '+recommendation.action)}</textarea></div></div><div class="section"><h3>Ejercicios propuestos por el banco</h3><p class="small">Se priorizan ejercicios adecuados al tipo de sesión y con menor uso reciente. La compatibilidad se basa en las zonas de vigilancia catalogadas; no garantiza seguridad clínica.</p><div id="plannerExerciseCandidates"></div><div id="plannerExerciseDetails"></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button type="submit">Guardar como sesión planificada</button><span id="plannerMessage" class="small"></span></div></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Sesiones futuras ya planificadas</h2><div id="plannerExistingPlans" class="small">Consultando…</div></section>`;
 plannerState.sessions=sessions;
 const candidateTarget=$('plannerExerciseCandidates'),detailTarget=$('plannerExerciseDetails');
 function initSuggestedSelection(){plannerState.selected.clear();if(plannerState.noExercise)return;const type=$('plannerSessionType').value;if(!sessionUsesExerciseBank(type))return;const choices=planCandidateExercises(type,$('plannerWeek').value,plannerState.history);choices.slice(0,3).forEach(x=>{const m=String(x.suggested_ce||'').match(/\((\d+)\)/);const reps=Number(x.suggested_reps||5);plannerState.selected.set(x.id,{sets:x.recommendedSets||3,reps,dose_unit:x.dose_unit||'repeticiones',external_load_kg:'',reps_possible:(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones'&&m?Number(m[1]):'',exercise_rpe:'',notes:''})})}
 function drawPlannerExercises(){const type=$('plannerSessionType').value;if(!sessionUsesExerciseBank(type)){candidateTarget.innerHTML='<div class="notice">Esta sesión no requiere selección de ejercicios del banco. La duración y el RPE global real se registrarán cuando se ejecute.</div>';detailTarget.innerHTML='';return}if(plannerState.noExercise){candidateTarget.innerHTML='<div class="notice error">No se muestran ejercicios automáticos por el indicador de dolor elevado. Consulta al entrenador y al profesional de salud antes de definir una actividad.</div>';detailTarget.innerHTML='';return}const choices=planCandidateExercises(type,$('plannerWeek').value,plannerState.history);if(!choices.length){candidateTarget.innerHTML='<div class="notice warn">No se encontró un ejercicio clasificado para este tipo de sesión. Se recomienda conversar con el entrenador para modificar el tipo de sesión o revisar el banco.</div>';detailTarget.innerHTML='';return}candidateTarget.innerHTML=choices.map(x=>`<div class="plan-exercise"><label><input type="checkbox" data-plan-exercise="${x.id}" ${plannerState.selected.has(x.id)?'checked':''}><span><strong>${esc(x.name)}</strong><br><span class="small">${esc(x.primary_area||'Zona no especificada')} · ${esc(x.level)} · ${esc(x.equipment||'Sin material especificado')}</span></span></label><div class="compatibility-line">${compatibilityBadge(x.compatibility)}</div><p class="small">${esc(x.description||'')} · Impacto: ${esc(x.impact_level||'No definido')}</p><p class="small">Dosificación de referencia: ${x.recommendedSets} × ${esc(x.suggested_reps||'—')} ${esc(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')} · CE ${esc(x.suggested_ce||'por definir')}. ${x.usage.count?`Uso previo: ${x.usage.count} · última vez ${esc(x.usage.last||'—')}`:'Sin uso previo registrado.'}</p></div>`).join('');detailTarget.innerHTML=Array.from(plannerState.selected.entries()).map(([id,v])=>{const x=exerciseCatalog.find(e=>e.id===id);if(!x)return '';const repsUnit=(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones';return `<div class="exercise-detail"><div class="row between"><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><button type="button" class="secondary action-btn" data-plan-remove="${id}">Quitar</button></div><div class="plan-fields"><div><label>Series</label><input type="number" min="1" data-plan-field="sets" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.sets)}"></div><div><label>${repsUnit?'Repeticiones':'Cantidad por serie'}</label><input type="number" min="1" data-plan-field="reps" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.reps)}"></div><div><label>Carga (kg)</label><input type="number" min="0" step="0.5" data-plan-field="external_load_kg" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.external_load_kg)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div><div><label>Repeticiones posibles</label><input type="number" min="1" data-plan-field="reps_possible" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.reps_possible)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div></div><div class="plan-fields"><div><label>RPE ejercicio</label><input type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.5" data-plan-field="exercise_rpe" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.exercise_rpe)}" placeholder="Opcional"></div><div class="full-span"><label>Observaciones</label><input type="text" data-plan-field="notes" data-plan-id="${id}" value="${esc(v.notes)}"></div></div><p class="small">CE propuesto: ${esc(v.reps_possible!==''&&repsUnit?`${v.reps}(${v.reps_possible})`:'Por definir')}. La carga externa se individualiza durante la sesión.</p></div>`}).join('')}
 initSuggestedSelection();drawPlannerExercises();
 $('plannerSessionType').onchange=()=>{plannerState.selected.clear();drawPlannerExercises()};$('plannerWeek').onchange=()=>{drawPlannerExercises()};
 candidateTarget.addEventListener('change',e=>{const cb=e.target.closest('[data-plan-exercise]');if(!cb)return;const id=cb.dataset.planExercise;if(cb.checked){const x=exerciseCatalog.find(y=>y.id===id);if(!x)return;const m=String(x.suggested_ce||'').match(/\((\d+)\)/);const reps=Number(x.suggested_reps||5);const phase=plannerPhaseAdvice($('plannerWeek').value);plannerState.selected.set(id,{sets:Math.max(1,Math.round(Number(x.suggested_sets||3)*phase.setsFactor)),reps,dose_unit:x.dose_unit||'repeticiones',external_load_kg:'',reps_possible:(x.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones'&&m?Number(m[1]):'',exercise_rpe:'',notes:''})}else plannerState.selected.delete(id);drawPlannerExercises()});
 detailTarget.addEventListener('input',e=>{const el=e.target,id=el.dataset.planId,field=el.dataset.planField;if(!id||!field||!plannerState.selected.has(id))return;plannerState.selected.get(id)[field]=el.value; if(field==='reps'||field==='reps_possible'){const holder=el.closest('.exercise-detail')?.querySelector('.small:last-child');const v=plannerState.selected.get(id);if(holder)holder.textContent='CE propuesto: '+(v.reps_possible!==''&&(v.dose_unit||'repeticiones')==='repeticiones'?`${v.reps}(${v.reps_possible})`:'Por definir')+'. La carga externa se individualiza durante la sesión.'}});
 detailTarget.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-plan-remove]');if(!b)return;plannerState.selected.delete(b.dataset.planRemove);drawPlannerExercises()});
 $('plannerForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();await savePlannedSession(e.currentTarget)};
 const future=sessions.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada').sort((a,b)=>String(a.session_date).localeCompare(String(b.session_date)));
 $('plannerExistingPlans').innerHTML=future.length?`<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Tipo de sesión</th><th>Semana</th><th>Duración prevista</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody>${future.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.session_date)}</td><td>${esc(x.session_type)}</td><td>${esc(x.week)}</td><td>${esc(x.duration_minutes)} min</td><td><span class="badge">Planificada</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="small">Para completar una sesión, ve a Sesiones → Editar, cambia el estado a “Realizada” e introduce la duración real y el RPE global.</p>`:'Todavía no hay sesiones futuras planificadas.';
}

async function viewEvaluation(c){
 const [s,w,t,d,i]=await Promise.all([fetchRows('training_sessions'),fetchRows('wellness_logs'),fetchRows('physical_tests'),fetchRows('load_decisions'),fetchRows('injuries')]);
 for(const result of [s,w,t,d,i])if(result.error)throw result.error;
 const sessions=s.data||[],wellness=w.data||[],tests=t.data||[],decisions=d.data||[],injuries=i.data||[];
 let html=`<section class="card"><h2>Evaluación del proceso de ocho semanas</h2><p class="muted">Resumen por semana para ${esc(currentHeader())}. Los espacios sin registros no se interpretan como ausencia de fatiga ni como mejora.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Semana</th><th>Etapa</th><th>Realizadas / planificadas</th><th>RPE medio</th><th>Fatiga media</th><th>Carga sRPE (UA)</th><th>Duración (min)</th><th>Pruebas</th><th>Decisiones</th></tr></thead><tbody>`;
 for(let wk=1;wk<=8;wk++){const ss=sessions.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===wk),ww=wellness.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===wk),tt=tests.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===wk),dd=decisions.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===wk);const mean=(arr,k)=>arr.length?(arr.reduce((z,x)=>z+Number(x[k]||0),0)/arr.length).toFixed(1):'—';const validSessions=ss.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null);const wkLoad=validSessions.length?sumLoadAU(validSessions).toFixed(1):'—';const wkMinutes=validSessions.length?validSessions.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.duration_minutes||0),0):'—';html+=`<tr><td>${wk}</td><td>${phaseName(wk)}</td><td>${ss.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada').length} / ${ss.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada').length}</td><td>${mean(ss.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'),'session_rpe')}</td><td>${mean(ww,'fatigue')}</td><td>${wkLoad}</td><td>${wkMinutes}</td><td>${tt.length}</td><td>${dd.length}</td></tr>`}
 html+=`</tbody></table></div><p class="small">Carga interna de sesión (sRPE): RPE global × duración en minutos. Registra todas las sesiones de la semana (fuerza, trabajo técnico-táctico, combate simulado y sesiones dobles) para que la suma sea representativa. La suma semanal es descriptiva; no se interpreta de forma aislada ni como umbral de riesgo.</p></section>`;
 html+=`<section class="card"><h2>Carga interna por semanas · sRPE</h2><p class="small">Carga acumulada de las sesiones realizadas. Las semanas sin registros completos aparecen sin datos y no se interpretan como carga cero.</p>${weeklyLoadBars(sessions)}</section>`;
 html+=`<div class="chart-grid">${buildHorizontalBarChart('Sesiones por tipo','Qué tipos de sesión se realizaron durante el proceso.',sessionTypeDistribution(sessions),'sesiones')}${buildDonutChart('Distribución por etapa','Sesiones registradas en adaptación, aumento, punto álgido y tapering.',phaseDistribution(sessions),'sesiones')}${buildDonutChart('Estado de lesiones','Situación de los antecedentes de lesión registrados.',injuryStatusDistribution(injuries),'registros')}</div>`;
 const byName={};for(const x of tests){(byName[x.test_name]??=[]).push(x)}let comparisons='';for(const [name,arr] of Object.entries(byName)){arr.sort((a,b)=>new Date(a.test_date)-new Date(b.test_date));const first=arr[0],last=arr[arr.length-1];let delta=arr.length>1&&Number(first.result_value)!==0?((Number(last.result_value)-Number(first.result_value))/Math.abs(Number(first.result_value))*100).toFixed(1)+'%':arr.length>1?'No calculable':'Sin comparación';comparisons+=`<tr><td>${esc(name)}</td><td>${esc(first.result_value)} ${esc(first.unit)}</td><td>${esc(last.result_value)} ${esc(last.unit)}</td><td>${delta}</td><td>${arr.length}</td></tr>`}
 html+=`<section class="card"><h2>Comparación de pruebas físicas</h2><p class="small">La variación porcentual es descriptiva. En pruebas donde un menor tiempo representa mejora, la dirección del cambio debe interpretarse al revés. Verifica que el protocolo y las unidades sean iguales.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Prueba</th><th>Primer resultado</th><th>Último resultado</th><th>Variación</th><th>Mediciones</th></tr></thead><tbody>${comparisons||`<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Aún no hay pruebas registradas.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></div></section>`;
 c.innerHTML=html;
}
async function saveForm(formId,tableName,mapper){const form=$(formId);form.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(form),o=mapper(Object.fromEntries(f.entries()));if(!activeAthleteId()){note(formId+'Msg','No hay un perfil deportivo vinculado/seleccionado.','error');return}o.athlete_id=activeAthleteId();const {error}=await db.from(tableName).insert(o);if(error){note(formId+'Msg','No se pudo guardar: '+error.message,'error');return}note(formId+'Msg','Registro guardado correctamente.','good');form.reset();await render()}}
function n(v){return v===''||v==null?null:Number(v)}
function dateToday(){return new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}
function setupForms(){if(tab==='injuries')saveForm('injuryForm','injuries',o=>({...o,recovery_days:n(o.recovery_days),current_pain:n(o.current_pain)}));if(tab==='wellness')saveForm('wellnessForm','wellness_logs',o=>({...o,week:n(o.week),...Object.fromEntries(['fatigue','sleep_quality','muscle_soreness','pain_level','stress','motivation'].map(k=>[k,n(o[k])]))}));if(tab==='sessions')setupSessionForm();if(tab==='tests')saveForm('testForm','physical_tests',o=>({...o,week:n(o.week),result_value:n(o.result_value)}));if(tab==='decisions'&&profile.role==='coach')saveForm('decisionForm','load_decisions',o=>({...o,week:n(o.week)}));for(const f of document.querySelectorAll('input[type=date]'))if(!f.value)f.value=dateToday();setupRecordActions()}

/* ===== Dashboard calendar + workout statistics ===== */
let dashboardCalendarMonth=new Date();dashboardCalendarMonth.setDate(1);
let dashboardSelectedDate=localISODate();
function parseLocalISODate(value){if(!value)return null;const a=String(value).slice(0,10).split('-').map(Number);if(a.length!==3||!a[0]||!a[1]||!a[2])return null;return new Date(a[0],a[1]-1,a[2],12,0,0)}
function isoLocalDate(d){return `${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`}
function prettyDate(value,options={weekday:'short',day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}){const d=parseLocalISODate(value);return d?new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-CO',options).format(d):'Fecha no registrada'}
function calendarMarkup(sessions){
 const year=dashboardCalendarMonth.getFullYear(),month=dashboardCalendarMonth.getMonth();
 const first=new Date(year,month,1,12),days=new Date(year,month+1,0,12).getDate(),offset=(first.getDay()+6)%7;
 const map=new Map();for(const x of sessions||[]){if(!x.session_date)continue;if(!map.has(x.session_date))map.set(x.session_date,[]);map.get(x.session_date).push(x)}
 const today=localISODate();
 if(!dashboardSelectedDate||!dashboardSelectedDate.startsWith(`${year}-${String(month+1).padStart(2,'0')}`))dashboardSelectedDate=today.startsWith(`${year}-${String(month+1).padStart(2,'0')}`)?today:isoLocalDate(new Date(year,month,1,12));
 let cells='';for(let i=0;i<offset;i++)cells+='<div class="calendar-day is-outside" aria-hidden="true"></div>';
 for(let day=1;day<=days;day++){
  const date=isoLocalDate(new Date(year,month,day,12)),events=map.get(date)||[],done=events.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada').length,planned=events.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada').length;
  const cls=['calendar-day',date===today?'is-today':'',date===dashboardSelectedDate?'is-selected':''].filter(Boolean).join(' ');
  cells+=`<button type="button" class="${cls}" data-calendar-day="${date}" aria-label="${date}, ${events.length} sesión(es)"><span class="day-num">${day}</span><span class="event-count">${events.length?`${events.length} ${events.length===1?'sesión':'sesiones'}`:' '}</span><span class="calendar-dots">${done?'<i class="calendar-dot done"></i>':''}${planned?'<i class="calendar-dot plan"></i>':''}</span></button>`;
 }
 const remainder=(offset+days)%7;if(remainder)for(let i=remainder;i<7;i++)cells+='<div class="calendar-day is-outside" aria-hidden="true"></div>';
 const selectedEvents=(map.get(dashboardSelectedDate)||[]).slice().sort((a,b)=>String(a.session_date).localeCompare(String(b.session_date)));
 const details=selectedEvents.length?selectedEvents.map(x=>`<div class="calendar-event"><div><strong>${esc(x.session_type||'Sesión sin clasificar')}</strong><div class="small">Semana ${esc(x.week??'—')} · ${x.duration_minutes==null?'Duración pendiente':esc(x.duration_minutes)+' min'}${x.session_rpe==null?'':` · RPE ${esc(x.session_rpe)}`}</div></div><span class="calendar-status ${x.session_status==='Planificada'?'plan':'done'}">${x.session_status==='Planificada'?'Planificada':'Realizada'}</span></div>`).join(''):`<div class="empty">No hay sesiones registradas para este día.</div>`;
 const title=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-CO',{month:'long',year:'numeric'}).format(first);
 return `<section class="card"><div class="row between"><div><h2>Calendario de entrenamiento</h2><p class="small">Consulta las sesiones programadas y realizadas.</p></div><span class="badge">${sessions.length} registros</span></div><div class="calendar-top"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-calendar-prev aria-label="Mes anterior">‹</button><div class="calendar-title">${esc(title)}</div><button type="button" class="secondary" data-calendar-next aria-label="Mes siguiente">›</button></div><div class="calendar-grid">${['Lun','Mar','Mié','Jue','Vie','Sáb','Dom'].map(x=>`<div class="calendar-weekday">${x}</div>`).join('')}${cells}</div><div class="calendar-legend"><span><i class="calendar-dot done"></i> Realizada</span><span><i class="calendar-dot plan"></i> Planificada</span><span><i class="calendar-dot" style="background:#8bb9ed"></i> Hoy / seleccionado</span></div><div class="calendar-day-detail"><strong>${esc(prettyDate(dashboardSelectedDate,{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric'}))}</strong>${details}</div></section>`;
}
function mountDashboardCalendar(sessions){
 const host=$('dashboardCalendar');if(!host)return;const draw=()=>{host.innerHTML=calendarMarkup(sessions);host.querySelector('[data-calendar-prev]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{dashboardCalendarMonth.setMonth(dashboardCalendarMonth.getMonth()-1);draw()});host.querySelector('[data-calendar-next]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{dashboardCalendarMonth.setMonth(dashboardCalendarMonth.getMonth()+1);draw()});host.querySelectorAll('[data-calendar-day]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{dashboardSelectedDate=b.dataset.calendarDay;draw()}))};draw();
}
function weeklyLoadBars(sessions){
 const weeks=Array.from({length:8},(_,i)=>{const week=i+1,list=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>Number(x.week)===week&&sessionLoadAU(x)!=null);return {week,phase:phaseName(week),value:list.length?sumLoadAU(list):null,count:list.length}});
 const max=Math.max(1,...weeks.map(x=>x.value??0));
 return `<div class="weekly-bars horizontal-bars">${weeks.map(x=>{const pct=x.value==null?0:x.value/max*100;return `<div class="horizontal-bar-row"><div class="horizontal-bar-label"><strong>Semana ${x.week}</strong><span class="horizontal-bar-sub">${esc(x.phase)}${x.count?` · ${x.count} sesión(es)`:''}</span></div><div class="horizontal-bar-track ${x.value==null?'no-data':''}" role="img" aria-label="Semana ${x.week}: ${x.value==null?'sin datos':x.value.toFixed(1)+' unidades arbitrarias'}"><div class="horizontal-bar-fill load" style="width:${pct.toFixed(1)}%"></div></div><div class="horizontal-bar-value">${x.value==null?'—':x.value.toFixed(1)+' UA'}</div></div>`}).join('')}</div>`;
}
function workoutStatsMarkup(sessions,exerciseRows){
 const today=localISODate(),startDate=parseLocalISODate(today);startDate.setDate(startDate.getDate()-6);const start=isoLocalDate(startDate);
 const period=(sessions||[]).filter(x=>x.session_date>=start&&x.session_date<=today),done=period.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'),planned=period.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada');
 const valid=done.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null),load=valid.length?sumLoadAU(valid):null,minutes=done.reduce((a,x)=>a+(x.duration_minutes==null?0:Number(x.duration_minutes)),0),rpe=done.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null),avgRpe=rpe.length?(rpe.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.session_rpe),0)/rpe.length).toFixed(1):'—';
 const doneIds=new Set(done.map(x=>x.id));const setCount=(exerciseRows||[]).filter(x=>doneIds.has(x.session_id)).reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.sets||0),0);
 const metric=(label,value,detail)=>`<div class="dashboard-stat"><div class="label">${label}</div><div class="kpi">${value}</div><div class="detail">${detail}</div></div>`;
 return `<section class="card"><div class="row between"><div><h2>Indicadores de entrenamiento</h2><p class="small">Actividad de los últimos siete días · ${prettyDate(start,{day:'2-digit',month:'short'})} a ${prettyDate(today,{day:'2-digit',month:'short'})}</p></div><span class="badge">Resumen semanal</span></div><div class="dashboard-stat-grid">${metric('Sesiones realizadas',done.length,`${planned.length} planificada(s) pendientes`)}${metric('Tiempo de entrenamiento',minutes?minutes+' min':'—', 'Tiempo registrado en sesiones realizadas')}${metric('Carga interna sRPE',load==null?'—':load.toFixed(1)+' UA',`${valid.length} sesión(es) con RPE y duración`)}${metric('RPE medio',avgRpe,`${rpe.length} sesión(es) con RPE registrado`)}${metric('Series de ejercicios',setCount||'—',setCount?'Series de ejercicios completadas':'Sin detalle de ejercicios en el periodo')}${metric('Sesiones del periodo',done.length+planned.length,`${done.length} realizadas · ${planned.length} planificadas`)}</div><div class="section"><div class="row between"><strong>Carga interna por semana · 8 semanas</strong><span class="small">UA</span></div>${weeklyLoadBars(sessions)}</div><p class="dashboard-note">La carga sRPE se calcula como RPE global × duración en minutos. Se muestran las sesiones con ambos datos completos; las sesiones planificadas no se suman como carga realizada. Las semanas sin registros aparecen sin datos, no como carga cero.</p></section>`;
}
async function viewOverview(c){
 const [w,s,t,i,ex]=await Promise.all([fetchRows('wellness_logs',1000),fetchRows('training_sessions',1000),fetchRows('physical_tests',1000),fetchRows('injuries',1000),db.from('training_session_exercises').select('id,session_id,athlete_id,sets,reps').eq('athlete_id',activeAthleteId()).limit(2000)]);
 for(const result of [w,s,t,i])if(result.error)throw result.error;
 const wellness=w.data||[],sessions=s.data||[],tests=t.data||[],injuries=i.data||[],exerciseRows=ex.error?[]:(ex.data||[]);
 const activeInjuries=injuries.filter(x=>x.status==='Activa'||x.status==='En recuperación').length;
 const summaryAthlete=profile.role==='coach'?athletes.find(a=>a.id===selectedId):athleteProfile;
 const initials=String(summaryAthlete?.full_name||'D').trim().split(/\s+/).slice(0,2).map(x=>x[0]||'').join('').toUpperCase();
 const hero=`<section class="athlete-hero"><div class="athlete-identity"><div class="athlete-avatar">${esc(initials)}</div><div><div class="eyebrow">SEGUIMIENTO INDIVIDUAL</div><h2>${esc(currentHeader())}</h2><div class="hero-subtitle">${esc(summaryAthlete?.weight_category||'Categoría no registrada')} · ${esc(athleteAgeText(summaryAthlete))} · ${esc(summaryAthlete?.strength_experience||'Experiencia no registrada')} en fuerza</div></div></div><div class="hero-tags"><span>${summaryAthlete?.sport_experience_years==null?'Experiencia no registrada':esc(summaryAthlete.sport_experience_years)+' años de experiencia'}</span><span>${summaryAthlete?.strength_days==null?'Frecuencia variable':esc(summaryAthlete.strength_days)+' sesiones de fuerza/semana'}</span></div></section>`;
 const description=profile.role==='coach'?'Indicadores del deportista seleccionado. Cambia de perfil desde el selector superior para consultar a otro integrante.':'Indicadores de tu proceso individual de entrenamiento.';
 const stats=`<div class="overview-kpi-grid"><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">REGISTROS DE BIENESTAR</div><div class="kpi-value">${wellness.length}</div><div class="kpi-detail">Cuestionarios registrados</div></div><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">SESIONES DE ENTRENAMIENTO</div><div class="kpi-value">${sessions.length}</div><div class="kpi-detail">Realizadas y planificadas</div></div><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">PRUEBAS FÍSICAS</div><div class="kpi-value">${tests.length}</div><div class="kpi-detail">Mediciones registradas</div></div><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">LESIONES EN SEGUIMIENTO</div><div class="kpi-value ${activeInjuries?'caution':''}">${activeInjuries}</div><div class="kpi-detail">Activas o en recuperación</div></div></div>`;
 const summary=hero+`<section class="card overview-summary"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">VISTA GENERAL</div><h2>Indicadores del proceso</h2><p class="small">${description}</p></div><span class="badge soft-badge">8 semanas</span></div>${stats}<div class="notice">Las etapas del macrociclo orientan la programación. Las decisiones de carga deben considerar la respuesta individual, el carácter del esfuerzo, el bienestar y la ejecución técnica.</div></section>`;
 const dashboard=`<div class="dashboard-split"><div id="dashboardCalendar"></div><div>${workoutStatsMarkup(sessions,exerciseRows)}</div></div>`;
 const seven=recentSevenDayLoad(sessions),totalLoad=sumLoadAU(sessions),validLoads=sessions.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null).length;
 const loadPanel=panel('Monitoreo de carga interna acumulada',`<div class="overview-kpi-grid"><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">CARGA ACUMULADA</div><div class="kpi-value">${validLoads?totalLoad.toFixed(1):'—'}</div><div class="kpi-detail">UA · ${validLoads} sesión(es) completas</div></div><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">ÚLTIMOS SIETE DÍAS REGISTRADOS</div><div class="kpi-value">${seven.total==null?'—':seven.total.toFixed(1)}</div><div class="kpi-detail">UA · ${seven.count} sesión(es)</div></div><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">CÁLCULO DE CARGA</div><div class="kpi-value">RPE × min</div><div class="kpi-detail">sRPE por sesión</div></div><div class="overview-kpi"><div class="kpi-label">TIEMPO REGISTRADO</div><div class="kpi-value">${sessions.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'&&x.duration_minutes!=null).reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.duration_minutes||0),0)}</div><div class="kpi-detail">Minutos en sesiones realizadas</div></div></div><p class="small">La sRPE estima carga interna percibida y se interpreta junto con bienestar, rendimiento y contexto de lucha. Las sesiones planificadas no se suman como carga realizada.</p>`);
 const attention=[];if(activeInjuries)attention.push(`${activeInjuries} antecedente(s) con estado activo o en recuperación: revisar el estado actual y las restricciones registradas.`);const pending=sessions.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada').length;if(pending)attention.push(`${pending} sesión(es) permanecen planificadas y todavía no cuentan como carga realizada.`);if(!wellness.length)attention.push('No hay registros de bienestar disponibles para este deportista.');else{const latest=wellness.slice().sort((a,b)=>String(b.log_date||'').localeCompare(String(a.log_date||'')))[0];attention.push(`Último registro de bienestar: ${latest.log_date||'fecha no registrada'}.`)}
 const attentionPanel=`<section class="card attention-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">REVISIÓN DEL ENTRENADOR</div><h2>Datos que conviene revisar</h2><p class="small">Recordatorios basados en la información registrada; no son diagnósticos ni alertas clínicas.</p></div></div><div class="attention-list">${attention.map(x=>`<div class="attention-item"><i class="attention-mark"></i><span>${esc(x)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></section>`;
 const charts=`<div class="chart-grid">${buildHorizontalBarChart('Sesiones por tipo','Distribución de las sesiones registradas según su clasificación.',sessionTypeDistribution(sessions),'sesiones')}${buildDonutChart('Sesiones por etapa','Distribución de sesiones según la semana indicada en cada registro.',phaseDistribution(sessions),'sesiones')}${buildDonutChart('Estado de lesiones','Distribución de los antecedentes registrados en el perfil.',injuryStatusDistribution(injuries),'registros')}</div>`;
 c.innerHTML=summary+dashboard+loadPanel+attentionPanel+charts;mountDashboardCalendar(sessions);
}

/* ===== Informe individual de ocho semanas, listo para imprimir/guardar como PDF ===== */
function reportSvgBars(weekly){
 const values=weekly.map(x=>x.load),max=Math.max(1,...values.filter(x=>x!=null)),W=760,H=230,left=42,bottom=190,barW=48,gap=39;let svg=`<svg viewBox="0 0 ${W} ${H}" role="img" aria-label="Carga sRPE por semana"><line x1="${left}" y1="${bottom}" x2="735" y2="${bottom}" stroke="#b9c7d6"/>`;
 weekly.forEach((x,i)=>{const v=x.load,h=v==null?0:Math.max(3,(v/max)*132),px=left+14+i*(barW+gap),py=bottom-h;svg+=`<rect x="${px}" y="${py}" width="${barW}" height="${h}" rx="5" fill="${v==null?'#e4eaf1':'#3478c5'}" ${v==null?'stroke="#aab8c7" stroke-dasharray="4 3"':''}/><text x="${px+barW/2}" y="${Math.max(17,py-7)}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#52677f">${v==null?'—':Math.round(v)}</text><text x="${px+barW/2}" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#52677f">S${i+1}</text>`});
 return svg+'</svg>';
}
function reportFatigueSvg(weekly){
 const pts=weekly.filter(x=>x.fatigue!=null),W=760,H=190,left=45,right=725,top=22,bottom=148;
 if(!pts.length)return '<div class="report-empty">Sin registros de bienestar suficientes para representar la fatiga.</div>';
 const coords=pts.map(x=>({x:left+(x.week-1)*(right-left)/7,y:bottom-(x.fatigue/10)*(bottom-top),label:x.week,val:x.fatigue}));
 let segments=[],current=[];
 for(const point of coords){if(current.length&&point.label!==current[current.length-1].label+1){if(current.length>1)segments.push(current);current=[];}current.push(point);}
 if(current.length>1)segments.push(current);
 let svg=`<svg viewBox="0 0 ${W} ${H}" role="img" aria-label="Tendencia de fatiga"><line x1="${left}" y1="${bottom}" x2="${right}" y2="${bottom}" stroke="#b9c7d6"/><line x1="${left}" y1="${top}" x2="${right}" y2="${top}" stroke="#e0e6ed"/><text x="8" y="${top+4}" font-size="11" fill="#52677f">10</text><text x="18" y="${bottom+4}" font-size="11" fill="#52677f">0</text>${segments.map(segment=>`<polyline points="${segment.map(point=>`${point.x},${point.y}`).join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="#d09a31" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>`).join('')}`;
 coords.forEach(point=>{svg+=`<circle cx="${point.x}" cy="${point.y}" r="5" fill="#d09a31"/><text x="${point.x}" y="${point.y-10}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#52677f">${point.val.toFixed(1)}</text><text x="${point.x}" y="172" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#52677f">S${point.label}</text>`;});
 return svg+'</svg>';
}
async function openEightWeekPdfReport(){
 const win=window.open('','_blank');if(!win){alert('El navegador bloqueó la ventana del informe. Permite las ventanas emergentes para este sitio y vuelve a intentarlo.');return}
 win.document.write('<!doctype html><html lang="es"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Preparando informe</title><body style="font-family:Arial;padding:30px;color:#31455e">Preparando el informe del deportista…</body></html>');
 try{
  const athlete=profile.role==='coach'?athletes.find(a=>a.id===selectedId):athleteProfile;
  const [sr,wr,tr,dr,ir,er]=await Promise.all([fetchRows('training_sessions',1000),fetchRows('wellness_logs',1000),fetchRows('physical_tests',1000),fetchRows('load_decisions',1000),fetchRows('injuries',1000),db.from('training_session_exercises').select('id,session_id,athlete_id,exercise_id,sets,reps,dose_unit,external_load_kg,effort_character,exercise_rpe,notes,exercise_catalog(name),training_sessions(session_date,week,session_type,session_status,duration_minutes,session_rpe)').eq('athlete_id',activeAthleteId()).limit(2000)]);
  for(const r of [sr,wr,tr,dr,ir])if(r.error)throw r.error;if(er.error)throw er.error;
  const sessions=sr.data||[],wellness=wr.data||[],tests=tr.data||[],decisions=dr.data||[],injuries=ir.data||[],exerciseRows=er.data||[];
  const weekly=Array.from({length:8},(_,i)=>{const week=i+1,ss=sessions.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===week),done=ss.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'),planned=ss.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada'),valid=done.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null),ww=wellness.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===week),mean=k=>ww.length?ww.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x[k]||0),0)/ww.length:null;return {week,phase:phaseName(week),done:done.length,planned:planned.length,load:valid.length?sumLoadAU(valid):null,minutes:done.some(x=>x.duration_minutes!=null)?done.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.duration_minutes||0),0):null,avgRpe:done.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null).length?done.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null).reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.session_rpe),0)/done.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null).length:null,fatigue:ww.length?mean('fatigue'):null,sleep:ww.length?mean('sleep_quality'):null,sessions:ss,tests:tests.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===week),decisions:decisions.filter(x=>Number(x.week)===week)}});
  const completed=sessions.filter(x=>x.session_status!=='Planificada'),planned=sessions.filter(x=>x.session_status==='Planificada'),valid=completed.filter(x=>sessionLoadAU(x)!=null),totalLoad=valid.length?sumLoadAU(valid):null,totalMinutes=completed.reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.duration_minutes||0),0),avgRpe=completed.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null).length?completed.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null).reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x.session_rpe),0)/completed.filter(x=>x.session_rpe!=null).length:null;
  const reportAge=calculateAge(athlete?.birth_date,new Date());const meta=[['Nombre',athlete?.full_name||currentHeader()],['Edad',reportAge==null?'No registrada':reportAge+' años'],['Fecha de nacimiento',athlete?.birth_date||'No registrada'],['Categoría',athlete?.weight_category||'No registrada'],['Sexo',athlete?.sex||'No registrado'],['Experiencia deportiva',athlete?.sport_experience_years!=null?athlete.sport_experience_years+' años':'No registrada'],['Experiencia en fuerza',athlete?.strength_experience||'No registrada'],['Frecuencia de fuerza',athlete?.strength_days!=null?athlete.strength_days+' días/semana':'Variable / no registrada']];
  const escRows=arr=>arr.map(x=>`<tr>${x.map(v=>`<td>${esc(v??'—')}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('');
  const weekRows=weekly.map(x=>[x.week,x.phase,`${x.done} / ${x.planned}`,x.avgRpe==null?'—':x.avgRpe.toFixed(1),x.fatigue==null?'—':x.fatigue.toFixed(1),x.load==null?'—':x.load.toFixed(1),x.minutes==null?'—':x.minutes, x.tests.length,x.decisions.length]);
  const testMap=new Map();for(const t of tests){if(!testMap.has(t.test_name))testMap.set(t.test_name,[]);testMap.get(t.test_name).push(t)}
  const testRows=Array.from(testMap,([name,arr])=>{arr.sort((a,b)=>String(a.test_date).localeCompare(String(b.test_date)));const first=arr[0],last=arr[arr.length-1],delta=arr.length>1&&Number(first.result_value)!==0?((Number(last.result_value)-Number(first.result_value))/Math.abs(Number(first.result_value))*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'Sin comparación';return [name,`${first.result_value} ${first.unit||''}`,`${last.result_value} ${last.unit||''}`,delta,arr.length]});
  const completedExerciseRows=exerciseRows.filter(x=>x.training_sessions?.session_status!=='Planificada');
  const exerciseRowsHtml=completedExerciseRows.slice().sort((a,b)=>String(a.training_sessions?.session_date||'').localeCompare(String(b.training_sessions?.session_date||''))).map(x=>[x.training_sessions?.session_date||'—',x.training_sessions?.week||'—',x.training_sessions?.session_type||'—',x.exercise_catalog?.name||'Ejercicio',`${x.sets} × ${x.reps} ${x.dose_unit||'repeticiones'}`,x.external_load_kg==null?'—':x.external_load_kg+' kg',x.effort_character||'—',x.exercise_rpe??'—']);
  const injuryRows=injuries.map(x=>[x.body_area,x.injury_type,x.injury_grade,x.laterality,x.onset_date,x.status,x.current_pain==null?'—':x.current_pain+'/10',x.restrictions,x.professional_guidance]);
  const decisionRows=decisions.map(x=>[x.decision_date,x.week,x.action,x.rationale]);
  const sessionRows=sessions.slice().sort((a,b)=>String(a.session_date).localeCompare(String(b.session_date))).map(x=>[x.session_date,x.week,x.session_type||'Sin tipo',x.session_status||'Realizada',x.duration_minutes==null?'—':x.duration_minutes+' min',x.session_rpe??'—',sessionLoadAU(x)==null?(x.session_status==='Planificada'?'Pendiente':'Sin datos'):sessionLoadAU(x).toFixed(1)+' UA']);
  const weeklyCoverage=weekly.filter(x=>x.done||x.planned||x.fatigue!=null||x.tests.length||x.decisions.length).length;
  const generated=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-CO',{dateStyle:'long'}).format(new Date());
  const doc=`<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Informe de entrenamiento - ${esc(athlete?.full_name||currentHeader())}</title><style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}body{font:12px/1.45 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#26384d;margin:0;background:#fff}main{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 34px}.cover{border-bottom:4px solid #3478c5;padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:20px}.eyebrow{color:#3478c5;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.cover h1{font-size:27px;margin:5px 0;color:#193e63}.muted{color:#687b90}.meta-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;margin:16px 0}.meta{padding:10px;background:#f2f6fa;border:1px solid #dce5ef;border-radius:8px}.meta b{display:block;color:#71849a;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase}.meta span{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px;margin:15px 0}.kpi{padding:11px;border:1px solid #dce5ef;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f9fc}.kpi b{font-size:20px;color:#245b91;display:block}.kpi span{font-size:9px;color:#6b7d91}.section{margin:20px 0;break-inside:auto}.section h2{font-size:16px;color:#214b75;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5ef;padding-bottom:6px;margin:0 0 9px}.section h3{font-size:13px;color:#315d88;margin:14px 0 6px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:10px;margin:8px 0 10px}th,td{padding:6px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{background:#f0f5fa;color:#4d6278;font-weight:700}.table-wrap{overflow:visible}.note{padding:10px 12px;background:#f2f7fc;border-left:3px solid #3478c5;margin:10px 0}.warning{padding:10px 12px;background:#fff8e8;border-left:3px solid #c18a23;margin:10px 0}.chart{border:1px solid #e1e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin:10px 0}.chart svg{width:100%;height:auto}.empty{color:#8796a7;font-style:italic}.footer{margin-top:24px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #dce5ef;font-size:9px;color:#74869a}.page-break{break-before:page;page-break-before:always}.keep{break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid}.small{font-size:9px;color:#73849a}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px}.actions button{border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:10px 14px;background:#286baa;color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}.actions button.secondary{background:#eaf0f7;color:#29455f}@page{size:A4;margin:13mm}@media print{body{print-color-adjust:exact;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact}.actions{display:none!important}main{padding:0;max-width:none}.section{break-inside:auto}.keep{break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid}}

  .cover{position:relative;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:25px 28px 22px;margin-bottom:22px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#132b47,#245b91);color:#fff;overflow:hidden}.cover:after{content:"LF";position:absolute;right:22px;top:10px;font-size:94px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:rgba(255,255,255,.07);letter-spacing:-.08em}.cover .eyebrow,.cover .muted,.cover .small{color:#d8e8f8}.cover h1{color:#fff;max-width:680px}.meta{border:0;border-top:2px solid #3478c5;box-shadow:0 2px 9px #18324a0a}.kpi{border:0;border-top:2px solid #3478c5;box-shadow:0 2px 9px #18324a0a}.section h2{letter-spacing:-.01em}.note{border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}.warning{border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}.chart{border-radius:10px;background:#fbfcfe}.footer{letter-spacing:.02em}
  </style></head><body><main><div class="actions"><button onclick="window.print()">Guardar como PDF / Imprimir</button><button class="secondary" onclick="window.close()">Cerrar informe</button><span class="small" style="align-self:center">En el diálogo de impresión, selecciona “Guardar como PDF”.</span></div>
  <header class="cover"><div class="eyebrow">Control de fuerza en lucha · Informe individual</div><h1>Evaluación del proceso de ocho semanas</h1><div class="muted">Deportista: <b>${esc(athlete?.full_name||currentHeader())}</b> · Generado el ${esc(generated)}</div><div class="small">Informe elaborado a partir de los registros disponibles en la plataforma. No sustituye la interpretación del entrenador.</div></header>
  <section class="section"><h2>1. Caracterización del deportista</h2><div class="meta-grid">${meta.map(([k,v])=>`<div class="meta"><b>${esc(k)}</b><span>${esc(v)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><p class="small">La edad se calcula a partir de la fecha de nacimiento registrada y corresponde a la fecha de generación de este informe.</p><div class="note">El proceso se organiza en ocho semanas: adaptación (1–2), aumento (3–4), punto álgido (5–6) y tapering (7–8). La periodización es una estructura orientativa; las decisiones se interpretan según la respuesta individual.</div></section>
  <section class="section"><h2>2. Indicadores globales del proceso</h2><div class="kpis"><div class="kpi"><b>${completed.length}</b><span>Sesiones realizadas</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>${planned.length}</b><span>Sesiones planificadas pendientes</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>${totalLoad==null?'—':totalLoad.toFixed(1)+' UA'}</b><span>Carga sRPE acumulada con datos completos</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>${avgRpe==null?'—':avgRpe.toFixed(1)+'/10'}</b><span>RPE medio de sesiones realizadas</span></div></div><p class="small">Cobertura de semanas con al menos un registro: ${weeklyCoverage}/8. Una semana sin datos no equivale a una semana sin carga o sin fatiga.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><h2>3. Seguimiento semanal de las ocho semanas</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Sem.</th><th>Etapa</th><th>Realizadas / planificadas</th><th>RPE medio</th><th>Fatiga media</th><th>Carga UA</th><th>Minutos</th><th>Pruebas</th><th>Decisiones</th></tr></thead><tbody>${escRows(weekRows)}</tbody></table></div><p class="small">Carga sRPE por sesión = RPE global × duración real en minutos. Solo se suman sesiones realizadas con ambos datos disponibles.</p></section>
  <section class="section keep"><h2>4. Distribución de carga interna semanal</h2><div class="chart">${reportSvgBars(weekly)}</div><p class="small">Las barras sin valor indican ausencia de registros completos de carga en esa semana.</p></section>
  <section class="section keep"><h2>5. Evolución de bienestar: fatiga percibida</h2><div class="chart">${reportFatigueSvg(weekly)}</div><p class="small">Se muestra el promedio de los registros de fatiga de cada semana, en escala 1–10. No se imputan valores en semanas sin registros.</p></section>
  <section class="section page-break"><h2>6. Sesiones registradas</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sem.</th><th>Tipo de sesión</th><th>Estado</th><th>Duración</th><th>RPE</th><th>Carga</th></tr></thead><tbody>${sessionRows.length?escRows(sessionRows):'<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">No hay sesiones registradas.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="section"><h2>7. Detalle de ejercicios realizados</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sem.</th><th>Tipo de sesión</th><th>Ejercicio</th><th>Series × reps</th><th>Carga</th><th>CE</th><th>RPE ej.</th></tr></thead><tbody>${exerciseRowsHtml.length?escRows(exerciseRowsHtml):'<tr><td colspan="8" class="empty">No hay detalles de ejercicios registrados.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="section page-break"><h2>8. Evaluación de pruebas físicas</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Prueba</th><th>Primer resultado</th><th>Último resultado</th><th>Variación</th><th>N.º registros</th></tr></thead><tbody>${testRows.length?escRows(testRows):'<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">No hay pruebas físicas registradas.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><p class="small">La variación porcentual es descriptiva. En pruebas cronometradas, una reducción del tiempo puede representar mejora. Para comparar se requiere mantener el mismo protocolo, unidades y condiciones.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><h2>9. Historial de lesiones</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Zona</th><th>Lesión</th><th>Grado</th><th>Lateralidad</th><th>Fecha</th><th>Estado</th><th>Dolor</th><th>Restricciones</th><th>Orientación profesional</th></tr></thead><tbody>${injuryRows.length?escRows(injuryRows):'<tr><td colspan="9" class="empty">No hay lesiones registradas.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><p class="small">La presencia de un antecedente no determina por sí sola la exclusión de ejercicios. Las restricciones deben interpretarse según el estado actual y la orientación profesional registrada.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><h2>10. Decisiones y ajustes del entrenador</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Semana</th><th>Decisión</th><th>Justificación registrada</th></tr></thead><tbody>${decisionRows.length?escRows(decisionRows):'<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">No hay decisiones registradas.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="section"><h2>11. Consideraciones para la interpretación</h2><div class="warning">Este informe compila datos registrados en la aplicación. La ausencia de registros no debe interpretarse como ausencia de entrenamiento, fatiga o lesión. Verifica la integridad de los datos, la consistencia de los protocolos y el contexto técnico-táctico antes de extraer conclusiones.</div><p>La carga sRPE es un indicador de carga interna percibida y debe analizarse junto con bienestar, rendimiento, carácter del esfuerzo, programación y observación técnica. No constituye por sí sola un umbral universal de lesión ni una orden automática de modificar la carga.</p></section>
  <div class="footer">Control de fuerza en lucha · Documento académico individual · Datos personales y registros deportivos: conservar y compartir de forma responsable.</div></main></body></html>`;
  win.document.open();win.document.write(doc);win.document.close();
 }catch(err){win.close();alert('No se pudo generar el informe: '+(err.message||err));}
}


const originalViewEvaluationForReport=viewEvaluation;
viewEvaluation=async function(c){
 await originalViewEvaluationForReport(c);
 const heading=c.querySelector('.card');
 if(heading){const actions=document.createElement('div');actions.className='report-actions';actions.innerHTML='<button type="button" class="report-button" id="generatePdfReport">Generar informe individual en PDF</button>';heading.insertAdjacentElement('beforebegin',actions);}
 const btn=$('generatePdfReport');if(btn)btn.onclick=()=>openEightWeekPdfReport();
};
const oldRender=render;render=async function(){await oldRender();setupForms()};
restoreConfig();
</script>
</body></html>
